#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:8
msgid "Typed I/O: devices and execution contracts"
msgstr "类型化 I/O：设备与执行合同"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:10
msgid ""
"These declarations come from public header files. Selection, lifecycle, "
"supported execution modes and physical authorization remain bounded by the "
"corresponding design and support records."
msgstr "这些声明来自公共头文件。选择、生命周期、支持的执行模式和物理资源授权范围仍以对应设计及支持记录为准。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:12
msgid ""
"The Native model controls in `model.h`, `spi_dma_model.h` and "
"`rtc_lptim_model.h` support host tests. They do not establish MCU hardware "
"support or device discovery. Optional interfaces describe selected "
"contracts; their presence does not imply support on every provider."
msgstr ""
"`model.h`、`spi_dma_model.h` 和 `rtc_lptim_model.h` 中的 Native 模型控制供主机测试使用，不建立 "
"MCU 硬件支持或设备探测能力。可选接口只描述被选择的合同；接口存在并不代表每个 provider 都支持。"

