#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Query the fixed reviewed ADC sequence and raw-count format."
msgstr "查询固定、已审查的 ADC 序列与原始计数格式。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Single-shot/low-rate scan provider."
msgstr "[in] 单次或低速扫描 provider。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[out] Resolution, declared reference and sequence length."
msgstr "[out] 分辨率、声明的参考值及序列长度。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "Success or INVALID."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Read fixed channel order and complete-scan timing facts."
msgstr "读取固定通道顺序与完整扫描的时序事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Initialized timing-capable provider."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且支持时序信息的 provider。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[out] Cold read-only facts; no acquisition starts."
msgstr "[out] 冷态只读事实；不会启动采集。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Attach optional observer storage before acquisition starts."
msgstr "采集开始前附加可选观察者存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"Stop and join before detach/reclaim. No hidden allocation; polling and "
"finite modes need no observation storage."
msgstr "分离或回收前，先停止并等待相关访问者退出。没有隐藏分配；轮询及有限模式无需观察存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Initialized continuous provider, one task owner."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的连续采集 provider，由一个任务所有者控制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"[inout] Initialized stable caller storage, or NULL to detach. Provider "
"validates exact stream count at start."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且稳定的调用方存储；传入 NULL 表示分离。provider 在启动时验证精确的 stream 数量。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Success or BUSY/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "成功或 BUSY/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Query one live consumer loan's software completion record."
msgstr "查询一个存活消费者借用的软件完成记录。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Same stable observer-capable provider."
msgstr "[in] 同一个稳定且支持观察的 provider。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Same stream's currently acquired immutable block."
msgstr "[in] 同一 stream 当前已取得的不可变 block。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"[out] Copied epoch, ordinal, observed time and gap flag. This is never a "
"hardware sample aperture timestamp."
msgstr "[out] 复制的 epoch、序号、观察时间和间隙标志。这绝不是硬件采样孔径时间戳。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED, output unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED；拒绝时输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Sample the fixed single/scan sequence by bounded polling."
msgstr "通过有界轮询采样固定单次／扫描序列。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"CPU-active task-only acquisition. Reference voltage, sampling error and "
"maximum rate need physical qualification."
msgstr "采集持续占用 CPU，且仅限任务上下文。参考电压、采样误差和最大速率需要实物资格验证。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[inout] Single execution owner; fixed channel/sample-time setup."
msgstr "[inout] 唯一执行所有者；通道及采样时间配置固定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[out] Raw counts in configured channel order."
msgstr "[out] 按配置通道顺序排列的原始计数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Sample capacity at least channel_count."
msgstr "[in] 样本容量至少为 channel_count。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Absolute clock-domain deadline."
msgstr "[in] 时钟域中的绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[out] Complete valid samples; remaining output is untouched."
msgstr "[out] 完整有效样本；其余输出保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/BUSY/TIMEOUT/IO; abort/drain completes before return. No "
"retained buffer, DMA/trigger/stream promise."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/BUSY/TIMEOUT/IO；返回前完成中止及排空。不保留缓冲区，也不承诺 DMA、触发或流式能力。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Start selected trigger/block acquisition with caller storage."
msgstr "使用调用者存储启动选定的触发／块采集。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"Blocks contain native uint16_t raw counts in channel order. Capacities and "
"lengths are multiples of a complete scan; DMA domains/alignment and physical"
" rate require separate evidence."
msgstr ""
"block 包含按通道顺序排列的原生 uint16_t 原始计数。容量及长度必须为完整扫描的整数倍；DMA 域、对齐和物理速率需要独立证据。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Trigger/block-capable provider, one task executor."
msgstr "[in] 支持触发及 block 的 provider，由一个任务执行者控制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[inout] Initialized immutable-consumer block mechanism."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、供消费者不可变访问的 block 机制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"[in] Positive requested complete-scan rate; provider rejects rates outside "
"its declared timer/ADC capability."
msgstr "[in] 请求的完整扫描速率，为正值；超出所声明定时器或 ADC 能力的速率由 provider 拒绝。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Success or INVALID/BUSY/UNSUPPORTED before buffer admission."
msgstr "缓冲区准入前返回成功或 INVALID/BUSY/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Stop trigger and memory sources without revoking consumer loans."
msgstr "停止触发与内存写入源，不撤销消费者借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Consumer READY/BORROWED blocks must still be drained/released."
msgstr "消费者的 READY/BORROWED block 仍须排空或释放。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Same acquisition executor; retain storage on BUSY."
msgstr "[in] 同一个采集执行者；BUSY 时保留存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"Success proves source detach, BUSY retains producer storage, UNSUPPORTED for"
" a polling-only provider."
msgstr "成功证明源已分离；BUSY 保留生产者存储；仅支持轮询的 provider 返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Explicitly resume discrete block acquisition after consumer drain."
msgstr "消费者排空后，显式恢复离散块采集。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"No task, retry or hidden rearm is created. Block modes state their trigger "
"gaps; continuous zero-gap capture requires a separately declared hardware "
"capability and qualification."
msgstr "不会创建任务、重试或隐藏的重新 arm。block 模式明确说明触发间隙；连续无间隙捕获需要另外声明的硬件能力及资格验证。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Same single task executor as start and stop."
msgstr "[in] 与 start 和 stop 相同的唯一任务执行者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"Success when an engine is armed, BUSY during source drain or free-block "
"backpressure, STATE after acquisition stops."
msgstr "引擎已 arm 时返回成功；源排空或空闲 block 背压期间返回 BUSY；采集停止后返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "Attach an optional hint sink after checking publisher IRQ priority."
msgstr "检查发布者 IRQ 优先级后，附加可选提示接收端。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"Block/error predicates latch before notifications. Stop and join publishers "
"and waiters before reclaiming old sink storage."
msgstr "先锁存 block 或错误条件，再通知。回收旧 sink 存储前，停止并等待发布者及等待者退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid "[in] Initialized block-capable provider, one task executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且支持 block 的 provider，由一个任务执行者控制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Immutable borrowed target or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的借用目标；NULL 表示分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"[in] Optional additional unshifted kernel-safe priority floor; cannot weaken"
" generated policy. PRIMASK kernel targets require zero. Ignored without "
"kernel calls."
msgstr "[in] 可选的额外未移位内核安全优先级数值下限；不得削弱生成策略。PRIMASK 内核目标要求为零。不调用内核时忽略。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "Success or CONTEXT/STATE/PERMISSION/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "成功或 CONTEXT/STATE/PERMISSION/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"Raw count facts; nominal Vref is not a calibrated physical measurement."
msgstr "原始计数事实；标称 Vref 不是经过校准的物理测量。"

