#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:18
msgid ""
"sample_times are codes into sample_cycles, in channel order. scan_cycles "
"includes each channel's sample and conversion. Clock declarations and cycle "
"counts describe scheduling; they do not establish electrical accuracy or "
"sample aperture timestamps. Arrays remain valid through provider lifetime."
msgstr ""
"sample_times 按通道顺序保存 sample_cycles 的采样码。scan_cycles "
"包含各通道的采样及转换周期。时钟声明和周期数描述调度，不建立电气精度或采样孔径时间戳的事实。数组在 provider 整个生命周期内保持有效。"

