msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；不分配、不访问硬件，也不保留借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid "Decode one integer from a caller-owned or consumer-acquired scan."
msgstr "从调用者拥有或消费者已取得的扫描数据中解码一个整数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid ""
"No pointer is retained. Input/output/format overlap and wrapping spans "
"reject before access. Sample loads have bounded1..4 byte work. This "
"operation performs neither calibrated engineering-unit conversion nor "
"synchronization with an active producer. The consumer owns that join."
msgstr ""
"不保留任何指针。输入、输出或 format 重叠，以及地址回绕的范围，均在访问前拒绝。样本装载的工作量有界，为 1..4 "
"字节。此操作既不转换为经过校准的工程单位，也不与活跃生产者同步；消费者负责完成该访问的同步／退出等待。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid "[in] Valid immutable uniform-channel scan description."
msgstr "[in] 有效且不可变、通道布局一致的扫描描述。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid "[in] Readable storage; any producer/DMA access must be joined."
msgstr "[in] 可读存储；必须先等待所有生产者或 DMA 访问结束。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid "[in] Positive exact multiple of scan_stride, including padding."
msgstr "[in] 为 scan_stride 的正整数倍，包含填充。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid "[in] Zero-based complete scan index."
msgstr "[in] 从零开始的完整扫描索引。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid "[in] Zero-based channel position in provider order."
msgstr "[in] 按 provider 顺序从零开始的通道位置。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[out] Separate aligned output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐的输出，被拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; all32-bit unsigned/signed raw values fit int64_t."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；全部 32 位无符号或有符号原始值均可容纳于 int64_t。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid "Immutable uniform-channel integer layout, independent of ADC faces."
msgstr "各通道存储格式一致的不可变整数布局，与 ADC 接口独立。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:26
msgid ""
"storage_bytes is1..4; significant_bits is1..32 within that storage. lsb_bits"
" names discarded low bits, not an arithmetic scaling factor. sample_stride "
"and scan_stride include explicit padding in bytes. channel_count retains the"
" provider's separately declared channel order. Software triggers use "
"identity0; hardware trigger identities are nonzero assembly-local IDs, never"
" addresses or a promise of physical timing. Group/trigger declarations "
"describe an already supported provider mode; validating a layout does not "
"add support to a device or configure it."
msgstr ""
"storage_bytes 为 1..4；significant_bits 在该存储范围内为 1..32。lsb_bits "
"表示丢弃的低位，不是算术缩放因子。sample_stride 和 scan_stride 以字节计，包含显式填充。channel_count 保持 "
"provider 另行声明的通道顺序。软件触发使用 identity0；硬件触发标识是非零、装配内局部的 ID，绝不是地址或物理时序承诺。group 或"
" trigger 声明描述 provider 已支持的模式；验证布局不会为设备增加支持，也不会配置设备。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:32
msgid "adc_group.h"
msgstr "adc_group.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Optional finite whole-sequence integer ADC acquisition."
msgstr "可选的有限完整序列整数 ADC 采集。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Prepare caller storage without hardware access or retained borrow."
msgstr "准备调用者存储，不访问硬件，也不保留借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"Request and frames are distinct. Preparation reads no sample bytes and does "
"not prove a DMA domain or chip mode. All previous observers must be joined "
"before reuse. NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is rejected."
msgstr ""
"请求与帧存储彼此独立。准备过程不读取样本字节，也不证明 DMA 域或芯片模式成立。复用前必须等待所有先前的观察者退出。拒绝 "
"NX_DEADLINE_NEVER。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or fully consumed SETTLED storage."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化为 READY，或已完全消费的 SETTLED 存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[out] Aligned nonempty raw output including explicit padding."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐、非空的原始输出，包含显式填充。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[in] Positive nonwrapping span; provider validates exact layout."
msgstr "[in] 长度为正且地址不回绕的范围；由 provider 验证精确布局。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[in] Positive whole-frame count, not a raw rank count."
msgstr "[in] 正的完整帧数，不是原始 rank 数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline in platform monotonic domain."
msgstr "[in] 平台单调时间域中的有限绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE, rejected request remains unchanged."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；被拒绝的请求保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Accept and start one selected finite acquisition under a sole owner."
msgstr "由唯一所有者接受并启动一次选定的有限采集。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"Accepted descriptor is caller-immutable; caller cannot access frames until "
"acquire-observed SETTLED. Priming may write this entire span but never "
"publishes prime data as valid. Post-admission arm failure keeps the borrow "
"until actual drain. Without trusted completion timestamps, completion first "
"observed at/after deadline is TIMEOUT. One-frame injected profiles "
"deliberately prevent a second trigger/JDR overwrite."
msgstr ""
"请求被接受后，调用方不得修改描述符；只有以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED "
"后，才能访问帧存储。预转换可能写入整个范围，但不会将预转换数据发布为有效数据。准入后的 arm "
"失败仍保留借用，直到实际排空。没有可信完成时间戳时，首次在 deadline 时刻或之后观察到完成即为 TIMEOUT。单帧 injected "
"配置有意防止第二次触发及 JDR 覆盖。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[in] Initialized selected face with immutable retained facts."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的选中接口，其保留配置事实不可变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[inout] Exact READY descriptor and exclusive writable span."
msgstr "[inout] 精确处于 READY 的描述符及独占可写范围。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including immediate SETTLED failure. Other results "
"reject without pointer retention or residual new effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示已 ACCEPTED，包括立即进入 SETTLED 的失败。其他结果表示拒绝，不保留指针，也不留下新的残余效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Start cancellation without revoking the accepted storage borrow."
msgstr "开始取消，不撤销已接受的存储借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "The first terminal fault/cancel/timeout remains authoritative."
msgstr "最先出现的终结故障、取消或超时保持最终决定权。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[in] Same stable selected face and serialized privileged task."
msgstr "[in] 同一个稳定的选中接口，并由串行化的特权任务调用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[inout] Exact current accepted request, still live."
msgstr "[inout] 当前已接受且仍然存活的精确请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS starts/observes cancellation; it does not imply SETTLED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示开始或观察到取消，不代表已经 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Make bounded prime/acquisition/drain progress without hidden waits."
msgstr "推进有界的预转换、采集和排空，不包含隐藏等待。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"No request or output is reclaimed while sources, ADC, DMA or IRQs may still "
"reference it. QUARANTINED requests remain owned and retryable."
msgstr "只要各源、ADC、DMA 或 IRQ 仍可能引用请求或输出，就不得回收它们。QUARANTINED 请求仍归当前所有者持有，可重试排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after progress/settlement, BUSY during outstanding drain, or an "
"error with retained recovery responsibility."
msgstr "推进或结算后返回 SUCCESS；排空尚未完成时返回 BUSY；或返回错误并保留恢复责任。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Close admission and prove request source drain before reporting idle."
msgstr "关闭准入，证明请求的源已排空后才报告空闲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"Stop is not cold close: pads, common clock, internal-source enables and "
"provider storage remain retained until platform joined close."
msgstr "停止不等于冷关闭：引脚、公共时钟、内部源使能和 provider 存储仍被保留，直到平台完成退出等待后关闭。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "SUCCESS only after final request detach; BUSY/IO keeps all leases."
msgstr "仅在最终请求分离后返回 SUCCESS；BUSY/IO 保留全部租约。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Copy actual selected facts and current retained owner state."
msgstr "复制实际选定事实与当前保留的所有者状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Observing idle/fault does not release a request or any cold lease."
msgstr "观察到空闲或故障不会释放请求或任何冷租约。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "[in] Same initialized selected face, unique task executor."
msgstr "[in] 同一个已初始化的选中接口，由唯一任务执行者调用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Complete raw frame span with an explicit finite request lifetime."
msgstr "完整的原始帧存储跨度，具有明确的有限请求生命周期。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"base.transferred counts complete frames, never bytes or individual ranks. "
"SUCCESS means exactly frame_count; errors guarantee zero valid frames. "
"Partial DMA/JEOC progress does not publish a valid prefix."
msgstr ""
"base.transferred 统计完整帧，不统计字节或单个 rank。SUCCESS 表示恰好完成 frame_count "
"帧；错误时报告的保证有效帧数为零。部分 DMA/JEOC 进度不会发布为有效前缀。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Exclusive producer storage, including padding."
msgstr "独占的生产者存储，包含填充。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Exact frame_count * info.format.scan_stride."
msgstr "精确等于 frame_count * info.format.scan_stride。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Positive complete frames, within selected bound."
msgstr "完整帧数量，必须为正且不超过选定上限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Cold selected rank order, actual integer layout and scheduling facts."
msgstr "冷态选定的 rank 顺序、实际整数布局与调度事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"Arrays belong to immutable selected facts and outlive this port. A physical "
"rank can be discarded padding required by silicon errata; format describes "
"only valid logical results. No implicit data packing, engineering units, "
"aperture timestamp or trigger counter is promised."
msgstr ""
"数组属于不可变的选中配置事实，其生命周期长于此端口。物理 rank 可能是芯片勘误要求丢弃的填充；format "
"仅描述有效逻辑结果。不承诺隐式数据打包、工程单位、采样孔径时间戳或触发计数器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Logical rank order, including repeats."
msgstr "逻辑 rank 顺序，包含重复项。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Actual per-channel sampling codes."
msgstr "实际逐通道采样编码。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Sampling-code lookup, immutable."
msgstr "不可变的采样编码查找表。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Includes all discarded ranks."
msgstr "包含所有丢弃的 rank。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Zero for software; not an aperture."
msgstr "软件触发时为零；不表示采样孔径。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Shared read-only selected methods; ordinary ADC tables do not grow."
msgstr "共享只读的选定方法；普通 ADC 方法表不增加。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"A privileged task serializes every call. IRQs only record bounded facts in "
"the same unique physical owner. No allocation, pool, implicit task, "
"automatic rearm or runtime discovery is provided."
msgstr "由一个特权任务串行化所有调用。IRQ 只在同一个唯一物理所有者中记录有界事实。不提供分配、池、隐式任务、自动重新 arm 或运行时发现。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid "Immutable selected face, sharing one const table across instances."
msgstr "不可变的选定接口，多个实例共享同一 const 方法表。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:34
msgid ""
"Face/context/configuration outlive every request, vector and retained close."
" Existing ordinary ADC or PWM/ADC faces cannot expose the same leased ADC. A"
" factory only returns this existing object."
msgstr ""
"接口、上下文和配置的生命周期覆盖每个请求、向量及保留责任的关闭过程。现有普通 ADC 或 PWM/ADC 接口不得暴露同一个已租用的 "
"ADC。工厂仅返回此既有对象。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:40
msgid "adc_observer.h"
msgstr "adc_observer.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "Optional caller-owned ADC publication observations."
msgstr "调用者拥有的可选 ADC 发布观察。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "Defines"
msgstr "宏定义"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "Initialize fresh unborrowed optional observation storage."
msgstr "初始化全新、尚未借用的可选观察存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[out] Aligned fresh control, not published to readers."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐的新控制对象，尚未发布给读者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[out] Distinct aligned exact record array."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐、大小精确的记录数组。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[in] Positive count; must equal the selected stream count."
msgstr "[in] 正数量；必须等于选中 stream 的数量。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "Success or INVALID/CONTEXT; rejected outputs stay untouched."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/CONTEXT；被拒绝的输出保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid ""
"Provider-only cold bind validates every metadata/payload span before the "
"first DMA loan."
msgstr "仅提供者可执行的冷绑定；第一次 DMA 借用之前验证每个元数据／载荷范围。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[inout] Initialized exclusive observation control."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的独占观察控制对象。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[in] Exact initialized stream, no outstanding loans."
msgstr "[in] 精确的已初始化 stream，且没有尚未归还的借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[in] Provider's stable complete private state span."
msgstr "[in] provider 稳定且完整的私有状态范围。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[in] Positive exact state byte count."
msgstr "[in] 正的精确状态字节数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "Success or INVALID/BUSY, without a partial retained bind."
