#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[in] Stable bound observation control."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且已绑定的观察控制对象。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[in] Same stream's live immutable consumer loan."
msgstr "[in] 同一 stream 中仍存活且不可变的消费者借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[out] Complete copy; untouched on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 完整副本；拒绝时不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE for a missing/stale/released loan."
msgstr "成功；借用缺失、陈旧或已释放时返回 INVALID/STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "Provider-only unbind after all producer/consumer loans join."
msgstr "全部生产者／消费者借用完成 join 后，仅提供者可解除绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "[inout] Stable initialized control; NULL is allowed."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定且已初始化的控制对象；允许 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "Success or BUSY retaining the bound stream."
msgstr "成功，或返回 BUSY 并保留已绑定的 stream。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "One loan's software observation, never a sample aperture."
msgstr "一个借用的软件观察，绝不表示采样孔径。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid ""
"observed_at uses the platform monotonic clock after target detach readback. "
"IRQ delivery and publication latency are included. sequence counts observed "
"valid block records, not timer triggers, samples or guessed missed scans."
msgstr ""
"observed_at 使用目标分离读回之后的平台单调时钟，包含 IRQ 递送及发布延迟。sequence 统计观察到的有效 block "
"记录，不统计定时器触发、样本或推测的漏失扫描。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid "Optional caller-owned observer control and exact records."
msgstr "调用者拥有的可选观察者控制与准确记录。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:42
msgid ""
"Initialize before attaching; internal fields belong to one producer. Records"
" and control remain live through successful provider stop and all consumer "
"releases. No default stream, slot or finite provider storage is enlarged."
msgstr ""
"附加前先初始化；内部字段属于一个生产者。记录和控制对象必须保持存活，直到 provider 成功停止且全部消费者归还借用。不会扩大默认 "
"stream、slot 或有限 provider 的存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:48
msgid "advanced_pwm.h"
msgstr "advanced_pwm.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "Optional fixed complementary PWM with latched break."
msgstr "可选固定互补 PWM 与锁存刹车。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "Stage duty against the fixed declared PSC/ARR and complementary pair."
msgstr "依据固定声明的 PSC/ARR 与互补通道对暂存占空比。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid ""
"Shadow duty becomes effective at the next update. Hardware deadtime encoding"
" must exactly represent the cold-configured tDTS count; PSC does not scale "
"deadtime. This API does not certify pin timing."
msgstr ""
"影子 duty 在下一次 update 时生效。硬件死区编码必须精确表示冷配置的 tDTS 计数；PSC 不会缩放死区。此 API 不认证引脚时序。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "[in] One serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 一个串行化的特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "[in] Zero through the maintained period, inclusive."
msgstr "[in] 从零到维护中的周期值，含两端。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT; no base-clock reconfiguration."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT；不重新配置基础时钟。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "Enable outputs only with inactive break and no latched fault."
msgstr "仅刹车未激活且无锁存故障时启用输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid ""
"Automatic output reenabling and irreversible hardware LOCK are prohibited. A"
" break never silently starts outputs again."
msgstr "禁止自动重新使能输出及不可逆的硬件 LOCK。break 绝不会静默重新启动输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner of reviewed pin/clock/vector leases."
msgstr "[in] 已审查引脚、时钟及向量租约的特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT; failure retains ownership."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT；失败时保留所有权。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "Disable/read back master output and both channel sources."
msgstr "禁用并读回主输出与两个通道源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid ""
"Cold assembly keeps the reviewed inactive-pin and shared-vector leases until"
" success and IRQ quiescence. A latched break survives stop."
msgstr "冷装配保留已审查的非活动引脚及共享向量租约，直到成功且 IRQ 静止。已锁存的 break 在停止后仍保留。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner, no concurrent duty/lifecycle calls."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者；不得并发调用 duty 或生命周期操作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "SUCCESS proves output source detachment; BUSY retains responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明输出源已分离；BUSY 保留责任。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "Query staged duty, actual enable state and latched break facts."
msgstr "查询暂存占空比、实际启用状态与锁存刹车事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "[out] Separate writable snapshot, never provider storage."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写的快照，绝不能是 provider 存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "Clear a software fault only while disabled and BKIN is inactive."
msgstr "仅已禁用且 BKIN 未激活时清除软件故障。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid ""
"Physical input and pending hardware break are rechecked. Application "
"recovery policy and external power safety remain outside Nexus."
msgstr "重新检查物理输入及待处理的硬件 break。应用恢复策略和外部电源安全由 Nexus 之外负责。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "[in] Privileged task recovery owner."
msgstr "[in] 执行恢复的特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT; does not enable outputs."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT；不会使能输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "Counts use the fixed post-prescaler clock; deadtime uses tDTS."
msgstr "计数使用固定预分频后的时钟；死区使用 tDTS。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "Shared immutable controls; configuration is a cold assembly fact."
msgstr "共享不可变控制；配置是冷装配事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:50
msgid "Immutable identity; controller state and configuration outlive IRQs."
msgstr "不可变身份；控制器状态与配置必须在所有 IRQ 完全退出前保持有效。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:56
msgid "can.h"
msgstr "can.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Classic CAN value frames and caller-owned mailbox requests."
msgstr "经典 CAN 值帧与调用者拥有的邮箱请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Validate and copy a classic frame into unborrowed request storage."
msgstr "验证并复制经典帧到未被借用的请求存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Task owner only; failure retains no reference and changes no frame."
msgstr "仅限任务所有者；失败时不保留引用，也不更改帧。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED storage."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化为 READY 或已消费的 SETTLED 存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Value copied here; remote data bytes are ignored."
msgstr "[in] 在此复制的值；忽略 remote 帧数据字节。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Absolute provider-clock deadline, including admission."
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟中的绝对 deadline，包含准入时间。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Success, INVALID for nonclassic frame, STATE while borrowed."
msgstr "成功；非经典帧返回 INVALID；借用期间返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Admit one frame into one of three hardware mailboxes."
msgstr "将一个帧准入到三个硬件邮箱之一。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged task owner, incoming IRQ masks clear. REJECTED retains"
" nothing. TXOK plus completed/empty hardware proves success."
msgstr "串行化的特权任务所有者，进入时 IRQ 屏蔽位须清零。REJECTED 不保留任何内容。TXOK 加上硬件已完成或已空，才证明成功。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Stable immutable face and private storage."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且不可变的接口及私有存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[inout] READY value request, kept alive until SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] READY 值请求，保持存活直到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Success means ACCEPTED, not on-wire completion; other results reject."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED，不表示已完成线上发送；其他结果均为拒绝。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Request abort without revoking a borrowed request."
msgstr "请求中止，不撤销请求借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid ""
"Abort may race real transmission; observed TXOK remains SUCCESS. Failed "
"abort remains QUARANTINED and must keep storage alive."
msgstr "中止可能与真实发送竞争；已观察到 TXOK 时仍为 SUCCESS。中止失败保持 QUARANTINED，必须保持存储存活。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Stable face owned by the serialized task executor."
msgstr "[in] 由串行任务执行者拥有的稳定接口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[inout] Live request previously accepted by this instance."
msgstr "[inout] 先前由本实例接受且仍存活的请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Success requests drain; STATE for an unrelated request."
msgstr "成功表示请求排空；无关请求返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Process latched completions and absolute timeout/drain deadlines."
msgstr "处理锁存完成状态与绝对超时／排空截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Bounded three-mailbox/six-frame work, no worker, blocking or replay."
msgstr "工作量限于三个邮箱／六帧；无 worker、阻塞或重放。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Serialized task-owner face with incoming masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行任务所有者接口，进入时屏蔽位须清零。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Success, STATE before start, CONTEXT for an illegal caller."
msgstr "成功；启动前返回 STATE；非法调用者返回 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Consume value events without overwriting earlier unconsumed facts."
msgstr "消费值事件，不覆盖此前尚未消费的事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid ""
"Each bounded record copy has a short metadata exclusion; pending loss is "
"ordered after older records and before future frames."
msgstr "每次有界记录复制均以短临界区排除元数据并发访问；待发布的丢失边界排在较旧记录之后、后续帧之前。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Stable instance; one task consumer owns this operation."
msgstr "[in] 稳定实例；此操作由一个任务消费者拥有。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[out] Caller capacity; no retained output reference."
msgstr "[out] 调用方容量；不保留输出引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Nonzero number of event records."
msgstr "[in] 非零的事件记录数量。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[out] Number copied; EMPTY means zero available."
msgstr "[out] 已复制数量；EMPTY 表示没有可用记录。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Success, EMPTY, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Copy authoritative error/admission state, even when RX is full."
msgstr "即使 RX 已满，仍复制权威错误／准入状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Task-only, bounded; bus-off is latched until explicit recovery."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，工作量有界；bus-off 被锁存，直到显式恢复。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Live instance and storage."
msgstr "[in] 存活的实例和存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[out] Unretained value output."
msgstr "[out] 不保留引用的值输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Success, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Close admission, abort TX and detach IRQ/RX publishers."
msgstr "关闭准入、中止 TX、撤离 IRQ/RX 发布者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid ""
"Never resets the shared primary controller to release a peer's loan. Retry "
"after progress. Success ends provider access to RX/wake storage."
msgstr "绝不会为释放另一个所有者的借用而复位共享主控制器。推进后重试。成功表示 provider 不再访问 RX 或 wake 存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Serialized owner; external observers must also join."
msgstr "[in] 串行化的所有者；还须等待外部观察者退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Success after hardware drain; BUSY retains requests/ring/wake loans."
msgstr "硬件排空后成功；BUSY 保留请求、环及 wake 借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Explicitly reenter initialization after bus-off and complete drain."
msgstr "bus-off 且完整排空之后，显式重新进入初始化。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "No automatic recovery or retransmission; domain/filter identity stays."
msgstr "无自动恢复或重传；域及 filter 标识保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Started owner with no active/quarantined TX slots."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的所有者，且不存在 active 或 quarantined TX slot。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Success after bounded hardware acknowledgement, BUSY while borrowed."
msgstr "有界硬件确认后成功；借用期间返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Borrow an optional wake target after checking all four actual IRQs."
msgstr "检查全部四个实际 IRQ 后，借用可选唤醒目标。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid ""
"No implicit OS policy; NULL detaches. Wake is only a hint. The sink must "
"support both task service/cancel and configurable IRQ contexts."
msgstr ""
"无隐式 OS 策略；NULL 表示分离。wake 仅为提示。sink 必须同时支持任务中的 service/cancel 及可配置 IRQ 上下文。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Serialized task owner, started and masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行任务所有者，已启动且屏蔽位清零。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "[in] Immutable target kept alive until successful stop/detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变目标，保持存活直到成功停止或分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Additional numerical BASEPRI ceiling."
msgstr "[in] 附加的 BASEPRI 数值阈值。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid ""
"Success, BUSY while an earlier publisher is live, PERMISSION, INVALID or "
"CONTEXT, with no new borrow on failure."
msgstr "成功；较早发布者仍存活时返回 BUSY；或返回 PERMISSION、INVALID、CONTEXT。失败时不产生新借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Classic 2.0A/B value frame; DLC is always 0..8, never CAN FD."
msgstr "经典 2.0A/B 值帧；DLC 始终为 0..8，绝不是 CAN FD。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Caller-owned frame copied at prepare; base must first be initialized."
msgstr "调用者拥有的帧在 prepare 时复制；必须先初始化 base。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Value receive fact or ordered loss boundary."
msgstr "值接收事实或有序丢失边界。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid ""
"Timestamp is IRQ acquisition/report time, not hardware SOF. Hardware overrun"
" proves only a lower bound. Raw DLC 9..15 is normalized to 8."
msgstr "时间戳是 IRQ 取得或报告时间，不是硬件 SOF。硬件 overrun 仅证明损失下限。原始 DLC 9..15 规范化为 8。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Latched controller state, independent of receive-ring fullness."
msgstr "锁存控制器状态，与接收环是否已满无关。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Shared immutable operations; execution owner serializes task methods."
msgstr "共享不可变操作；执行所有者串行执行 Task 方法。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:58
msgid "Immutable face; lookup does not allocate, start or acquire hardware."
msgstr "不可变接口面；查找不分配、不启动、不取得硬件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:64
msgid "can_fd.h"
msgstr "can_fd.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Optional CAN FD value ports and retained hardware requests."
msgstr "可选 CAN FD 值接口与持续借用的硬件请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Exact wire format; the classic interface remains independent."
msgstr "精确的线上格式；经典 CAN 接口保持独立。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Validate and copy an exact frame into unborrowed request storage."
msgstr "验证精确帧并复制到尚未借用的请求存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Serialized task owner. Failure changes no frame and creates no loan."
msgstr "串行任务所有者。失败时不更改帧，也不建立借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Whole value copied without retaining this address."
msgstr "[in] 复制完整值，不保留此地址。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Success, INVALID for a malformed frame, STATE while borrowed."
msgstr "成功；帧格式错误时返回 INVALID；借用期间返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Admit one exact value into a physical hardware transmit element."
msgstr "将一个精确值准入物理硬件发送元素。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged task, incoming masks clear. No software FIFO ordering "
"is implied by admission; a hardware queue arbitrates by ID."
msgstr "串行化的特权任务，进入时屏蔽位须清零。准入不隐含软件 FIFO 顺序；硬件队列按 ID 仲裁。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Stable immutable selected controller face."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且不可变的选中控制器接口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[inout] READY request retained until acquire SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] READY 请求，保留至以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; every failure rejects without effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；所有失败均无效果地拒绝。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Request cancellation while preserving the accepted storage loan."
msgstr "请求取消，同时保留已接受的存储借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid ""
"Physical transmission may win cancellation and remain SUCCESS. "
"Timeout/cancel do not release storage. Failed drain is QUARANTINED."
msgstr "物理发送可能先于取消完成，此时仍为 SUCCESS。超时或取消不会释放存储。排空失败为 QUARANTINED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Selected face owned by the sole task executor."
msgstr "[in] 由唯一任务执行者拥有的选中接口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[inout] Exact request previously accepted by this instance."
msgstr "[inout] 先前由本实例接受的精确请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Success requests drain, STATE rejects an unrelated request."
msgstr "成功表示请求排空；STATE 表示拒绝无关请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Process bounded hardware facts and absolute deadline progress."
msgstr "处理有界的硬件事实与绝对截止时间进展。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "No hidden worker, retry or blocking wait. Wake remains only a hint."
msgstr "无隐藏 worker、重试或阻塞等待。wake 仍仅为提示。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task face, incoming masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行化的特权任务接口，进入时屏蔽位须清零。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Success, STATE while unavailable, CONTEXT for an illegal caller."
msgstr "成功；不可用时返回 STATE；非法调用者返回 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Copy ordered value events into unretained caller output storage."
msgstr "将有序值事件复制到不会被持续借用的调用者输出存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid ""
"Earlier retained records precede a pending loss boundary. Neither full "
"receive storage nor a failed hint may erase protocol state."
msgstr "较早保留的记录排在待发布的丢失边界之前。接收存储已满或提示失败，都不得抹除协议状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Stable instance with one task consumer."
msgstr "[in] 稳定实例，由一个任务消费者使用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[out] Writable output, disjoint from all borrowed storage."
msgstr "[out] 可写输出，必须与全部借用存储不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Positive number of complete output event records."
msgstr "[in] 正的完整输出事件记录数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[out] Unretained number copied, disjoint from events."
msgstr "[out] 不保留引用的已复制数量，与 events 不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Success, EMPTY with zero copied, INVALID, STATE or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功；EMPTY 表示复制数量为零；或返回 INVALID、STATE、CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Copy authoritative latched protocol and ownership state."
msgstr "复制权威的锁存协议状态与所有权状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Task-only; a full event ring does not hide bus-off or error state."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文；事件环已满不会隐藏 bus-off 或错误状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Stable selected instance, including after successful stop."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的选中实例，包括成功停止之后。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[out] Writable value, disjoint from all borrowed controls."
msgstr "[out] 可写值，与全部已借用控制对象不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Success, INVALID or CONTEXT. Output is never retained."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 CONTEXT。绝不保留输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Close admission, drain transmit loans and withdraw IRQ publishers."
msgstr "关闭准入、排空发送借用并撤离 IRQ 发布者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid ""
"Never reset a shared peripheral domain to revoke another owner. Retry after "
"physical progress. Stop success is not observer join."
msgstr "绝不可复位共享外设域来撤销另一所有者。物理推进后重试。停止成功不代表观察者已退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Sole task owner; separate observers must also join."
msgstr "[in] 唯一任务所有者；还须另行等待独立观察者退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Success releases provider loans; failure retains incomplete leases."
msgstr "成功释放 provider 借用；失败保留尚未完成的租约。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Recover the same hardware identity after complete transmit drain."
msgstr "完整排空发送后，恢复同一硬件身份。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Explicit recovery never replays a frame or reassigns shared RAM."
msgstr "显式恢复绝不重放帧，也不重新分配共享 RAM。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Started task owner with no pending or quarantined request."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的任务所有者，且没有 pending 或 quarantined 请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Success after bounded acknowledgement, BUSY while borrowed."
msgstr "有界确认后成功；借用期间返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Borrow a wake sink after validating the actual enabled IRQ source."
msgstr "验证实际启用的 IRQ 源后借用唤醒接收端。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid ""
"NULL detaches. Rejection preserves the earlier sink. Notification must be "
"bounded and legal in both task and configurable IRQ contexts."
msgstr "NULL 表示分离。拒绝时保留先前的 sink。通知必须有界，并在任务及可配置 IRQ 上下文中均合法。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Sole task owner, started and incoming masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 唯一任务所有者，已启动且进入时屏蔽位清零。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "[in] Immutable sink retained through successful detach/stop."
msgstr "[in] 不可变 sink，保留直到成功分离或停止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Success, BUSY while publishing, PERMISSION, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功；发布期间返回 BUSY；或返回 PERMISSION、INVALID、CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Value frame with an exact byte length, never raw or shifted DLC."
msgstr "具有精确字节长度的值帧，不使用原始或移位后的 DLC。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid ""
"FD admits0..8/12/16/20/24/32/48/64 bytes; no rounding or padding on wire. FD"
" remote frames and classic BRS are invalid. A provider may reject a valid "
"value when its selected hardware mode lacks that form."
msgstr ""
"FD 接受 0..8/12/16/20/24/32/48/64 字节；在线上不向上取整或填充。FD remote 帧及经典帧 BRS "
"无效。选中硬件模式不支持某种形式时，provider 可以拒绝该形式的合法值。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Prepare copies a complete value; accepted request stays borrowed."
msgstr "准备操作复制完整值；被接受的请求保持借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Acquired value event, including observed transmitter ESI."
msgstr "已取得的值事件，包含观察到的发送者 ESI。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid ""
"acquired_us is provider acquisition time, never SOF. A disabled hardware "
"counter reports raw0 plus TIMESTAMP_UNAVAILABLE. filter is the hardware "
"index within the frame format's filter list. Hardware loss proves a lower "
"bound; classic DLC9..15 normalizes to8 with a flag."
msgstr ""
"acquired_us 是 provider 取得时间，绝不是 SOF。硬件计数器禁用时报告 raw0 及 "
"TIMESTAMP_UNAVAILABLE。filter 是该帧格式 filter 列表中的硬件索引。硬件丢失证明的是下限；经典 DLC9..15 "
"规范化为 8，并附带标志。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Immutable mask filter; no product register or protocol policy."
msgstr "不可变掩码过滤器；不包含产品寄存器或协议策略。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:66
msgid "Latched protocol state; payload length never describes a frame count."
msgstr "锁存协议状态；载荷长度不表示帧数量。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:72
msgid "cycle_probe.h"
msgstr "cycle_probe.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "Opt-in raw cycle observations without elapsed-time claims."
msgstr "显式选用的原始周期观察，不作经过时间承诺。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "Start one raw observation without enabling or resetting DWT."
msgstr "开始一次原始观察，不启用或复位 DWT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid ""
"Configurable IRQ or unique task executor. Probe failure must never prevent "
"real I/O dispatch, cancellation, service or retained drain."
msgstr "可配置 IRQ 或唯一任务执行者。probe 失败绝不可阻止真实 I/O 派发、取消、service 或保留责任的排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[inout] Live, exclusive zero/previously completed sidecar."
msgstr "[inout] 存活且独占、为零或先前已完成的 sidecar。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[inout] Zero/inactive token distinct from the complete probe."
msgstr "[inout] 为零或非活动的 token，必须与完整 probe 不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid ""
"SUCCESS even if the counter is unavailable; INVALID/STATE/BUSY rejects "
"before counter access. Same-probe reentry is counted."
msgstr "即使计数器不可用仍返回 SUCCESS；INVALID/STATE/BUSY 在访问计数器前拒绝。统计同一 probe 的重入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "Finish the exact token, publish raw facts and remove its reference."
msgstr "结束对应令牌，发布原始事实并移除其引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "No elapsed or budget validity is inferred from two counter values."
msgstr "不得仅从两个计数器值推导有效的 elapsed 或预算结论。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[inout] Same stable sidecar supplied to begin."
msgstr "[inout] 与 begin 使用的同一个稳定 sidecar。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[inout] Exact still-active token; not concurrently modified."
msgstr "[inout] 精确且仍活动的 token；不得并发修改。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE with another/inactive token."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID；使用其他或非活动 token 时返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "Copy bounded IRQ statistics under saved local interrupt exclusion."
msgstr "保存并恢复本地中断排除状态，在保护期间复制有界 IRQ 统计。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid ""
"Privileged task only. Incoming masks are restored. For a task service "
"producer, use its same executor or join it before sampling; IRQ masks do not"
" join a different preempted task. This is not SMP exclusion. No provider, "
"payload, request or counter is accessed under the mask."
msgstr ""
"仅限特权任务。恢复进入时的屏蔽状态。对于任务 service 生产者，采样须使用同一执行者，或先等待生产者退出；IRQ "
"屏蔽不会等待另一个被抢占任务退出。这不是 SMP 排他。屏蔽期间不访问 provider、payload、request 或计数器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[in] Stable same-CPU sidecar and live producer binding."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、位于同一 CPU 的 sidecar 及存活的生产者绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[out] Distinct aligned copied result, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐的复制结果；拒绝时不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or CONTEXT for ISR/unprivileged callers."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID；ISR 或非特权调用者返回 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "Dispatch exactly one word service step with optional raw observation."
msgstr "仅派发一个字服务步骤，可选记录原始观察。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid ""
"No additional ops table, worker, request or payload reference. Invalid "
"observation never prevents dispatch. Caller proves complete private state, "
"borrowed descriptors and buffers disjoint from observation storage; this API"
" knows only face/method spans and context identity."
msgstr ""
"无额外 ops 表、worker、请求或 payload 引用。无效观察绝不阻止派发。调用方须证明完整私有状态、借用描述符及缓冲区均与观察存储不重叠；此"
" API 只知道接口或方法范围及 context 标识。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[in] Original stable face, methods and unique task executor."
msgstr "[in] 原有稳定接口、方法及唯一任务执行者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[inout] Optional live sidecar, or NULL to omit observation."
msgstr "[inout] 可选的存活 sidecar；NULL 表示省略观察。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "SUCCESS proves dispatch only; INVALID/UNSUPPORTED describes the face."
msgstr "SUCCESS 仅证明派发；INVALID/UNSUPPORTED 描述接口情况。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "Dispatch exactly one whole-CS DMA service step with raw observation."
msgstr "仅派发一个完整 CS 区间的 DMA 服务步骤，并记录原始观察。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid ""
"Same disjointness/executor rules as the word wrapper. No diagnostic failure "
"releases a QUARANTINED loan or changes settlement authority."
msgstr "不重叠及执行者规则与 word wrapper 相同。诊断失败不会释放 QUARANTINED 借用，也不改变结算决定权。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[in] Original enhanced controller and its unique task executor."
msgstr "[in] 原有增强控制器及其唯一任务执行者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "[inout] Optional stable disjoint sidecar, or NULL."
msgstr "[inout] 可选、稳定且不重叠的 sidecar，或 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "SUCCESS after dispatch, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED for an invalid face."
msgstr "派发后返回 SUCCESS；无效接口返回 INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "Copied raw counter facts; readable does not mean elapsed is known."
msgstr "复制的原始计数器事实；可读不表示经过时间已知。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid ""
"A pair is a modulo-2^32 residue, including preemption and probe cost. "
"Neither wrap count, reset, rate nor epoch continuity is established. "
"elapsed_known is always false. No field establishes a passed budget, IRQ "
"arrival latency, exclusive CPU time or a physical WCET bound. attempts "
"includes a currently active attempt; other totals describe completed "
"attempts. Totals saturate rather than wrap."
msgstr ""
"一对值是模 2^32 的余数，包含抢占及 probe 开销。不建立回绕次数、复位、频率或 epoch 连续性。elapsed_known 始终为 "
"false。没有任何字段证明预算已满足、IRQ 到达延迟、独占 CPU 时间或物理 WCET 上界。attempts "
"包含当前活动尝试；其他总计描述已完成尝试。总计采用饱和而非回绕。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "Optional zero-initialized sidecar; no default provider state grows."
msgstr "可选的零初始化附属状态；默认提供者状态不增加。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid ""
"One physical vector or one unique task executor writes each sidecar. "
"Different nested vectors require distinct sidecars. NMI, HardFault, other "
"cores and other security states must not access this storage. Reset/reclaim "
"only after all producers, tokens and readers have joined."
msgstr ""
"每个 sidecar 由一个物理向量或一个唯一任务执行者写入。不同嵌套向量必须使用不同 "
"sidecar。NMI、HardFault、其他核及其他安全状态不得访问此存储。只有全部生产者、token 和读者退出后，才能复位或回收。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:74
msgid "Zero-initialized stack token; do not copy or rebind while active."
msgstr "零初始化栈令牌；活动期间不得复制或重新绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:80
msgid "dma.h"
msgstr "dma.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "Explicit DMA memory domains, physical streams and drain facts."
msgstr "显式 DMA 内存域、物理流与排空事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "Transfer direction determines device access to caller memory."
msgstr "传输方向决定设备对调用者内存的访问。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "Validate an entire buffer within one explicit memory domain."
msgstr "验证整个缓冲区位于一个显式内存域内。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "Bounded task/IRQ check, no MMIO, allocation or side effects."
msgstr "任务或 IRQ 中的有界检查，无 MMIO、分配或副作用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "[in] Immutable SoC domains kept alive for this call."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的 SoC 域，在此调用期间保持存活。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "[in] Positive number of domains."
msgstr "[in] 正的域数量。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "[in] Nonempty caller buffer; never borrowed by this helper."
msgstr "[in] 调用方的非空缓冲区；此 helper 绝不借用它。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "[in] Positive byte length, including all DMA accesses."
msgstr "[in] 正字节长度，包含所有 DMA 访问。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "[in] Nonzero power-of-two transfer alignment."
msgstr "[in] 非零且为 2 的幂的传输对齐。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "[in] Device reads or writes the supplied memory."
msgstr "[in] 设备读取或写入所提供的内存。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid ""
"Success, INVALID for malformed ranges/alignment or PERMISSION for a range "
"outside the required DMA domain."
msgstr "成功；范围或对齐格式错误返回 INVALID；范围不在所需 DMA 域内返回 PERMISSION。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "Reject duplicate physical streams in an assembled resource set."
msgstr "拒绝装配资源集合中重复的物理流。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid ""
"Cold conflict check; the selected SoC must validate all identities against "
"its actual topology before using them. This helper does not infer silicon "
"support or allocate."
msgstr "冷态冲突检查；选中 SoC 在使用前必须依据真实拓扑验证全部标识。此 helper 不推断芯片支持，也不分配。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "[in] Immutable resource list, not retained."
msgstr "[in] 不可变资源列表，不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "[in] Resource count; zero allows a NULL list."
msgstr "[in] 资源数量；为零时允许 NULL 列表。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid ""
"Success, INVALID for a NULL nonempty list or reserved zero controller, BUSY "
"for a duplicate physical engine."
msgstr "成功；非空列表为 NULL 或使用保留的零控制器时返回 INVALID；物理引擎重复时返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "Require engine, IRQ and peripheral drain independently."
msgstr "分别要求 DMA 引擎、IRQ 与外设排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid ""
"The provider must observe actual registers and ordering before setting these"
" facts. This helper does not stop hardware."
msgstr "provider 必须先观察实际寄存器及顺序，才能设置这些事实。此 helper 不会停止硬件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "[in] Provider observations; not retained."
msgstr "[in] provider 的观察结果；不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid ""
"Success only when all sources are detached and idle, BUSY while any source "
"remains, INVALID for impossible counters."
msgstr "仅在全部源已分离且空闲时成功；任何源仍存在时返回 BUSY；不可能的计数器值返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "Reviewed DMA-visible memory interval, never CPU accessibility."
msgstr "已审查的 DMA 可见内存区间，不等同于 CPU 可访问性。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid ""
"begin plus size must not wrap. Cache maintenance remains a provider "
"responsibility on cached architectures."
msgstr "begin 加 size 不得回绕。在带缓存的架构上，缓存维护仍是 provider 的责任。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "Opaque physical engine and request selector identities."
msgstr "不透明物理引擎与请求选择器身份。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid ""
"Controller zero is reserved as invalid. Other values have provider-defined "
"meanings; the SoC validates its topology. Two selectors on the same "
"controller/stream conflict."
msgstr ""
"控制器零保留为无效值。其他值的含义由 provider 定义；SoC 验证自身拓扑。同一 controller/stream 上的两个 selector"
" 相互冲突。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid "Independent facts required before memory borrow release."
msgstr "释放内存借用前必须独立满足的事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:82
msgid ""
"remaining describes DMA memory transfers, not wire bytes. A zero counter "
"never establishes peripheral_idle."
msgstr "remaining 描述 DMA 内存传输，不是线上字节。计数器为零绝不证明 peripheral_idle。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:88
msgid "encoder.h"
msgstr "encoder.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Optional raw modulo quadrature encoder observations."
msgstr "可选的原始模数正交编码器观察。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Exact edge counting personality, never a freely combinable mask."
msgstr "精确的边沿计数模式，不是可任意组合的掩码。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Enable only the two cold-selected encoder inputs and counter."
msgstr "仅启用冷装配选定的两个编码器输入与计数器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid ""
"The provider never changes pins, rate, filtering or mode at runtime. Clock, "
"pin and vector leases belong to cold assembly through close."
msgstr "provider 绝不在运行时改变引脚、速率、滤波或模式。时钟、引脚及向量租约从冷装配一直保持到关闭。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "[in] One serialized privileged Thread-mode owner."
msgstr "[in] 一个串行化的特权 Thread-mode 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "SUCCESS or error; a failed write keeps recovery responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或错误；写入失败保留恢复责任。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Observe counter and input-source withdrawal before returning."
msgstr "观察计数器与输入源均已撤离后才返回。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Stop preserves the raw position. It does not release cold resources."
msgstr "停止保留原始位置，不释放冷资源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "[in] The same serialized privileged Thread-mode owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行化的特权 Thread-mode 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "SUCCESS proves source withdrawal; failure retains the session."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明源已撤回；失败保留会话。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Read one modulo position without inferring travel across wraps."
msgstr "读取一个模数位置，不推断跨回绕的行程。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid ""
"observed_at is software observation time, not a sensor edge aperture. "
"Direction, speed, mechanical zero and unbounded signed position need "
"external sampling bounds and product policy. A read cannot reconstruct "
"missed full wraps. No separately read DIR bit is an atomic edge history."
msgstr ""
"observed_at "
"是软件观察时间，不是传感器边沿采样孔径。方向、速度、机械零位及无界有符号位置，需要外部采样约束和产品策略。一次读取无法重建漏掉的完整回绕。单独读取的 "
"DIR 位不是原子边沿历史。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged Thread-mode owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化的特权 Thread-mode 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "[out] Aligned separate output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐的独立输出；拒绝时不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Report exact counter width and selected silicon filter codes."
msgstr "报告精确计数器位宽与选定的硅片过滤器编码。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid ""
"Filter codes and their kernel clock do not qualify noise rejection, physical"
" edge rate or electrical sensor/Board behavior."
msgstr "滤波码及其内核时钟不构成抗噪声、物理边沿速率或传感器及 Board 电气行为的资格结论。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "One raw modulo counter and separate software observation time."
msgstr "一个原始模数计数值与独立的软件观察时间。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Immutable input/filter facts and actual counter enable state."
msgstr "不可变输入／过滤器事实与实际计数器启用状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Shared methods; no ring, request, allocation, callback or worker."
msgstr "共享方法；无环形缓冲、请求、分配、回调或工作线程。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:90
msgid "Immutable identity; exact private state owns the whole controller."
msgstr "不可变身份；精确的私有状态拥有整个控制器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:96
msgid "ethernet.h"
msgstr "ethernet.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Caller-owned untagged Ethernet II frames and receive loans."
msgstr "调用者拥有的无标签 Ethernet II 帧与接收借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Prepare an initialized, unborrowed request and its immutable frame."
msgstr "准备已初始化、未借用的请求及不可变帧。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid ""
"Task owner. Ethernet II only, 14..1514 bytes excluding FCS; no VLAN or "
"length-coded 802.3. Failure changes no request or payload."
msgstr ""
"任务所有者。仅支持 Ethernet II，不含 FCS 时为 14..1514 字节；不支持 VLAN 或以长度编码的 802.3。失败时不修改请求或"
" payload。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Immutable contiguous Ethernet II frame."
msgstr "[in] 不可变、连续的 Ethernet II 帧。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Bytes excluding FCS, from 14 through 1514."
msgstr "[in] 不含 FCS 的字节数，范围为 14..1514。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Absolute provider-clock deadline or NEVER."
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟中的绝对 deadline，或 NEVER。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success, INVALID for frame/overlap, STATE while borrowed."
msgstr "成功；帧或重叠问题返回 INVALID；借用期间返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Admit one frame into caller-owned hardware descriptors."
msgstr "将一个帧准入到调用者拥有的硬件描述符。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid ""
"Privileged serialized task, masks clear. SUCCESS is ACCEPTED. Borrow "
"includes request and frame until acquire-observed SETTLED. Completion "
"reports MAC wire status, never delivery to another application."
msgstr ""
"串行化的特权任务，屏蔽位清零。SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED。借用包含请求和帧，直到以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED。完成报告 "
"MAC 线上状态，绝不表示另一应用已收到数据。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Stable face and live private assembly."
msgstr "[in] 稳定接口及存活的私有装配。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[inout] Prepared storage borrowed on acceptance."
msgstr "[inout] 已准备的存储，在接受时借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success means ACCEPTED; BUSY/STATE/IO/invalid inputs reject."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED；BUSY/STATE/IO 或无效输入均为拒绝。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Close TX admission and drain the shared TX engine without replay."
msgstr "关闭 TX 准入并排空共享 TX 引擎，不重放传输。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid ""
"Task owner. Cancel is controller-wide: other pending TX requests also become"
" CANCELLED. It never revokes a borrow. Stuck sources quarantine. Apply a "
"confirmed link again after successful drain to reopen TX."
msgstr ""
"任务所有者。取消作用于整个控制器：其他待处理 TX 请求也变为 "
"CANCELLED。绝不撤销借用。源卡住时进入隔离。成功排空后，重新应用已确认的链路事实，才重新开放 TX。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Serialized task-owner face."
msgstr "[in] 串行任务所有者接口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[inout] Live request accepted by this instance."
msgstr "[inout] 由本实例接受且仍存活的请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success requests drain; STATE for a foreign request."
msgstr "成功表示请求排空；外来请求返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Task-owner bounded progress; no worker, lock, pool or wait."
msgstr "Task 所有者有界推进；不含执行任务、锁、池或等待。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Serialized task-owner face and live storage."
msgstr "[in] 串行任务所有者接口及存活的存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success, STATE before startup, or invalid context/input."
msgstr "成功；启动前返回 STATE；或返回无效上下文或输入错误。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Task-consumer complete-frame loan; EMPTY creates no borrow."
msgstr "Task 消费者取得完整帧借用；EMPTY 不产生借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Stable started instance and one consumer."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且已启动的实例，以及一个消费者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[out] Exact immutable frame loan, not output storage borrow."
msgstr "[out] 精确且不可变的帧借用，而非对输出存储的借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success, EMPTY without a loan, or invalid state/context."
msgstr "成功；EMPTY 表示未取得借用；或返回无效状态或上下文错误。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Final consumer access; stale, foreign and double releases reject."
msgstr "消费者最后一次访问；拒绝过期、外来及重复释放。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "A held descriptor is never rearmed, even at ring wrap or stop."
msgstr "已持有的描述符绝不重新 arm，即使环回绕或停止时也不例外。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] The same provider identity as acquisition."
msgstr "[in] 与取得借用时相同的 provider 标识。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Exact acquired token after final consumer access."
msgstr "[in] 消费者最后一次访问结束后的精确已取得 token。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success, STATE for an altered token, or invalid input/context."
msgstr "成功；token 被修改时返回 STATE；或返回无效输入或上下文错误。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Copy latched instance/link/error facts; output is not retained."
msgstr "复制锁存的实例／链路／错误事实；不保留输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Stable private instance."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的私有实例。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[out] Unretained output, separate from all provider storage."
msgstr "[out] 不保留引用的输出，与全部 provider 存储分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success, INVALID for output alias, or CONTEXT."
msgstr "成功；输出别名返回 INVALID；或返回 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Apply external PHY observations, not auto-negotiate or invent link."
msgstr "应用外部 PHY 观察，不自动协商或虚构链路。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid ""
"Task owner; changing speed/duplex first requires explicit link-down and "
"observed idle TX/RX engines and FIFOs. BUSY keeps the old mode. Reapplying "
"an unchanged up fact is idempotent. Link-down closes admission and drains "
"pending TX with IO; later up requires real quiescence. This is not a PHY "
"power/reset/electrical proof."
msgstr ""
"任务所有者；更改速率或双工模式前，必须显式 link-down，并观察到 TX/RX 引擎及 FIFO 空闲。BUSY 保留旧模式。重新应用未改变的 "
"up 事实是幂等操作。link-down 关闭准入，以 IO 排空待处理 TX；后续 up 要求真实静止。这不构成 PHY 电源、复位或电气证明。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Observed up/speed/duplex fact, never a guess."
msgstr "[in] 已观察的 up、速率及双工事实，绝非猜测。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success, BUSY until real drain, or STATE/IO/context error."
msgstr "成功；真实排空前返回 BUSY；或返回 STATE/IO/上下文错误。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Close admission and withdraw MAC/DMA/IRQ sources with readback."
msgstr "关闭准入，通过读回确认撤离 MAC/DMA/IRQ 源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid ""
"Task owner. Closing rejects new RX loans; existing loans still release. BUSY"
" retains hardware/storage/wake ownership; timeout quarantines pending TX. "
"Held RX loans remain valid and must be released before SUCCESS. Caller joins"
" IRQ/consumers before reclaiming storage."
msgstr ""
"任务所有者。关闭时拒绝新的 RX 借用；既有借用仍可释放。BUSY 保留硬件、存储及 wake 所有权；超时隔离待处理 TX。已持有的 RX "
"借用仍有效，必须在 SUCCESS 前释放。调用方回收存储前，须等待 IRQ 及消费者退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Live face and all storage, including held loans."
msgstr "[in] 存活的接口和全部存储，包含已持有借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success releases sources; BUSY/IO retain remaining ownership."
msgstr "成功释放各源；BUSY/IO 保留剩余所有权。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Bind an optional borrowed hint after actual IRQ-policy validation."
msgstr "验证实际 IRQ 策略后绑定可选借用提示。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid ""
"Task owner with no pending TX; notify is bounded and legal in IRQ. Service "
"does not invoke the IRQ hint from a task. Detach after stop."
msgstr ""
"没有待处理 TX 的任务所有者；notify 必须有界，并在 IRQ 中合法。service 不会在任务中调用 IRQ 提示。停止后再分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Started serialized task-owner face."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的串行任务所有者接口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Borrowed IRQ hint; NULL requests detach."
msgstr "[in] 借用的 IRQ 提示；NULL 表示请求分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "[in] Exact configured unshifted syscall ceiling."
msgstr "[in] 精确配置的未移位 syscall 数值阈值。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Success, BUSY while publishers live, or policy/context error."
msgstr "成功；发布者存活时返回 BUSY；或返回策略或上下文错误。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Caller-owned immutable contiguous frame, excluding its hardware FCS."
msgstr "调用者拥有的不可变连续帧，不含硬件 FCS。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Observed PHY fact, supplied explicitly by the external link owner."
msgstr "观察到的 PHY 事实，由外部链路所有者显式供给。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Complete immutable frame; release requires this exact incarnation."
msgstr "完整不可变帧；释放必须匹配准确实例世代。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid ""
"data excludes FCS; storage stays live until matching release. Copying a "
"token does not create a second loan. Timestamp is acquisition, not SOF."
msgstr "data 不含 FCS；存储保持存活直到匹配的 release。复制 token 不会建立第二个借用。时间戳为取得时间，不是 SOF。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:98
msgid "Latched facts survive receive backpressure and failed wake hints."
msgstr "锁存事实不因接收背压或唤醒提示失败而丢失。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:104
msgid "ethernet_frames.h"
msgstr "ethernet_frames.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Optional scatter-gather frame and MAC-clock loans."
msgstr "可选的 scatter-gather 帧及 MAC 时钟借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Physical qualification is separate from software validation."
msgstr "实物资格验证与软件验证彼此独立。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Capture diagnostics; UNKNOWN stamp remains unusable measurement."
msgstr "捕获诊断；UNKNOWN 时间戳仍不能用于测量。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Prepare unborrowed request storage without hardware effects."
msgstr "准备尚未借用的请求存储，不产生硬件效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid ""
"Serialized task owner. Validate nonempty fragments, overflow and the "
"complete Ethernet II header across fragments; permit one in-band C-tag. "
"Untagged length is 14..1514, tagged 18..1518, excluding FCS. Hardware "
"inserts padding/FCS. Length-coded 802.3, QinQ and 0x88A8 reject. Failure "
"preserves request and retains no references. Deadline is an absolute "
"monotonic provider time, distinct from the PTP clock domain."
msgstr ""
"串行任务所有者。验证非空 fragment、溢出及跨 fragment 的完整 Ethernet II 头；允许一个带内 C-tag。不含 FCS "
"时，无标签长度为 14..1514，带标签长度为 18..1518。由硬件插入填充及 FCS。拒绝以长度编码的 802.3、QinQ 及 "
"0x88A8。失败时保留请求原状，不保留引用。deadline 为 provider 的绝对单调时间，与 PTP 时钟域不同。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "ACCEPT one complete frame after all storage and slots are validated."
msgstr "验证全部存储与槽后，才 ACCEPT 一个完整帧。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid ""
"Task owner, privileged/unmasked; no pool, heap, worker or OS lock. REJECTED "
"retains no references or OWN effects. ACCEPTED borrows request, fragment "
"array and every payload until acquire-observed SETTLED. One returned "
"descriptor does not prove wire completion. transferred is whole frame bytes "
"on proven MAC success, otherwise zero."
msgstr ""
"特权且未屏蔽中断的任务所有者；无池、堆、worker 或 OS 锁。REJECTED 不保留引用或 OWN 效果。ACCEPTED "
"借用请求、fragment 数组及每段 payload，直到以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED。归还一个描述符不证明线上发送完成。仅在已证明"
" MAC 成功时，transferred 才为完整帧字节数，否则为零。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Request controller-wide TX withdrawal without replay."
msgstr "请求控制器范围内的 TX 撤离，不重放。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid ""
"Other pending TX are cancelled too; observed completed wire success can win."
" No cancellation revokes a borrow. Missing drain proof keeps QUARANTINED "
"loans. This does not reset the shared MAC/PTP/RX owner."
msgstr ""
"其他待处理 TX 也会取消；已观察到的线上发送成功可以优先成立。取消绝不撤销借用。缺少排空证明时保留 QUARANTINED 借用。不会复位共享的 "
"MAC/PTP/RX 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Bounded task progress; IRQ handles at most one descriptor per side."
msgstr "有界的任务进展；IRQ 每次在每个方向上最多处理一个描述符。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Acquire one complete frame with whole-frame capacity admission."
msgstr "按完整帧容量准入，取得一个完整帧。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid ""
"One task consumer. EMPTY creates no loan; OVERFLOW for too few views leaves "
"the complete frame queued and all outputs unchanged. Stop closes new "
"acquisitions. Held descriptors are never rearmed at wrap or stop."
msgstr ""
"一个任务消费者。EMPTY 不建立借用；views 太少时返回 "
"OVERFLOW，完整帧仍留在队列中，全部输出不变。停止关闭新取得操作。已持有描述符在回绕或停止时均不重新 arm。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Final consumer access; stale/altered/foreign/double release rejects."
msgstr "消费者的最终访问；拒绝过期、被修改、外来或重复释放。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Copy latched facts to unretained output disjoint from every loan."
msgstr "将锁存事实复制到不保留的输出；输出与全部借用存储不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Read a coherent current hardware counter in its own domain."
msgstr "在硬件计数器自身时钟域中读取一致的当前计数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid ""
"No clock synchronization, UTC mapping, acquired-time fallback or PHY "
"compensation. source is SERVICE_OBSERVATION, not an SFD event. The owner "
"extends seconds wrap and rejects regression, overflow and ambiguous gaps; "
"ticks are nanoseconds with rate1e9 and unknown uncertainty."
msgstr ""
"既不提供时钟同步、UTC 映射或 PHY 补偿，也不以取得时间作为回退值。source 为 SERVICE_OBSERVATION，不是 SFD "
"事件。所有者扩展秒回绕，拒绝回退、溢出及有歧义的间隔；ticks 为纳秒，rate 为 1e9，不确定度未知。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Apply explicit external PHY observation after real TX/RX quiet."
msgstr "在真实 TX/RX 静默后应用显式的外部 PHY 观察。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Close admission and prove DMA/MAC/IRQ withdrawal before release."
msgstr "关闭准入，证明 DMA/MAC/IRQ 已撤离后才释放。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid ""
"Held RX and captured publishers retain ownership. Any failure keeps "
"unfinished leases. Do not flush a nonempty TX FIFO to fake quiet. Caller "
"joins all external producers/consumers/observers separately."
msgstr ""
"已持有的 RX 借用及已取得引用的发布者保留所有权。任何失败均保留未完成租约。不得冲洗非空 TX FIFO "
"来伪造静止。调用方还须分别等待全部外部生产者、消费者及观察者退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Explicit recovery by the exclusive MAC owner after failed drain."
msgstr "排空失败后，由独占 MAC 所有者显式恢复。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid ""
"Task owner; finite absolute deadline. Held RX or captured publishers return "
"BUSY without reset. Reset acknowledgement is mandatory before detached "
"pending TX can settle with their locked terminal cause; never report wire "
"success without its actual status. No auto replay. Reset invalidates the old"
" hardware clock epoch and records an RX gap. Source failure/timeout retains "
"QUARANTINED loans and recovery responsibility."
msgstr ""
"任务所有者；使用有限绝对 deadline。存在已持有 RX 借用或已取得引用的发布者时，返回 BUSY 且不复位。已分离的待处理 TX "
"以其锁定的终结原因结算前，必须确认复位；没有实际状态时绝不报告线上成功。无自动重放。复位使旧硬件时钟 epoch 失效，并记录 RX "
"间隙。源失败或超时保留 QUARANTINED 借用及恢复责任。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Optional borrowed IRQ hint; validate actual priority, detach/join."
msgstr "可选的借用 IRQ 提示；验证实际优先级，撤离引用并等待发布者退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Immutable TX fragment; its bytes remain borrowed until SETTLED."
msgstr "不可变的 TX 片段；其字节持续借用至 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Single in-band 0x8100 C-tag; TCI is host-order, with PCP/DEI/VID."
msgstr "单个带内 0x8100 C-tag；TCI 使用主机字节序，含 PCP/DEI/VID。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "One whole L2 frame, excluding preamble, hardware pad and hardware FCS."
msgstr "一个完整 L2 帧，不含前导码、硬件填充和硬件 FCS。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid ""
"The fragment array and every fragment remain borrowed after ACCEPTED. "
"Requested TX capture is optional: wire success may have an unavailable or "
"corrupt stamp. Read stamp only after acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr ""
"ACCEPTED 后，fragment 数组及每个 fragment 均保持借用。请求 TX "
"捕获是可选的：即使线上成功，时间戳仍可能不可用或损坏。仅在以 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED 后读取时间戳。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "One complete receive loan over all descriptors of one frame."
msgstr "一个帧全部描述符上的完整接收借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid ""
"Output fragment views exclude FCS, even when FCS spans two buffers. The "
"views array is an unretained output. Its underlying bytes stay immutable "
"until exact release. Copying this token creates no loan."
msgstr ""
"输出 fragment views 不包含 FCS，即使 FCS 跨越两个缓冲区。views 数组是不保留引用的输出；底层字节在精确 release "
"前保持不可变。复制此 token 不建立借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:106
msgid "Latched engine facts and selected clock epoch, not protocol state."
msgstr "锁存的引擎事实与选定时钟 epoch，不是协议状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:112
msgid "exti.h"
msgstr "exti.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "Static EXTI line bindings, bounded event storage and drain."
msgstr "静态 EXTI 线路绑定、有界事件存储与排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "Read queued EXTI events from an exact static line binding."
msgstr "从准确静态线路绑定读取排队 EXTI 事件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "[inout] One consumer; bounded configured IRQ-producer storage."
msgstr "[inout] 一个消费者；按配置有界的 IRQ 生产者存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "[out] Caller destination, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 调用方目的存储，绝不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[in] Destination event count."
msgstr "[in] 目的事件数量。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "[out] Copied events; loss is observable via event flags."
msgstr "[out] 已复制事件；可通过事件标志观察丢失。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "Success, EMPTY or INVALID. No debounce policy or callbacks."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY 或 INVALID。不提供消抖策略或回调。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "Disable the line source, clear pending and drain its handler."
msgstr "禁用线路源、清除 pending 并排空处理函数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid ""
"Failed withdrawal may already have disabled part of the source. Retry and "
"observe success before reclaiming event or wake storage. Face and state "
"remain live while a shared dispatch domain still refers to them."
msgstr "撤回失败时，可能已经禁用了部分源。回收事件或 wake 存储前须重试并观察到成功。共享派发域仍引用接口或状态期间，二者均须保持存活。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "[inout] Execution owner; consumer/writers must quiesce first."
msgstr "[inout] 执行所有者；消费者及写入者必须先静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid ""
"Success proves no remaining accesses to event storage; BUSY or IO retains "
"storage, wake targets and cleanup responsibility. Shared vectors preserve "
"other lines."
msgstr "成功证明不再访问事件存储；BUSY 或 IO 保留存储、wake 目标及清理责任。共享向量保留其他线路。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "Attach or detach an explicit event/loss IRQ wake target."
msgstr "附加或解除显式事件／丢失 IRQ 唤醒目标。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid ""
"Actual shared-vector priority must satisfy the target. Stop and join "
"publishers before freeing old target storage. Wake callbacks observe "
"already-latched event or loss facts."
msgstr "实际共享向量优先级必须满足目标要求。释放旧目标存储前，先停止并等待发布者退出。wake 回调观察的是已锁存的事件或丢失事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "[in] Initialized line, controlled by one task executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的 line，由一个任务执行者控制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "[in] Immutable live target, or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变且存活的目标；NULL 表示分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid "Edge facts; timestamp precision and coalescing are provider-specific."
msgstr "边沿事实；时间戳精度与合并行为由提供者决定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:114
msgid ""
"LOSS is an independent boundary after older buffered facts and before later "
"facts. Its edge is invalid; its timestamp is detection/report time, never a "
"reconstructed missing edge. For COALESCED facts, edge may derive from "
"sampled pin level after an IRQ and does not represent complete edge history."
msgstr ""
"LOSS 是独立边界，排在较旧缓冲事实之后、后续事实之前。其 edge 无效；时间戳为检测或报告时间，绝不重建丢失边沿。对于 COALESCED "
"事实，edge 可能由 IRQ 后采样的引脚电平推导，不代表完整边沿历史。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:120
msgid "flash.h"
msgstr "flash.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Full physical Flash geometry and explicit bounded regions."
msgstr "完整物理 Flash 几何与显式有界区域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Physical programming requirements beyond unit alignment."
msgstr "超出单元对齐要求的物理编程约束。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Query exact physical Flash geometry without side effects."
msgstr "无副作用地查询准确物理 Flash 几何。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Selected exact-density physical Flash provider."
msgstr "[in] 选中的精确密度物理 Flash provider。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Immutable geometry, or NULL for invalid port."
msgstr "不可变几何信息；端口无效时返回 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Read bounded physical Flash without retaining destination."
msgstr "有界读取物理 Flash，不保留目标存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Fixed provider; no concurrent erase/program."
msgstr "[in] 固定 provider；不得并发擦除或编程。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Physical relative offset."
msgstr "[in] 物理相对偏移。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[out] Destination not retained beyond return."
msgstr "[out] 目标存储；返回后不再保留。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Byte count; zero permitted with NULL data."
msgstr "[in] 字节数；为零时允许 data 为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Success or INVALID; no access on rejected range/overflow."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；范围被拒绝或发生回绕时不进行访问。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Program aligned physical Flash and settle all hardware pulses."
msgstr "对齐编程物理 Flash，并结清全部硬件脉冲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid ""
"Task-only CPU-active operation. Product owns execution-from- Flash stall, "
"watchdog and power-loss policy. No RAM fake on MCU."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文、由 CPU 主动执行的操作。从 Flash 执行时的停顿、看门狗和掉电策略由产品负责。MCU 上不以 RAM 模拟 Flash。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid ""
"With NX_FLASH_PROGRAM_REQUIRES_FRESH_ERASE, each programmed unit needs a "
"successful erase and no later program pulse. Reading all 0xff cannot prove "
"this on ECC Flash. A failed or interrupted pulse consumes its unit until the"
" next successful sector erase. The caller owns this provenance; providers "
"keep no implicit erase-history bitmap."
msgstr ""
"使用 NX_FLASH_PROGRAM_REQUIRES_FRESH_ERASE 时，每个待编程单元必须经过成功擦除，且擦除后尚未经历任何编程脉冲。在带"
" ECC 的 Flash 上，读到全 0xff "
"不能证明这一点。失败或中断的脉冲会消耗该单元，直到下次成功擦除所属扇区。调用方负责此来源证明；provider 不维护隐式擦除历史位图。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid ""
"All-0xff input units must not issue a program pulse. A provider may reject a"
" visibly non-erased destination."
msgstr "输入全为 0xff 的单元不得触发编程脉冲。provider 可以拒绝从可见内容判断尚未擦除的目标。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[inout] Single execution owner with valid voltage/clock policy."
msgstr "[inout] 具有有效电压/时钟策略的唯一执行所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Program-unit aligned physical offset."
msgstr "[in] 按编程单元对齐的物理偏移。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Aligned-length input retained only until return."
msgstr "[in] 长度已对齐的输入，仅借用到返回。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Positive program-unit multiple."
msgstr "[in] 正的编程单元整数倍。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline checked between hardware pulses."
msgstr "[in] 在硬件脉冲之间检查的绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO. Return proves no remaining buffer/hardware "
"access; an active pulse cannot be preempted."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO。返回证明已无缓冲区或硬件访问；已开始的脉冲不能被抢占。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Erase a whole physical sector range with pulse settlement."
msgstr "擦除完整物理扇区范围，并结清脉冲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[inout] Single execution owner."
msgstr "[inout] 唯一执行所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Exact sector-start physical offset."
msgstr "[in] 精确位于扇区起点的物理偏移。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Positive sum of whole sectors."
msgstr "[in] 若干完整扇区长度之和，且为正值。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline checked between erase pulses."
msgstr "[in] 在擦除脉冲之间检查的绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO; partial erase is possible on timeout/error. "
"Return waits for current pulse to become idle."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO；超时或错误可能只完成部分擦除。返回前等待当前脉冲进入空闲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Validate region bounds against physical geometry."
msgstr "根据物理几何验证区域边界。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Explicit caller-owned region description."
msgstr "[in] 调用方显式持有的区域描述。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Success or INVALID; erase geometry is checked per operation."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；每次操作分别检查擦除几何。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Read within an explicit physical region."
msgstr "在显式物理区域内读取。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Valid region."
msgstr "[in] 有效区域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Region-relative byte offset."
msgstr "[in] 相对于区域的字节偏移。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[out] Destination buffer."
msgstr "[out] 目标缓冲区。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Byte count."
msgstr "[in] 字节数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Success or INVALID without access outside the region."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID，不访问区域以外的地址。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Program within an explicitly writable physical region."
msgstr "在显式可写物理区域内编程。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Valid writable region."
msgstr "[in] 有效且可写的区域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Region-relative aligned offset."
msgstr "[in] 相对于区域的已对齐偏移。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Input buffer; borrowed until return only."
msgstr "[in] 输入缓冲区；仅借用到返回。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Aligned positive length."
msgstr "[in] 已对齐的正长度。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Absolute pulse deadline."
msgstr "[in] 绝对脉冲 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Success, INVALID/PERMISSION or underlying pulse result."
msgstr "成功、INVALID/PERMISSION 或底层脉冲操作的结果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Erase whole physical sectors within a writable region."
msgstr "在可写区域内擦除完整物理扇区。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Explicit valid writable region."
msgstr "[in] 显式有效且可写的区域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Region-relative sector boundary."
msgstr "[in] 相对于区域的扇区边界。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "[in] Sum of whole sector lengths."
msgstr "[in] 完整扇区长度之和。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Erase sector geometry, with offset relative to full physical Flash."
msgstr "擦除扇区几何，偏移相对于完整物理 Flash。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Read-only physical geometry; platform reserves no product storage."
msgstr "只读物理几何；平台不预留产品存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid ""
"program_flags states additional unit requirements. Zero does not waive the "
"selected provider's programming rules."
msgstr "program_flags 声明额外的单元要求。零值不免除所选 provider 的编程规则。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:122
msgid "Explicit consumer-selected bounds; no implicit product partition."
msgstr "消费者显式选择的边界，不含隐式产品分区。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:128
msgid "gpio.h"
msgstr "gpio.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "Fixed GPIO authorization masks and bounded port operations."
msgstr "固定 GPIO 授权掩码与有界端口操作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "Atomically set/reset one port's authorized output mask."
msgstr "原子设置／复位一个端口的授权输出掩码。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded, no wait. One serialized writer owns the binding. Stop/mode"
" changes require writers and IRQ quiescence."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中均有界且不等待。一个串行化写入者拥有此绑定。停止或切换模式前必须使写入者及 IRQ 静默。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "[in] Fixed initialized binding, no registry or OS lock."
msgstr "[in] 固定且已初始化的绑定，无注册表或 OS 锁。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "[in] Authorized bits to set."
msgstr "[in] 获授权的置位位集。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "[in] Authorized bits to reset; disjoint from set_mask."
msgstr "[in] 获授权的复位位集；须与 set_mask 不相交。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or INVALID/PERMISSION before any register write."
msgstr "返回 NX_SUCCESS，或在任何寄存器写入前返回 INVALID/PERMISSION。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "Read one input snapshot restricted to the binding mask."
msgstr "读取受绑定掩码限制的单次输入快照。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "[in] Fixed initialized binding."
msgstr "[in] 固定且已初始化的绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "[out] Masked input snapshot; unchanged on error."
msgstr "[out] 掩码处理后的输入快照；错误时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or NX_ERROR_INVALID. No cross-port simultaneity."
msgstr "返回 NX_SUCCESS 或 NX_ERROR_INVALID。不保证跨端口同时采样。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "Toggle authorized outputs under the single-writer contract."
msgstr "在单写者合同下翻转授权输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "Read-modify-write is not atomic against unrelated writes."
msgstr "相对于无关写入，读改写不是原子操作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "[in] Fixed output binding with a serialized writer."
msgstr "[in] 具有串行化写入者的固定输出绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "[in] Authorized subset to toggle."
msgstr "[in] 获授权、需要翻转的子集。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:130
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or INVALID/PERMISSION before register writes."
msgstr "返回 NX_SUCCESS，或在寄存器写入前返回 INVALID/PERMISSION。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:136
msgid "i2c.h"
msgstr "i2c.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Address endpoints, repeated START and explicit STOP settlement."
msgstr "地址端点、重复 START 与显式 STOP 结清。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"Maintained finite-message admission bounds, checked before hardware access."
msgstr "维护范围内的有限消息准入边界，访问硬件之前检查。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Execute a polling 7-bit-address message transaction."
msgstr "执行一个轮询、7 位地址消息事务。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"Task-only, one executor. No hidden scan or GPIO recovery. Failed bus "
"recovery is never reported as transfer success."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，由一个执行者负责。没有隐式扫描或 GPIO 恢复。总线恢复失败绝不报告为传输成功。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
