msgstr "[in] 固定的地址/控制器绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[inout] Message buffers; write data are not modified."
msgstr "[inout] 消息缓冲区；写入方向的数据不会被修改。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] One through NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGES."
msgstr "[in] 1..NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGES 条。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "[in] Finite absolute provider-clock deadline."
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟域中的有限绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"[out] Provider byte progress across messages, including error returns. TX "
"may count bytes handed to the data register before their wire/ACK outcome is"
" known."
msgstr ""
"[out] provider 跨消息记录的字节进度，错误返回时也提供。TX 可能已统计交给数据寄存器的字节，而此时尚不知道线上传输或 ACK 结果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/ "
"NACK/ARBITRATION/IO. Each message has 1..NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGE_BYTES bytes; any"
" message may read or write. Return releases buffers after STOP/abort drain. "
"Controller settlement does not establish bus recovery."
msgstr ""
"成功或 "
"INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/NACK/ARBITRATION/IO。每条消息包含 "
"1..NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGE_BYTES 字节，可独立选择读或写。返回前完成 STOP/中止排空并归还缓冲区。控制器结清不代表总线已恢复。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Recover an idle controller after a bus fault."
msgstr "总线故障后恢复空闲控制器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[inout] Single executor, no live transaction/buffer borrow."
msgstr "[inout] 唯一执行者；不存在活跃事务或缓冲区借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"Success only when hardware bus idle is observed; otherwise "
"BUSY/IO/UNSUPPORTED. Does not replay a failed transaction."
msgstr "仅观察到硬件总线空闲时成功；否则返回 BUSY/IO/UNSUPPORTED。不重放失败事务。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Prepare an unborrowed request without copying payload."
msgstr "准备未借用请求，不复制载荷。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"Payloads cannot overlap control storage, nor a read span overlap an "
"immutable write span. Limits match polling."
msgstr "payload 不得与控制存储重叠，读取范围也不得与不可变的写入范围重叠。限制与轮询模式一致。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED storage"
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的 READY 存储，或已消费的 SETTLED 存储"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[inout] One through eight complete descriptors"
msgstr "[inout] 1..8 个完整描述符"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Exact descriptor count"
msgstr "[in] 精确的描述符数量"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Absolute provider-clock deadline"
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟域中的绝对 deadline"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, UNSUPPORTED or STATE; no new loan"
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID、UNSUPPORTED 或 STATE；不产生新借用"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Validate finite descriptors and payload/control separation."
msgstr "验证有限描述符以及载荷／控制存储分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"Bounded cold check. Provider separately validates state, context and DMA "
"domains before acquiring any loan."
msgstr "有界冷态检查。provider 在取得任何借用前另行验证状态、上下文及 DMA 域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Complete caller-owned request, not retained"
msgstr "[in] 完整且由调用方持有的请求，不予保留"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED without mutation"
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED，不修改输入"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Admit one finite asynchronous repeated-START transaction."
msgstr "准入一个有限、异步、重复 START 事务。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"Selected modes declare DMA domains. DMA completion alone never establishes "
"wire/STOP drain or borrow release. Any admitted abort requires explicit "
"local recover before reuse; recovery never replays or pulses Board GPIO "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"选中模式声明 DMA 域。仅 DMA 完成不能证明线上/STOP 排空或借用归还。任何已接受的中止均须先显式本地恢复才能复用；恢复不重放事务，也不在 "
"Board GPIO 上产生脉冲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Initialized fixed address and single executor"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的固定地址及唯一执行者"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[inout] READY descriptor and all referenced storage"
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符及其引用的全部存储"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; rejection retains no references"
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；拒绝不保留任何引用"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Start an already borrowed QUEUED request without readmission."
msgstr "启动已借用的 QUEUED 请求，不重复准入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Other errors require adapter settlement; no polling fallback."
msgstr "其他错误要求由适配器结清；不回退为轮询。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Fixed address on the adapter's exact controller"
msgstr "[in] 位于适配器精确控制器上的固定地址"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[inout] Adapter-admitted QUEUED storage"
msgstr "[inout] 经适配器准入的 QUEUED 存储"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "SUCCESS hands execution to provider; BUSY retains QUEUED"
msgstr "SUCCESS 将执行权交给 provider；BUSY 保持 QUEUED"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Prove controller identity without hardware effects."
msgstr "证明控制器身份，不产生硬件效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Immutable addressed child"
msgstr "[in] 不可变的带地址子对象"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Exact execution controller"
msgstr "[in] 精确的执行控制器"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "True only for matching provider state and compatible methods"
msgstr "仅当 provider 状态匹配且方法兼容时为真"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Request cancellation without reclaiming any storage."
msgstr "请求取消，不回收任何存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Same single executor as submit/service"
msgstr "[in] 与 submit/service 相同的唯一执行者"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[inout] Exact active descriptor, never a stale raw pointer"
msgstr "[inout] 精确的活跃描述符，不得使用陈旧裸指针"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "SUCCESS begins drain; STATE for another request"
msgstr "SUCCESS 开始排空；其他请求返回 STATE"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Advance deadline and STOP/DMA drain in bounded task context."
msgstr "在有界 Task 上下文处理截止时间，并推进 STOP/DMA 排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"Final publication follows source detach and local wire idle. Drain failure "
"quarantines all storage. This invokes no payload completion callback and "
"never automatically replays."
msgstr "最终发布发生在来源分离及本地线上空闲之后。排空失败会隔离全部存储。不调用 payload 完成回调，也绝不自动重放。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Live single executor, serviced throughout stop"
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的唯一执行者，在整个停止过程中持续调用 service"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Close admission and stop only after every borrower drains."
msgstr "关闭准入，全部借用者排空后才停止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Controller with external producers quiesced"
msgstr "[in] 外部生产者已静默的控制器"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "SUCCESS releases sources; BUSY requires continued service"
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明来源已撤回；BUSY 要求继续 service"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Attach one optional hint sink after actual IRQ policy checks."
msgstr "检查实际 IRQ 策略后附加一个可选提示接收端。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Task-only. Sink remains alive until successful stop/detach."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文。sink 须保持有效，直到成功停止或分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Initialized asynchronous controller"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的异步控制器"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Borrowed sink or NULL to detach after publisher exit"
msgstr "[in] 借用的 sink；或在发布者退出后使用 NULL 分离"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "[in] Cannot weaken selected kernel policy"
msgstr "[in] 不得削弱选中的内核策略"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "SUCCESS or rejection before replacing any live binding"
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS，或在替换任何活跃绑定前拒绝"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"One message; a new message starts with repeated START, final with STOP."
msgstr "一个消息；新消息以重复 START 开始，最后以 STOP 结束。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid "Caller-owned finite message sequence."
msgstr "调用者拥有的有限消息序列。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:138
msgid ""
"Descriptors and payloads remain borrowed until SETTLED. Writes stay "
"immutable; reads receive into caller storage. Cancellation, deadlines and "
"quarantine never revoke loans."
msgstr ""
"描述符与 payload 保持借用直到 SETTLED。写入数据保持不可变；读取数据写入调用方存储。取消、deadline 和隔离均不撤销借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:144
msgid "i2c_bus_clear.h"
msgstr "i2c_bus_clear.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Explicit open-drain I2C bus clear with retained leases."
msgstr "显式开漏 I2C 总线清理，保留租约。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Maximum completed recovery low/high periods per attempt."
msgstr "每次尝试中允许完成的恢复低／高电平周期上限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Bind explicit electrical operations without touching pins."
msgstr "绑定显式电气操作，不接触引脚。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "[inout] Fresh zeroed session or a session with no lease."
msgstr "[inout] 新的清零会话，或没有租约的会话。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"[in] All five methods required; caller verifies electrical authorization "
"rather than relying on generic GPIO APIs."
msgstr "[in] 必须具备全部五个方法；调用方须验证电气授权，不能依赖通用 GPIO API 推定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "[in] Required bounded monotonic read in one boot domain."
msgstr "[in] 必需的、有界的同一启动域内单调时间读取。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "[in] Reviewed nonzero low/high/STOP/poll durations."
msgstr "[in] 已审查且非零的低电平/高电平/STOP/轮询时长。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID or BUSY for a retained lease. Rejection leaves the session "
"and external resources unchanged."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID，或因保留租约而返回 BUSY。拒绝使会话及外部资源保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Clear one idle, authorized bus with at most nine pulses."
msgstr "用至多九个脉冲清理一个空闲、已授权总线。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"Task-only, all other bus users quiescent. Timing evidence and actual open-"
"drain behavior require physical HIL."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，其他总线使用者均已静默。时序证据及实际开漏行为需要物理 HIL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "[inout] Initialized session with no retained lease."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且无保留租约的会话。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "[in] Finite absolute primary-operation deadline."
msgstr "[in] 主要操作的有限绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"[in] Finite absolute STOP/lease deadline in the same clock domain, at or "
"after deadline."
msgstr "[in] 同一时钟域中的有限绝对 STOP/租约 deadline，不得早于 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "[out] Independent primary/cleanup and retained effects."
msgstr "[out] 独立的主要/清理结果及保留效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"Primary failure, otherwise cleanup result. Invalid inputs and an existing "
"lease reject without callbacks or changing result. An expired primary "
"deadline has no pin effects. Each released SCL must be physically HIGH "
"before timing its high period. A frozen/reversed clock reports IO and exits "
"rather than spinning. Every acquired attempt performs explicit STOP cleanup "
"under its independent budget; failed STOP or release method retains the "
"lease. If release succeeds after its deadline, cleanup reports TIMEOUT with "
"lease_held false to preserve actual returned ownership. It never replays the"
" failed I2C transaction or retries recovery pulses."
msgstr ""
"主要操作失败时返回该失败，否则返回清理结果。无效输入或已有租约会被拒绝，不调用回调，也不改变 result。主要 deadline "
"已到期时不产生引脚效果。每次释放 SCL 后，必须先观察到物理 HIGH，再计其高电平时长。时钟冻结或倒退时报告 IO "
"并退出，不持续空转。每次已取得所有权的尝试均在独立预算内显式执行 STOP 清理；STOP 或 release 方法失败会保留租约。若 release "
"在其 deadline 之后成功，清理报告 TIMEOUT，但 lease_held 为 false，以保留实际已经归还所有权的事实。绝不重放失败的 "
"I2C 事务，也不重试恢复脉冲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Retry only retained STOP cleanup and ownership return."
msgstr "仅重试保留的 STOP 清理与所有权归还。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "[inout] Initialized session with a retained lease."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且保留租约的会话。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "[in] New finite absolute cleanup deadline."
msgstr "[in] 新的有限绝对清理 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "[out] Preserved primary/pulse count and latest cleanup."
msgstr "[out] 保留的主要结果/脉冲数及最新清理结果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"Latest cleanup result; INVALID/STATE rejects without effects. A proved STOP "
"is not repeated after release fails. Failure retains the lease and must not "
"trigger a new clear or transaction. Success does not change a failed primary"
" operation into success."
msgstr ""
"返回最新清理结果；INVALID/STATE 拒绝且无效果。release 失败后，不重复已经证明完成的 "
"STOP。失败保留租约，不得因此开始新的总线清理或事务。成功不会将主要操作的失败改为成功。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Read-only methods for an authorized two-pin GPIO handoff."
msgstr "授权双引脚 GPIO 交接的只读方法。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"Task-only, one executor. acquire is a bounded, nonblocking handoff: success "
"proves the controller, DMA, IRQs, other masters and pin users quiescent, "
"both physical pins exclusively leased in reviewed open-drain GPIO mode, with"
" both lines released. Failure retains no lease or effects. drive only sinks "
"LOW or releases a pin; false never means drive HIGH. When scl_low is true, "
"drive establishes SCL LOW before changing SDA, including a retry from "
"unknown previous pin state. sample reads physical levels, not output "
"latches. Methods are bounded and preserve the lease on errors. release "
"restores the saved peripheral/pin ownership only on success; failure retains"
" all lease/storage responsibility. wait_until uses the injected clock's "
"finite absolute domain and reaches target or reports an error within a "
"caller- proved finite bound, even if the clock stops. Late waits cannot "
"qualify an expired operation. No callback may recursively operate on this "
"session or run a transaction. The adapter must verify reviewed open-drain, "
"pull-up, voltage and two-pin authorization facts before acquire."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，由一个执行者负责。acquire "
"是有界、非阻塞的交接：成功证明控制器、DMA、IRQ、其他主机及引脚使用者均已静默；两个物理引脚已按审查过的开漏 GPIO "
"模式独占租用，且两根线均已释放。失败不保留租约或效果。drive 只拉 LOW 或释放引脚；false 绝不表示主动驱动 HIGH。scl_low 为 "
"true 时，drive 先建立 SCL LOW，再改变 SDA，包括从未知先前引脚状态重试的情况。sample "
"读取物理电平，而不是输出锁存值。方法均有界，错误时保留租约。release "
"仅在成功时恢复保存的外设/引脚所有权；失败保留全部租约/存储责任。wait_until "
"使用注入时钟中的有限绝对时间域，即使时钟停止，也须在调用方已证明的有限上界内到达 target "
"或报告错误。迟到的等待不能使已到期操作获得资格。任何回调均不得递归操作本会话或运行事务。适配器在 acquire "
"前必须验证经过审查的开漏、上拉、电压及双引脚授权事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Explicit immutable GPIO methods and caller-owned adapter state."
msgstr "显式不可变 GPIO 方法与调用者拥有的适配器状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Caller-selected electrical timings in microseconds."
msgstr "调用者选择的电气时序，单位为微秒。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"All fields are nonzero. low/high bound each clear pulse; stop_setup bounds "
"the observed SCL-high to SDA-release interval. stretch_poll bounds the "
"interval between actual SCL samples. Values need board/device electrical "
"review; the mechanism supplies no universal safe defaults."
msgstr ""
"全部字段均非零。low/high 约束每个清理脉冲；stop_setup 约束观察到 SCL 高电平至释放 SDA 的间隔。stretch_poll "
"约束实际 SCL 采样之间的间隔。这些值需要板卡/器件电气审查；机制不提供通用安全默认值。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Independent recovery and STOP/ownership-return results."
msgstr "分别记录恢复结果与 STOP／所有权归还结果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"pulses counts completed recovery low/high periods, not the STOP preparation "
"edge. stop_observed proves the requested STOP sequence ended with both "
"sampled lines HIGH. lease_held means the adapter, session and context must "
"remain alive and no controller transaction may start. A cleanup failure "
"never replaces the primary failure."
msgstr ""
"pulses 统计已完成的恢复低/高电平周期，不统计准备 STOP 的边沿。stop_observed 证明请求的 STOP "
"序列结束时，两根线的采样均为 HIGH。lease_held 表示适配器、会话及上下文必须保持有效，且不得启动控制器事务。清理失败绝不替换主要失败。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid "Caller-owned, zero-initialized single-executor session."
msgstr "调用者拥有、零初始化的单执行者会话。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:146
msgid ""
"Public fields are mechanism storage, not caller controls. Methods, context "
"and clock outlive every retained lease. No allocation, worker, lock, "
"transaction buffer or hidden retry exists. Abandoning a retained lease "
"requires explicit product quarantine/reset responsibility."
msgstr ""
"公共字段用于机制内部存储，不是调用方控制项。方法、上下文及 clock "
"的生命周期覆盖每个保留租约。不存在分配、worker、锁、事务缓冲区或隐式重试。放弃保留租约必须显式承接产品隔离/复位责任。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:152
msgid "i2c_long.h"
msgstr "i2c_long.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "Optional bounded long I2C messages without extra START."
msgstr "可选的有界 I2C 长消息，不产生额外 START。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "Validate complete messages before acquiring any hardware."
msgstr "取得任何硬件之前验证完整消息。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid ""
"Each message has 1..65535 bytes. A mutable read cannot overlap a write span "
"or descriptor storage. Write data and descriptors stay immutable throughout "
"a transaction."
msgstr "每条消息包含 1..65535 字节。可修改的读取范围不得与写入范围或描述符存储重叠。写入数据和描述符在整个事务期间保持不可变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "[in] Caller-owned finite descriptors and data"
msgstr "[in] 调用方持有的有限描述符及数据"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "[in] One through NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGES"
msgstr "[in] 1..NX_I2C_MAX_MESSAGES 条"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED; no references retained"
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED；不保留任何引用"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "Execute finite messages without splitting address phases."
msgstr "执行有限消息，不拆分地址阶段。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid ""
"Task-only, one executor shared with base I2C. Each message issues one START;"
" only a following message issues repeated START. Hardware reload does not "
"split messages. Final STOP and bus-idle observation precede successful "
"return. Failure never replays a prefix. Failed abort drain cannot return and"
" release borrowed storage. No implicit bus recovery occurs."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，与基础 I2C 共用一个执行者。每条消息发出一次 START；只有后续消息发出重复 START。硬件 reload 不拆分消息。最终 "
"STOP 和总线空闲观察先于成功返回。失败绝不重放前缀。中止排空失败时，不能返回并归还借用存储。不执行隐式总线恢复。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "[in] Selected optional long-message provider"
msgstr "[in] 选中的可选长消息 provider"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "[inout] Descriptors and buffers borrowed until return"
msgstr "[inout] 借用至返回的描述符和缓冲区"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "[in] Finite absolute provider-clock deadline"
msgstr "[in] provider 时钟域中的有限绝对 deadline"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid ""
"[out] Register byte progress, including failure; TX count does not prove "
"those bytes were ACKed on wire"
msgstr "[out] 包含失败情况的寄存器字节进度；TX 计数不能证明这些字节已在线上获得 ACK"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/ "
"NACK/ARBITRATION/IO after local controller drain"
msgstr ""
"本地控制器排空后返回 SUCCESS 或 "
"INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/NACK/ARBITRATION/IO"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "Shared read-only optional long-message implementation."
msgstr "共享只读的可选长消息实现。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "Optional immutable face; controller state is shared with base I2C."
msgstr "可选不可变接口；控制器状态与基础 I2C 共享。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:154
msgid "Face and private context outlive callers. No queue or heap is owned."
msgstr "接口和私有上下文的生命周期覆盖所有调用方。不拥有队列或堆。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:160
msgid "lptim.h"
msgstr "lptim.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Finite 16-bit counter shots in a distinct tick domain."
msgstr "在独立 tick 域中执行有限的 16 位计数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Prepare initialized unborrowed storage with copied shot metadata."
msgstr "把复制的计数元数据准备到已初始化且未借用的存储中。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"Complete spans must be aligned, nonwrapping and disjoint. No loan, clock "
"access, unit conversion or physical rate qualification occurs."
msgstr "完整存储范围必须对齐、不发生地址回绕且互不重叠。该操作不建立借用、不访问时钟、不转换单位，也不证明物理速率。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[inout] READY or consumed SETTLED with all observers joined."
msgstr "[inout] READY 或结果已消费的 SETTLED 存储，且所有观察者均已 join。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[in] Separate nonzero owner/generation value copied here."
msgstr "[in] 在此复制独立、非零的 owner／代次值。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[in] Exact positive count, 1..65536, in this domain's ticks."
msgstr "[in] 精确的正计数，范围为 1..65536，单位是该域的 tick。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Absolute Core monotonic deadline or NX_DEADLINE_NEVER."
msgstr "[in] 绝对 Core 单调 deadline 或 NX_DEADLINE_NEVER。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; failure leaves every request byte unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；失败保持请求的每个字节不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Copy the live counter domain and declared units on one task owner."
msgstr "由一个任务 owner 复制当前计数域和声明单位。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"Open idle reports counter zero and not running. This finite interface does "
"not reconstruct unobserved wraps or provide an absolute clock."
msgstr "开放且空闲时报告计数器为零且未运行。此有限接口不恢复未观察到的回绕，也不提供绝对时钟。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[in] Serialized immutable face; no concurrent model/lifecycle."
msgstr "[in] 串行访问的只读接口面；不允许并发模型／生命周期操作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[out] Separate aligned writable snapshot."
msgstr "[out] 独立、对齐且可写的快照。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, STATE if closed, or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED; rejected output is "
"unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS、关闭时的 STATE 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED；拒绝时输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Borrow one READY shot after all idle/domain/range checks."
msgstr "完成空闲／域／范围检查后借用一个 READY 计数请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"Expired finite deadline rejects TIMEOUT before source effects. Reserve a "
"final nonwrapping domain increment before acceptance: EXHAUSTED never "
"abandons a previously accepted loan. Clock context lifetime, complete "
"extent/disjointness and non-reentry are assembly responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"有限 deadline 已到期时，在产生请求源效果前返回 TIMEOUT。接受请求前预留最终不回绕的域递增：EXHAUSTED "
"绝不丢弃此前已经接受的借用。时钟上下文生命周期、完整范围／不重叠及不可重入由装配方负责。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[in] Same serialized owner with a copied external Core clock."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 owner，持有复制的外部 Core 时钟接口面。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[inout] Caller request; no queue or hidden worker."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方请求；没有队列或隐藏 worker。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/EXHAUSTED/UNSUPPORTED "
"rejects without retained references or effects."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/EXHAUSTED/UNSUPPORTED "
"表示拒绝，不保留引用或效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Accept cancellation, retaining the loan until proved withdrawal."
msgstr "接受取消，但保持借用直到证明已撤源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"Cancel/stop may win before unobserved event/expiry. First cause stays fixed;"
" transferred counts final source progress at actual withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"cancel／stop 可以在尚未观察到事件／到期之前先锁存原因。首次原因保持不变；transferred 记录真实撤源时最终的请求源进度。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[in] Same serialized executor; no implicit cross-task locking."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行执行者；没有隐式跨任务锁。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[inout] Exact active identity; foreign identity is not read."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的活动请求身份；不读取其他请求身份指向的存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"SUCCESS may still mean QUARANTINED; rejection is STATE/INVALID/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 仍可能表示 QUARANTINED；拒绝返回 STATE/INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Observe deadline/event and continue bounded real withdrawal."
msgstr "观察 deadline／事件，并继续有界的真实撤源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"First observed expiry wins over pending completion. Clear all source, "
"pending and owner references before final release SETTLED publication."
msgstr ""
"首次观察到的到期优先于 pending 完成事件。最终以 release 发布 SETTLED 前，清除全部请求源、pending 和 owner "
"引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[in] Same serialized task owner; no implicit source advance."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行任务 owner；不隐式推进请求源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"SUCCESS when idle/settled, BUSY while active or withdrawal is held; "
"INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED may reject dispatch."
msgstr ""
"空闲／已结清时返回 SUCCESS，活动或撤源被 hold 阻止时返回 BUSY；INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED 可以拒绝分发。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Close admission; cancelled/expired is never a loan-release proof."
msgstr "关闭准入；取消／到期绝不是借用已归还的证明。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"Repeated clean stop is safe; it does not reset generation or lifetime. Tick "
"rate/source and backup/Stop/VBAT continuity need separate hardware "
"contracts; this interface establishes none of those qualifications."
msgstr ""
"重复执行已完成的干净 stop 是安全的；它不重置代次或生命周期。tick 速率／请求源和备份／Stop／VBAT "
"连续性需要独立硬件合同；此接口不建立这些验证资格。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "[in] Serialized owner, with all external publishers quiescent."
msgstr "[in] 串行 owner，且所有外部发布者均已静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after detachment, BUSY retains quarantined storage; "
"INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED may reject dispatch."
msgstr "脱离引用后返回 SUCCESS，BUSY 保留隔离存储；INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED 可以拒绝分发。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Owner and nonwrapping shot incarnation, never an RTC/Core token."
msgstr "owner 与不回绕的计数代次，绝不是 RTC/Core token。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"Identity is compared without dereference. Tokens/observers must be retired "
"before the owner storage lifetime ends or its address is reused."
msgstr "仅比较身份，不解引用。结束 owner 存储生命周期或复用其地址前，必须退役所有 token／观察者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Declared units and modulo counter, not an absolute time estimate."
msgstr "声明单位与模计数值，不是绝对时间估计。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"A complete 65536-tick shot wraps counter to zero. Counter zero alone cannot "
"establish completion, idle, missed wraps or low-power continuity. tick_hz is"
" a fixed declared rate, not physical oscillator accuracy."
msgstr ""
"完整的 65536 tick 计数会把计数器回绕到零。单凭计数器为零不能证明完成、空闲、遗漏回绕或低功耗连续性。tick_hz "
"是固定声明速率，不是物理振荡器精度。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "One caller-owned finite shot; transferred is final observed ticks."
msgstr "一次由调用方持有的有限计数；transferred 是最终观察到的 tick 数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid ""
"Initialize base first. After ACCEPTED keep the entire request live and "
"caller immutable until acquire-observed SETTLED and external joins. A "
"latched CANCELLED/TIMEOUT fixes the cause, not the final progress: held "
"withdrawal may allow further source ticks before detachment."
msgstr ""
"先初始化 base。ACCEPTED 后，保持整个请求有效且调用方不可修改，直到以 acquire 观察到 SETTLED 并完成外部 join。锁存的"
" CANCELLED/TIMEOUT 固定终止原因，而不是最终进度：撤源被 hold 阻止时，脱离前请求源仍可能继续累计 tick。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Shared readonly methods implement the corresponding public contract."
msgstr "共享只读方法实现相应公共合同。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:162
msgid "Immutable two-pointer face; provider storage remains private."
msgstr "只读双指针接口面；provider 存储保持私有。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:168
msgid "mdio.h"
msgstr "mdio.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "Narrow Clause22 station management with absolute deadlines."
msgstr "使用绝对截止时间的窄接口 Clause22 站点管理。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "Read one Clause22 PHY register without retaining output storage."
msgstr "读取一个 Clause22 PHY 寄存器，不保留输出存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged task, incoming masks clear; finite absolute deadline "
"in the provider clock. Address and register are 0..31. BUSY rejects before "
"new MMIO effects; timeout does not pretend busy cleared."
msgstr ""
"串行化的特权任务调用，进入时中断屏蔽均清除；deadline 是 provider 时钟域中的有限绝对时间。地址和寄存器均为 0..31。BUSY "
"在产生新 MMIO 效果前拒绝；超时不伪称 busy 已清除。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "[in] Stable face and caller-owned execution context."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的接口及调用方持有的执行上下文。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "[in] Clause22 PHY address, from 0 through 31."
msgstr "[in] Clause22 PHY 地址，0..31。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "[in] Clause22 register address, from 0 through 31."
msgstr "[in] Clause22 寄存器地址，0..31。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "[out] Written only after timely observed completion."
msgstr "[out] 仅在及时观察到完成后写入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "Success, BUSY without a new command, or timeout/input/context error."
msgstr "成功、不发出新命令的 BUSY，或超时/输入/上下文错误。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "Write one Clause22 PHY register, not a PHY-specific policy sequence."
msgstr "写入一个 Clause22 PHY 寄存器，不实现特定 PHY 策略序列。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
msgid "Same task/deadline rules as read. No IRQ-masked busy wait or fallback."
msgstr "与 read 相同的任务/deadline 规则。不在屏蔽 IRQ 时忙等，也不回退。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:170
