msgid "Inject inability to prove SPI hardware drain."
msgstr "注入无法证明 SPI 硬件排空的失败。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
msgid ""
"Retained requests become QUARANTINED until hold is released and the executor"
" services the bus again. No loan is revoked."
msgstr "保留请求转为 QUARANTINED，直到解除 hold，且执行者再次 service 总线。不撤销任何借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
msgid "Inject UART IDLE and publish its current valid byte prefix."
msgstr "注入 UART IDLE，并发布当前有效字节前缀。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
msgid ""
"Success, EMPTY without a prefix, STATE outside a running block stream, BUSY "
"while its modeled writer is active, or INVALID for a foreign provider. No "
"producer loan is revoked."
msgstr ""
"成功、无前缀时返回 EMPTY、未运行块流时返回 STATE、模型写入者活跃时返回 BUSY，或其他 provider 返回 "
"INVALID。不撤销生产者借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
msgid "Inject one ADC timer-trigger scan into a free selected block."
msgstr "向选定空闲块注入一次 ADC 定时器触发扫描。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
msgid ""
"Each success publishes one interleaved raw-count scan; partial failed scans "
"are detached and never published."
msgstr "每次成功发布一次交错排列的原始计数扫描；失败的部分扫描先分离，绝不发布。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
msgid ""
"Success, OVERFLOW while a required block remains held, IO for a failed scan,"
" STATE after stop, or INVALID for a foreign provider. No hardware cadence or"
" analog accuracy is claimed."
msgstr ""
"成功、必需 block 仍被持有时返回 OVERFLOW、扫描失败返回 IO、停止后返回 STATE，或其他 provider 返回 "
"INVALID。不声称硬件节拍或模拟精度。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
msgid "Fixed model bindings; no allocation, lookup, probe or construction."
msgstr "固定模型绑定；不分配、不查找、不探测、不构造。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:178
msgid ""
"UART storage belongs to the fixture until port stop and IRQ quiescence."
msgstr "UART 存储归夹具所有，直到端口停止且 IRQ 静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:184
msgid "observation.h"
msgstr "observation.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "Explicit timestamp provenance and checked service dispatch."
msgstr "显式时间戳来源与经过检查的服务派发。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "Observation location; software time never implies hardware SOF."
msgstr "观察位置；软件时间不表示硬件 SOF。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "Compare two explicitly related observed events."
msgstr "比较两个关系已明确的观察事件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ pure constant work; no clock, hardware, allocation, lock or "
"reference retention. Inputs may coincide. The caller proves event pairing "
"and timestamp provenance. Different explicit source kinds may be compared to"
" observe delivery latency, without relabeling either observation."
msgstr ""
"任务/IRQ "
"中均为纯操作且工作量恒定；不读取时钟、不访问硬件、不分配、不加锁，也不保留引用。输入可以重合。调用方负责证明事件配对及时间戳来源。可以比较不同的显式来源种类以观察交付时延，但不得重新标记任一观察。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "[in] Stable aligned first fact, not concurrently modified."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、已对齐且未被并发修改的首个事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "[in] Stable last fact in the same domain, epoch and rate."
msgstr "[in] 同一时间域、epoch 和速率中稳定的末个事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "[out] Distinct aligned result, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐的结果，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed/overlapping storage, UNSUPPORTED for UNKNOWN "
"source, STATE for incompatible domains or reversed ticks, EXHAUSTED for "
"bound overflow."
msgstr ""
"返回 SUCCESS；存储格式无效或重叠时返回 INVALID，来源为 UNKNOWN 时返回 UNSUPPORTED，时间域不兼容或 tick "
"倒退时返回 STATE，上界溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "Dispatch the selected UART service or explain its absence."
msgstr "派发选定的 UART 服务，或说明服务缺失。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid ""
"Same context, serialization and lifetime rules as ordinary service. SUCCESS "
"proves dispatch only, not progress, health, settlement or permission to "
"reclaim storage. This reads no request and adds no state, lock or hidden "
"worker."
msgstr ""
"与普通 service 采用相同的上下文、串行化和生命周期规则。SUCCESS "
"仅证明已派发，不证明进展、健康、结清或允许回收存储。不读取请求，不增加状态、锁或隐藏 worker。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "[in] Live immutable face and initialized provider state."
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的不可变接口及已初始化的 provider 状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after one dispatch, INVALID for malformed face, UNSUPPORTED when no "
"service method exists."
msgstr "一次派发后返回 SUCCESS；接口格式无效返回 INVALID，没有 service 方法返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "Dispatch the selected SPI service or explain its absence."
msgstr "派发选定的 SPI 服务，或说明服务缺失。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid ""
"Same context and owner rules as nx_spi_port_service; SUCCESS establishes "
"dispatch only, never settlement."
msgstr "与 nx_spi_port_service 采用相同的上下文和所有者规则；SUCCESS 仅证明已派发，绝不代表结清。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "SUCCESS after dispatch, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "派发后返回 SUCCESS，或返回 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "Dispatch the selected I2C service or explain its absence."
msgstr "派发选定的 I2C 服务，或说明服务缺失。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid ""
"Same context and owner rules as nx_i2c_port_service; SUCCESS establishes "
"dispatch only, never settlement."
msgstr "与 nx_i2c_port_service 采用相同的上下文和所有者规则；SUCCESS 仅证明已派发，绝不代表结清。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "Explicit, caller-supplied time fact without clock access."
msgstr "由调用者明确提供的时间事实，不访问时钟。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid ""
"ticks is extended, monotonically increasing within one nonzero domain/epoch."
" Its owner extends counter wrap and changes epoch on reset, discontinuity or"
" rate change. Domain and epoch are assembly-local identities, not clocks "
"synchronized across cores, security domains or devices. UNKNOWN carries no "
"usable measurement. Frequency is exact stated ticks/second, not measured "
"accuracy. A known zero uncertainty states zero error; unknown uncertainty "
"has a separate flag. These facts do not establish physical precision, causal"
" pairing or event identity by themselves."
msgstr ""
"ticks 是扩展计数，在一个非零 domain/epoch 中单调递增。其所有者扩展计数器回绕，并在复位、不连续或速率变化时改变 "
"epoch。domain 和 epoch 是装配内身份，不表示跨核、安全域或设备同步的时钟。UNKNOWN 不提供可用测量。频率是精确声明的 "
"ticks/second，而非实测精度。已知且为零的不确定度表示零误差；未知不确定度使用独立标志。这些事实本身不能建立物理精度、因果配对或事件身份。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid "Delta in one common clock domain, with stated error bound."
msgstr "同一时钟域内的差值，带明确的误差界。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:186
msgid ""
"When uncertainty_known is false, uncertainty_ticks is zero and describes no "
"error bound. No conversion, rounding or synchronization across clocks is "
"implicit."
msgstr ""
"uncertainty_known 为 false 时，uncertainty_ticks 为零，不描述任何误差界限。不隐含时间转换、舍入或跨时钟同步。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:200
msgid "pwm_adc.h"
msgstr "pwm_adc.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Optional finite coherent PWM / triggered ADC window."
msgstr "可选的有限相干 PWM／触发 ADC 窗口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Prepare distinct unborrowed request, frame and sample storage."
msgstr "准备彼此独立且尚未借用的请求、帧和采样存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"Request, sample span, source frame descriptor and duty span must be "
"naturally aligned, nonwrapping and disjoint. The caller has consumed prior "
"results and joined every adapter observer before preparing again. "
"NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is rejected; an expired finite deadline can be prepared "
"but cannot admit new physical effects. Preparation does not access sample "
"contents, borrow hardware or establish rate/region support. Failure leaves "
"the initialized request unchanged."
msgstr ""
"请求、样本范围、源帧描述符及占空比范围必须自然对齐、地址不回绕且互不重叠。再次准备前，调用方已消费先前结果，并等待所有适配器观察者退出。拒绝 "
"NX_DEADLINE_NEVER；可以准备已到期的有限 "
"deadline，但不得因此准入新的物理效果。准备过程不访问样本内容、不借用硬件，也不建立速率/区域支持。失败使已初始化请求保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "[out] Naturally aligned writable caller sample array."
msgstr "[out] 自然对齐且可写的调用方样本数组。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "[in] Positive exact sample count; provider checks DMA."
msgstr "[in] 精确的正样本数；provider 检查 DMA。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"[in] Readable descriptor copied by value during this call only; its complete"
" duty array remains live through SETTLED."
msgstr "[in] 仅在本次调用中按值复制的可读描述符；完整占空比数组须保持有效直到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "[in] Finite absolute monotonic deadline for the whole window."
msgstr "[in] 整个窗口的有限绝对单调 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; no hardware access or provider borrow."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；不访问硬件，也不产生 provider 借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Admit and arm one complete finite window on the unique task owner."
msgstr "由唯一任务所有者准入并布防一个完整有限窗口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"Post-admission arm/prime failures drain under the accepted request. Normal "
"completion stops the PWM sources before SETTLED and never rearms. DMA TC "
"alone is insufficient for completion or safe output. An error/cancellation "
"reports zero guaranteed valid samples; an aborted DMA remaining count cannot"
" establish a valid prefix. A successful window reports exactly sample_count."
" After successful ordinary completion, another explicitly prepared "
"submission may begin; an explicit stop or latched fault requires cold "
"close/reinitialization. Provider checks context, fixed frame, region and "
"overlap with all cold descriptors/MMIO before admission. The complete duty "
"frame is constant for the window; sample count does not promise an exact PWM"
" pulse count. Without a trusted completion timestamp, completion first "
"observed at or after the request deadline reports TIMEOUT, even if DMA is "
"already complete. This conservative observation rule promises no physical "
"execution-time bound and never relaxes the required source drain."
msgstr ""
"准入后的 arm/预转换失败在已接受请求之下排空。正常完成在 SETTLED 前停止 PWM 来源，且绝不自动重装。仅 DMA TC "
"不足以证明完成或输出安全。错误/取消报告的保证有效样本数为零；中止后的 DMA 剩余计数不能建立有效前缀。成功窗口恰好报告 "
"sample_count。普通操作成功完成后，可以另行显式准备并提交；显式停止或锁存故障则需要冷关闭/重新初始化。准入前，provider "
"检查上下文、固定帧、区域，以及与全部冷态描述符/MMIO 的重叠。整个窗口的完整占空比帧保持恒定；样本数不承诺精确的 PWM "
"脉冲数。没有可信完成时间戳时，首次在请求 deadline 时刻或之后观察到完成会报告 TIMEOUT，即使 DMA "
"已经完成。这一保守观察规则不承诺物理执行时间上界，也绝不放宽必需的来源排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "[in] Initialized stable selected coupled face and cold leases."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且稳定的选中耦合接口及冷租约。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "[inout] Exact READY window prepared by the caller."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方准备的精确 READY 窗口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including a possibly already SETTLED error. "
"Rejection means no retained pointer, payload access or new effect."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，包括可能已经 SETTLED 的错误。拒绝表示不保留指针、不访问 payload，也不产生新效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Latch cancellation while retaining the exact live window loan."
msgstr "锁存取消，同时保留对应活动窗口的借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"Cancellation is task-local and does not provide a cross-task stable "
"identity. Use the established adapter slot/epoch mechanism externally. A "
"prior terminal fault is retained; cancellation never clears it."
msgstr "取消局限于本任务，不提供跨任务稳定身份。外部应使用既有适配器 slot/epoch 机制。先前终态故障保持保留；取消绝不清除它。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "[in] Same live coupled face and serialized privileged task."
msgstr "[in] 同一个仍然有效的耦合接口及串行化特权任务。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "[inout] Exact admitted request, still live until SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的已准入请求，须保持有效直到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "SUCCESS starts/observes cancellation, never implies SETTLED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 开始或观察到取消，绝不代表已经 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Advance bounded completion or source drain on the same task owner."
msgstr "由同一任务所有者推进有界完成或源排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"No hidden worker/wait/allocation. Only observed source/vector withdrawal "
"permits final pointer detach and release publication."
msgstr "没有隐藏 worker、等待或分配。只有观察到来源/向量撤回后，才允许最终指针分离和 release 发布。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after progress/settlement, BUSY while drain remains, or a fault "
"requiring continued recovery service and explicit stop."
msgstr "推进或结清后返回 SUCCESS，排空尚未完成时返回 BUSY；或返回故障，要求继续恢复 service 并显式停止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Close admission and attempt final drain without revoking a loan."
msgstr "关闭准入并尝试最终排空，不撤销借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"Continue the unique service/stop until quiet. Cold close additionally joins "
"vectors and restores saved leases. Fault recovery does not automatically "
"restart PWM or resume acquisition. SUCCESS does not release pads, clocks or "
"private storage. Those cold leases remain held until the platform's final "
"joined close succeeds."
msgstr ""
"继续由唯一执行者 service/stop，直到静默。冷关闭还需等待向量退出并恢复保存的租约。故障恢复不自动重新启动 PWM 或恢复采集。SUCCESS"
" 不释放引脚、时钟或私有存储；这些冷租约保持持有，直到平台最终完成退出汇合并成功关闭。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "SUCCESS proves stopped sources; BUSY/IO retains recovery storage."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明来源已停止；BUSY/IO 保留恢复所需存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Copy exact fixed facts and observed active/fault/quarantine state."
msgstr "复制精确的固定事实与观察到的活动／故障／隔离状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "State is an observation, not a source-drain or release operation."
msgstr "state 是观察操作，不是来源排空或归还操作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "[out] Distinct aligned output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐的输出，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED for a missing method."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT，或因缺少方法而返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "One finite window; transferred counts are raw samples, never bytes."
msgstr "一个有限窗口；传输数量以原始采样为单位，不以字节计。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"Initialize base before first preparation. After successful admission, the "
"request and duty array remain live and caller-immutable through acquire-"
"observed SETTLED. The writable sample span belongs exclusively to the "
"provider; the caller neither reads nor writes it while borrowed. Frame "
"metadata is copied at preparation. No later shadow commit, automatic rearm, "
"control algorithm or engineering-unit conversion is part of this finite-"
"window interface. Hardware-specific sample storage and integer encoding are "
"reported by state.format."
msgstr ""
"首次 prepare 前初始化 base。成功准入后，请求和占空比数组须保持有效且调用方不可修改，直到以 acquire 观察到 "
"SETTLED。可写样本范围由 provider "
"独占；借用期间调用方既不读也不写。帧元数据在准备时复制。本有限窗口接口不包含后续影子提交、自动重装、控制算法或工程单位转换。硬件专有样本存储和整数编码由"
" state.format 报告。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Borrow and release publication state."
msgstr "借用状态与释放发布状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Exclusive writable raw sample storage."
msgstr "独占可写的原始采样存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Positive number of requested samples."
msgstr "请求的采样数量，必须为正。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Copied metadata; duty array is borrowed."
msgstr "复制的元数据；占空比数组保持借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Exact selected facts and observed source/recovery state."
msgstr "精确的选定事实与观察到的源／恢复状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"Format describes actual supported hardware. It does not establish aperture "
"timestamps, analog accuracy, PWM duty epochs, IRQ latency, the number of "
"output pulses or an inspected physical circuit."
msgstr ""
"format 描述实际支持的硬件，不建立采样孔径时间戳、模拟精度、PWM 占空比 epoch、IRQ 时延、输出脉冲数量或已检查物理电路的事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Actual integer storage and provenance."
msgstr "实际整数存储表示与来源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "PWM counter ticks per second."
msgstr "PWM 计数器每秒的计数刻度数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Fixed period in counter ticks."
msgstr "以计数器刻度表示的固定周期。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Fixed phase in counter ticks."
msgstr "以计数器刻度表示的固定相位。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Deadtime in separate deadtime_hz units."
msgstr "以独立的 deadtime_hz 单位表示的死区时间。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Deadtime clock; never inferred from PSC."
msgstr "死区时钟；不得从 PSC 推断。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Complete fixed-order frame width."
msgstr "完整、固定顺序的帧通道数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Provider/DMA finite-window count bound."
msgstr "提供者／DMA 的有限窗口计数上限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Observed source/counter activity."
msgstr "观察到的源／计数器活动状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Latched fault requiring cold recovery."
msgstr "需要冷恢复的锁存故障。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Incomplete withdrawal retains ownership."
msgstr "撤离未完成时保留所有权。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Selected-only operations; no growth to ordinary PWM/ADC tables."
msgstr "仅选定实例具有的操作；普通 PWM／ADC 方法表不增加。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"Each callback implements its corresponding public function contract. One "
"privileged task serializes submit/cancel/service/stop/state; IRQs only latch"
" bounded physical facts into the same private owner. Missing callbacks "
"return UNSUPPORTED. There is no allocating or hidden worker."
msgstr ""
"每个回调实现对应的公共函数契约。一个特权任务串行化 submit/cancel/service/stop/state；IRQ "
"只向同一私有所有者锁存有界物理事实。缺失回调返回 UNSUPPORTED。不进行分配，也没有隐藏 worker。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid "Immutable cold-selected identity, never an allocating factory."
msgstr "不可变的冷装配选定身份；工厂不执行分配。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:202
msgid ""
"Face, operations, context and cold configuration outlive every request and "
"IRQ publisher. One coupled face owns all selected hardware; no independently"
" startable PWM-group or ADC face exposes that hardware."
msgstr ""
"接口、方法表、上下文及冷配置的生命周期覆盖每个请求和 IRQ 发布者。一个耦合接口拥有全部选中硬件；不存在可独立启动的 PWM-group 或 ADC "
"接口暴露该硬件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:208
msgid "pwm_group.h"
msgstr "pwm_group.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "Fixed-base atomic multi-channel PWM shadow commits."
msgstr "固定时基、原子的多通道 PWM 影子提交。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "Stage a complete channel group and its internal trigger comparison."
msgstr "暂存完整通道组及其内部触发比较值。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid ""
"Provider declares exact channel count, trigger range and ISR budget. Duties "
"include zero and period. All channels share one fixed base. A failed partial"
" hardware write must disable output and retain fault responsibility rather "
"than release a mixed group to the next update. Stop is explicit; automatic "
"output recovery after break is prohibited."
msgstr ""
"provider 声明精确的通道数、触发范围及 ISR 预算。占空比包含零与 "
"period。所有通道共用一个固定时基。部分硬件写入失败时必须禁用输出并保留故障责任，不能让混合新旧值的通道组进入下一次更新。停止必须显式进行；禁止 "
"break 后自动恢复输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "[in] One serialized privileged task/configurable-IRQ owner."
msgstr "[in] 一个串行化特权任务/可配置 IRQ 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "[in] Complete readable batch; no pointer is retained on return."
msgstr "[in] 完整且可读的批次；返回后不保留指针。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means one coherent group is staged for a hardware update, not that "
"this update already happened. Invalid input has no effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示一个一致的组已暂存，等待硬件更新，不代表更新已经发生。无效输入没有效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "Start only from disabled outputs and an inactive, cleared break."
msgstr "仅输出已禁用且刹车未激活、已清除时启动。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task owner of all cold leases."
msgstr "[in] 拥有全部冷租约的串行化特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "SUCCESS or an error retaining cleanup and any fault responsibility."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS，或返回错误并保留清理及相应故障责任。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "Withdraw master output, channels, counter and owned IRQ sources."
msgstr "撤离主输出、通道、计数器与拥有的 IRQ 源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid ""
"This source-level promise does not certify the external circuit's electrical"
" safety. Board idle and publisher join belong to assembly."
msgstr "此源码层承诺不认证外部电路的电气安全。Board 空闲电平和发布者汇合属于装配职责。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "[in] Same privileged task owner; cold pin/vector leases persist."
msgstr "[in] 同一个特权任务所有者；冷态引脚/向量租约保持持有。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "SUCCESS proves source withdrawal; failure retains responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明来源已撤回；失败保留责任。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "Explicitly clear fault while disabled after checking actual break."
msgstr "禁用期间检查实际刹车状态后显式清除故障。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task recovery owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权任务恢复所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after coherent shadows and break acknowledgment; never enables "
"outputs. Product power-stage recovery policy stays external."
msgstr "仅在影子值一致且 break 已确认后返回 SUCCESS；绝不使能输出。产品功率级恢复策略仍由外部负责。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "Read fixed units and observed enable/fault facts without starting."
msgstr "读取固定单位与观察到的启用／故障事实，不启动硬件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "[out] Separate writable output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写的输出，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "One synchronous shadow batch; channel order is fixed by assembly."
msgstr "一个同步影子批次；通道顺序由装配固定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "Fixed units, software fault latch and actual hardware enable state."
msgstr "固定单位、软件故障锁存与实际硬件启用状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "Shared operations; commit must prevent partial shadow publication."
msgstr "共享操作；提交必须防止部分影子发布。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:210
msgid "Immutable identity with no default-device state or allocation."
msgstr "不可变身份；无默认设备状态或分配。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:216
msgid "rtc.h"
msgstr "rtc.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Raw calendar and one finite alarm in its own time domain."
msgstr "独立时间域中的原始日历与一次有限 alarm。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Validate raw calendar fields without changing any storage."
msgstr "验证原始日历字段，不改变任何存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Readable naturally aligned value."
msgstr "[in] 可读且自然对齐的值。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; no clock or provider access."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；不访问时钟或 provider。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Validate the finite alarm pattern's day and time ranges."
msgstr "验证有限 alarm 模式的日和时间范围。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; not a promise that a provider can arm it."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；不承诺 provider 能够 armed 该 alarm。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Copy a domain/pattern into initialized unborrowed caller storage."
msgstr "把域／模式复制到已初始化且未被借用的调用方存储中。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"Inputs must be complete, aligned, nonwrapping spans disjoint from request. "
"This cold operation takes no loan and cannot know the complete extent of an "
"opaque provider or clock context. Admission checks the known provider spans;"
" assembly owns opaque-context disjointness."
msgstr ""
"输入必须是完整、对齐、不回绕且与请求不重叠的范围。该冷操作不建立借用，也无法获知不透明 provider 或时钟上下文的完整范围。准入检查已知 "
"provider 范围；不透明上下文的不重叠由装配方负责。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[inout] READY or consumed SETTLED storage, all joins complete."
msgstr "[inout] READY 或结果已消费的 SETTLED 存储，所有 join 已完成。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Nonzero owner/generation copied during this call."
msgstr "[in] 在本次调用中复制非零 owner／代次。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Valid pattern copied during this call."
msgstr "[in] 在本次调用中复制有效模式。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; every failure leaves request unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；所有失败均保持请求不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Copy a set calendar/domain on the single serialized task executor."
msgstr "由唯一串行任务执行者复制已设置的日历／域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Valid immutable live face; no concurrent lifecycle writer."
msgstr "[in] 有效、只读且存活的接口面；不允许并发生命周期写入者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[out] Separate aligned writable output."
msgstr "[out] 独立、对齐且可写的输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or STATE for closed/unset, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED; failure leaves "
"output unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS、关闭／未设置时的 STATE、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED；失败保持输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Set an idle calendar and advance its nonwrapping setting domain."
msgstr "设置空闲日历，并推进不回绕的设置域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"Rejection changes no state. No implicit backup reset, synchronization, Core-"
"time adjustment or authorization to overwrite retained hardware."
msgstr "拒绝不改变状态。不隐式执行备份复位、同步、Core 时间调整，也不授予覆盖保留硬件的权限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Same single serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个唯一串行特权任务 owner。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Separate raw value, copied on successful validation."
msgstr "[in] 独立的原始值，通过验证后复制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, BUSY for a loan, STATE if closed, INVALID, EXHAUSTED or "
"UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、存在借用时的 BUSY、关闭时的 STATE、INVALID、EXHAUSTED 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Borrow and arm one future alarm; no queue, allocation or worker."
msgstr "借用并 armed 一个未来 alarm；没有队列、分配或 worker。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"Closed/stale/already-matching pattern returns STATE; active is BUSY. An "
"observed expired finite deadline returns TIMEOUT before admission. Calendar,"
" counter and Core deadline are separate domains. Assembly keeps the copied "
"clock face's borrowed context live, disjoint and non-reentrant for the "
"entire owner lifetime and all external joins."
msgstr ""
"关闭／域过期／已匹配当前时刻的模式返回 STATE；已有活动请求返回 BUSY。观察到有限 deadline 已到期时，在准入前返回 "
"TIMEOUT。日历、计数器和 Core deadline 分属不同域。在整个 owner 生命周期及所有外部 join "
"期间，装配方保持复制的时钟接口面所借用上下文有效、不重叠且不重入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Initialized serialized owner with a valid copied Core clock."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的串行 owner，持有有效、复制的 Core 时钟接口面。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[inout] Exact READY request for the current setting domain."
msgstr "[inout] 精确属于当前设置域的 READY 请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/UNSUPPORTED rejects "
"without retained references or effects."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；INVALID/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/UNSUPPORTED 表示拒绝，不保留引用或效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Latch cancellation of the exact borrowed request, without revocation."
msgstr "为精确借用的请求锁存取消，但不撤销借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"Cancel/stop executed before service may win over unobserved expiry or event."
" The first terminal cause never changes while withdrawal waits."
msgstr "在 service 前执行 cancel／stop，可以先于尚未观察的到期或事件锁存原因。等待撤源期间首次终止原因始终不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Same serialized executor; cross-task controls need an adapter."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行执行者；跨任务控制需要适配器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"SUCCESS accepts cancellation; it may still be QUARANTINED/borrowed. "
"Rejection is STATE/INVALID/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示已接受取消；请求仍可能处于 QUARANTINED／被借用状态。拒绝返回 STATE/INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Observe deadline/event or continue actual source withdrawal."
msgstr "观察 deadline／事件，或继续真实撤源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"At first observation expiry wins over pending event. Source/pending "
"references detach before release SETTLED, the final provider access."
msgstr ""
"首次观察时，到期优先于 pending 事件。先脱离请求源／pending 引用，再以 release 发布 SETTLED，作为 provider "
"的最终请求访问。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Same serialized task executor; bounded, no hidden wait."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行任务执行者；有界，不隐藏等待。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Close admission and prove withdrawal before returning any loan."
msgstr "关闭准入，并在归还任何借用前证明已撤源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"Clean repeated stop is idempotent. Stop does not reset identity or revoke "
"pointers. Source/provider lifetime still covers external joins."
msgstr "重复执行已完成的干净 stop 是幂等的。stop 不重置身份，也不撤销指针。请求源／provider 的生命周期仍须覆盖外部 join。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "[in] Same serialized owner with external publishers quiescent."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 owner，且外部发布者均已静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"SUCCESS when closed/joined; BUSY retains the quarantined request. "
"INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED may reject dispatch."
msgstr "已关闭且完成 join 时返回 SUCCESS；BUSY 保留隔离请求。INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED 可以拒绝分发。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Raw YY calendar; no UTC, century, timezone or oscillator policy."
msgstr "原始 YY 日历；没有 UTC、世纪、时区或振荡器策略。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"YY is 00..99 and leap years satisfy YY modulo 4 == 0. Weekday is an "
"independent 1..7 value, not inferred from the date. Other fields use "
"month/day 1-based and 24-hour hour/minute/second values, without leap "
"seconds. Natural year99->00 wrap does not reset the setting domain."
msgstr ""
"YY 为 00..99，YY 模 4 等于零时为闰年。星期是独立的 1..7 值，不根据日期推算。其他字段使用从 1 起算的月／日及 24 "
"小时时／分／秒，不含闰秒。自然的 year99->00 回绕不重置设置域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Opaque owner identity and non-repeating setting incarnation."
msgstr "不透明的 owner 身份与不重复的设置代次。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"Compare identity without dereference. Valid only in that owner storage "
"lifetime; retire all tokens/observers before ending or reusing it. This is "
"neither authorization nor a cross-boot/backup-reset identity."
msgstr ""
"只比较身份而不解引用。仅在该 owner 存储生命周期内有效；结束或复用前必须退役全部 token／观察者。它既不授予权限，也不是跨启动／备份复位身份。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Calendar and setting domain copied in one serialized operation."
msgstr "在一次串行操作中复制日历与设置域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Exact future day/time match; no month/year or wildcard masks."
msgstr "精确的未来日／时间匹配；没有月／年或通配掩码。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Caller-owned alarm, borrowed until acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr "调用方持有的 alarm，借用持续到以 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid ""
"Initialize base before first preparation. Domain and pattern are copied by "
"value. After ACCEPTED the complete request remains live and caller immutable"
" through SETTLED and any separate control/observer joins. transferred counts"
" occurrences: SUCCESS is 1, every other result is 0."
msgstr ""
"首次 prepare 前先初始化 base。域和模式按值复制。ACCEPTED 后，完整请求持续有效，且调用方不得修改，直到 SETTLED "
"及所有独立控制者／观察者 join 完成。transferred 以发生次数计：SUCCESS 为 1，其他结果均为 0。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Shared immutable methods with the corresponding public contracts."
msgstr "共享只读方法实现相应公共合同。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:218
msgid "Two-pointer identity; face, ops and context outlive loans/observers."
msgstr "双指针身份；接口面、ops 和 context 的生命周期覆盖借用／观察者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:224
msgid "rtc_lptim_model.h"
msgstr "rtc_lptim_model.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "Explicit host source progression and withdrawal faults."
msgstr "显式主机请求源推进与撤源故障。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "Advance a set raw calendar by bounded explicit source seconds."
msgstr "按有界的显式请求源秒数推进已设置的原始日历。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid ""
"Constant bounded work, at most one date carry. A closed set calendar may "
"advance; this does not reopen admission or prove backup retention. Does not "
"read/advance Core clock, publish, settle or change terminal cause. Source "
"changes are not an IRQ, worker or hardware qualification."
msgstr ""
"工作量固定且有界，最多进位一天。已关闭但已设置的日历仍可推进；这不重新开放准入，也不证明备份保持。不读取／推进 Core "
"时钟，不发布、不结清，也不改变终止原因。请求源变化不是 IRQ、worker 或硬件验证资格。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "[in] Exact Native RTC face, serialized with every public call."
msgstr "[in] 精确的 Native RTC 接口面，与每个公共调用串行执行。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "[in] 0..86400; zero never creates an event."
msgstr "[in] 0..86400；零绝不创建事件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "SUCCESS, STATE if unset/unconstructed, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、未设置／未构造时的 STATE、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "Inject/remove the external inability to withdraw an armed source."
msgstr "注入／解除无法撤回已 armed 请求源的外部条件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "[in] Exact Native RTC face on the same serialized owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行 owner 上精确的 Native RTC 接口面。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "[in] True prevents withdrawal; false only removes the fault."
msgstr "[in] true 阻止撤源；false 只解除故障。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED; never settles a request."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED；绝不结清请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "Advance a finite source, saturating at its exact shot limit."
msgstr "推进有限请求源，并在精确计数上限处饱和。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid ""
"At full65536 the sampled 16-bit counter is zero; pending completion is "
"independent. Held withdrawal permits final progress beyond cancel/time "
"observation. Does not touch the request, terminal cause or Core clock."
msgstr ""
"达到完整的 65536 tick 时，采样的 16 位计数器为零；pending 完成标志与之独立。撤源被 hold "
"阻止时，进度可在观察到取消／时间条件后继续推进。不访问请求、终止原因或 Core 时钟。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "[in] Exact Native LPTIM face, serialized with all public calls."
msgstr "[in] 精确的 Native LPTIM 接口面，与全部公共调用串行执行。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "[in] 0..65536 source ticks; idle/unarmed does not accumulate."
msgstr "[in] 0..65536 个请求源 tick；空闲／未 armed 时不累计。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "Inject/remove withdrawal hold; real public service still drains."
msgstr "注入／解除撤源 hold；仍由真实公共 service 执行排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "[in] Exact Native LPTIM face on the serialized executor."
msgstr "[in] 串行执行者上精确的 Native LPTIM 接口面。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:226
msgid "[in] False does not clear provider references or publish results."
msgstr "[in] false 不清除 provider 引用，也不发布结果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:232
msgid "spi.h"
msgstr "spi.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Single-executor polling SPI endpoints and complete CS transactions."
msgstr "单执行者轮询 SPI 端点与完整 CS 事务。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Explicit single-cell DMA addresses, both borrowed until SETTLED."
msgstr "显式单元素 DMA 地址，两者均借用到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Execute one bounded full-duplex 8-bit polling transaction."
msgstr "执行一个有界、全双工、8 位轮询事务。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Task-only single executor, no allocation/OS lock. One CS interval covers the"
" entire transfer. Deadline cannot preempt an in-flight hardware byte; "
"peripheral drain may exceed it."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，由唯一执行者负责，不分配，也无 OS 锁。一次 CS 有效区间覆盖整个传输。deadline "
"不能抢占正在传输的硬件字节；外设排空可能晚于 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Fixed CS/mode/rate binding on one controller."
msgstr "[in] 一个控制器上的固定 CS/模式/速率绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Transmit bytes, or NULL to send 0xff."
msgstr "[in] 发送字节；NULL 表示发送 0xff。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[out] Receive bytes, or NULL to discard."
msgstr "[out] 接收字节；NULL 表示丢弃。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Positive transfer length; at least one buffer exists."
msgstr "[in] 正的传输长度；至少提供一个缓冲区。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline; includes adapter queue residence."
msgstr "[in] 绝对 deadline；包含在适配器队列中的驻留时间。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[out] Complete bytes; reset to zero before execution."
msgstr "[out] 完整字节数；执行前清零。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Success, BUSY/INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO. Return releases all buffers and CS after "
"drain; polling is CPU-active, not IRQ/DMA async."
msgstr ""
"成功或 BUSY/INVALID/TIMEOUT/IO。排空后返回并归还全部缓冲区及 CS；轮询由 CPU 主动执行，不是 IRQ/DMA 异步。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Recover an idle SPI controller after its retained fault."
msgstr "保留故障后恢复空闲 SPI 控制器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Single executor with no live transaction or CS borrow."
msgstr "[in] 唯一执行者，不存在活跃事务或 CS 借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Success only after reset/idle proof; BUSY/STATE/UNSUPPORTED preserves "
"recovery responsibility and never replays work."
msgstr "仅在证明复位/空闲后成功；BUSY/STATE/UNSUPPORTED 保留恢复责任，绝不重放工作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Prepare an unborrowed finite request without copying buffers."
msgstr "准备未借用的有限请求，不复制缓冲区。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[inout] Fresh initialized or consumed SETTLED descriptor."
msgstr "[inout] 新初始化的描述符，或已消费的 SETTLED 描述符。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"[in] Nonempty TX bytes or NULL when the selected mode supports dummy "
"transmission; immutable through final settlement."
msgstr "[in] 非空 TX 字节；所选模式支持 dummy 发送时可为 NULL；保持不可变直到最终结清。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[out] RX buffer or NULL when the selected mode supports discard."
msgstr "[out] RX 缓冲区；所选模式支持丢弃时可为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Positive byte count with at least one supplied buffer."
msgstr "[in] 正字节数，且至少提供一个缓冲区。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Absolute monotonic deadline including queue time."
msgstr "[in] 包含排队时间的绝对单调 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE; failure creates no buffer loan."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE；失败不产生缓冲区借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Submit one finite asynchronous whole-CS transaction."
msgstr "提交一个有限、异步、覆盖整个 CS 区间的事务。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Task-only bounded admission. Selected modes declare DMA domain/length/buffer"
" requirements. DMA TC alone never proves peripheral idle; the bus executor "
"continues service to SETTLED."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文的有界准入。所选模式声明 DMA 域/长度/缓冲区要求。仅 DMA TC 绝不证明外设空闲；总线执行者继续 service，直到 "
"SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Initialized endpoint on a single-executor bus."
msgstr "[in] 单执行者总线上的已初始化 endpoint。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[inout] READY storage; retained only after NX_SUCCESS."
msgstr "[inout] READY 存储；仅在 NX_SUCCESS 后保留。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Success means ACCEPTED; all rejection errors create zero retained references"
" and zero residual hardware effects."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED；所有拒绝错误均不保留引用，也不产生残余硬件效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Submit explicit incrementing or single-cell DMA memory."
msgstr "提交显式递增或单元素 DMA 内存。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Fixed directions require one byte, other directions length bytes, within "
"reviewed DMA domains. The actual spans must not overlap. All addresses "
"remain borrowed through drain until acquire-observed SETTLED. No hidden "
"scratch is used. Both fixed flags permit explicit clock-only transfers. "
"Request preparation does not retain these flags; only this successful "
"admission selects them. Ordinary submit and the existing owner continue "
"their ordinary buffer contract."
msgstr ""
"固定方向需要一个字节，其他方向需要 length 字节，均位于已审查 DMA 域。实际范围不得重叠。所有地址在排空期间持续借用，直到以 acquire "
"观察到 SETTLED。不使用隐藏 scratch。两个 fixed "
"标志可显式实现仅发时钟的传输。请求准备不保留这些标志；只有本次成功准入才选择它们。普通 submit 和既有所有者仍遵循原有缓冲区契约。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Initialized single-executor DMA endpoint"
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的单执行者 DMA endpoint"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[inout] READY request with two non-NULL caller addresses"
msgstr "[inout] 具有两个非 NULL 调用方地址的 READY 请求"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"[in] TX_FIXED repeats one immutable dummy byte; RX_FIXED repeatedly writes "
"one caller-owned discard byte; zero uses complete incrementing TX/RX buffers"
msgstr ""
"[in] TX_FIXED 重复发送一个不可变 dummy 字节；RX_FIXED 重复写入调用方持有的一个丢弃字节；零表示使用完整且地址递增的 "
"TX/RX 缓冲区"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "ACCEPTED on SUCCESS; other results retain no references"
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；其他结果不保留任何引用"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Start an adapter-admitted QUEUED request without readmission."
msgstr "启动适配器已准入的 QUEUED 请求，不重复准入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Initialized exact CS binding and bus executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的精确 CS 绑定及总线执行者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[inout] Live QUEUED storage already borrowed by its adapter."
msgstr "[inout] 活跃的 QUEUED 存储，已由其适配器借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Success hands execution to the bus; BUSY retains QUEUED. Other errors must "
"be settled by the adapter executor."
msgstr "成功将执行权交给总线；BUSY 保持 QUEUED。其他错误必须由适配器执行者结清。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Verify an endpoint belongs to the serviced bus."
msgstr "验证端点属于所推进的总线。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded cold identity check, no lookup or ownership effects. An "
"adapter checks this before hardware execution; asynchronous admission also "
"checks before borrowing."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中均为有界冷态身份检查，不查找，也不产生所有权效果。适配器在执行硬件前检查；异步准入也在借用前检查。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Immutable endpoint identity kept alive by its caller."
msgstr "[in] 由调用方保持有效的不可变 endpoint 身份。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Exact execution bus bound to an adapter."
msgstr "[in] 绑定到适配器的精确执行总线。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"True only when the provider proves matching controller state and compatible "
"bus methods; false for invalid/missing methods."
msgstr "仅当 provider 证明控制器状态匹配且总线方法兼容时为真；无效或缺少方法时为 false。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Request cancellation without revoking DMA/CS buffer loans."
msgstr "请求取消，不撤销 DMA/CS 缓冲区借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Cross-task controls use stable adapter slots and epochs."
msgstr "跨任务控制使用稳定的适配器 slot 和 epoch。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Same single execution owner as submit and service."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit 和 service 相同的唯一执行所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[inout] Exact live active request, never a stale raw pointer."
msgstr "[inout] 精确、仍然有效的活跃请求，不得使用陈旧裸指针。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Success starts drain or observes prior settlement; STATE for another "
"request, UNSUPPORTED for a polling-only provider."
msgstr "成功开始排空或观察到先前结清；其他请求返回 STATE，仅轮询 provider 返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Advance one asynchronous bus under its single task executor."
msgstr "由唯一 Task 执行者推进一个异步总线。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Bounded no-wait service. Final publication follows DMA/IRQ detach and "
"peripheral-idle proof; failed drain quarantines."
msgstr "有界且不等待的 service。最终发布发生在 DMA/IRQ 分离及证明外设空闲之后；排空失败会隔离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Live provider; call while stopping and throughout drain."
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的 provider；停止及整个排空期间持续调用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Close admission and retain active sources until full drain."
msgstr "关闭准入，完整排空之前保留活动源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] Live bus; all external producers already quiesced."
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的总线；所有外部生产者均已静默。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Success proves source release, BUSY requires service, or UNSUPPORTED when "
"the provider has no asynchronous lifecycle."
msgstr "成功证明来源已撤回，BUSY 要求 service；provider 不提供异步生命周期时返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Attach an optional hint sink to asynchronous bus IRQ publishers."
msgstr "向异步总线 IRQ 发布者附加可选提示接收端。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Join old publishers and waiters before freeing wake storage."
msgstr "释放唤醒存储前，等待旧发布者及等待者退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "[in] One initialized bus controlled by a task executor."
msgstr "[in] 由任务执行者控制的一个已初始化总线。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Success, PERMISSION for unsafe actual priority, CONTEXT/STATE for illegal "
"control or UNSUPPORTED for a polling-only bus."
msgstr "成功；实际优先级不安全时返回 PERMISSION，非法控制返回 CONTEXT/STATE，仅轮询总线返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid "Caller-owned finite SPI request with one whole-CS interval."
msgstr "调用者拥有的有限 SPI 请求，包含一个完整 CS 区间。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:234
msgid ""
"Initialize base before prepare. Accepted requests borrow both non-NULL "
"buffers until acquire-observed SETTLED, including cancellation and timeout "
"drain. QUARANTINED retains the loan."
msgstr ""
"prepare 前初始化 base。已接受请求持续借用 TX/RX 中所有非 NULL 缓冲区，直到以 acquire 观察到 "
"SETTLED，包括取消和超时排空期间。QUARANTINED 保留借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:240
msgid "spi_dma_model.h"
msgstr "spi_dma_model.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "Explicit Native segmented wire and drain fault controls."
msgstr "显式 Native 分段传输与排空故障控制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "Move one modeled wire word or observe its final idle event."
msgstr "推进一个模型传输字，或观察最终空闲事件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid ""
"Caller-scheduled task/model IRQ; no hidden worker. Facts latch before a "
"bounded hint. Never invoke after publisher join. A stopped owner cannot "
"drive a successor's model."
msgstr ""
"由调用方安排任务/模型 IRQ；没有隐藏 worker。有界提示之前先锁存事实。发布者汇合后绝不再调用。已停止的所有者不能驱动后继实例的模型。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "[in] Exact live Native enhanced controller."
msgstr "[in] 精确、仍然有效的 Native 增强控制器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "Select optional single-step progress during task service."
msgstr "选择在任务服务期间进行可选的单步推进。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid ""
"Task-only. Explicit stepping remains available. This model does not "
"establish physical IRQ/DMA timing or HIL."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文。仍可显式逐步推进。此模型不建立物理 IRQ/DMA 时序或 HIL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "[in] Exact live Native enhanced controller, quiescent."
msgstr "[in] 精确、仍然有效且已静默的 Native 增强控制器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "[in] True for one modeled step per service."
msgstr "[in] true 表示每次 service 推进一个模型步骤。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, CONTEXT or BUSY while borrowed."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、CONTEXT，或因借用未结束而返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "Inject or remove inability to prove physical model drain."
msgstr "注入或解除无法证明模型物理排空的故障。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid ""
"Task-only, allowed while borrowed. Removing the fault does not settle; "
"continue model stepping and unique service."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，借用期间允许调用。移除故障不等于结清；继续推进模型并由唯一执行者 service。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "[in] Keep all request/CS loans while true."
msgstr "[in] 为 true 时保留全部请求/CS 借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE or CONTEXT."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE 或 CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "Fail a phase before the selected zero-based wire word."
msgstr "在选定的零基传输字之前使阶段失败。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "Task-only model input; no replay or early loan release."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的模型输入；不重放，也不提前释放借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:242
msgid "[in] SIZE_MAX disables the injected fault."
msgstr "[in] SIZE_MAX 禁用注入故障。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:248
msgid "spi_dma_owner_binding.h"
msgstr "spi_dma_owner_binding.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "Optional immutable segmented SPI ownership and IRQ binding."
msgstr "可选不可变的分段 SPI 所有权与 IRQ 绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "Check exact endpoint membership without hardware effects."
msgstr "检查精确端点归属，不产生硬件效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "No acquisition, initialization, allocation or service."
msgstr "不获取资源、不初始化、不分配，也不执行 service。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "[in] Stable provider-owned immutable capability."
msgstr "[in] 由 provider 拥有、稳定且不可变的能力描述。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "[in] Stable enhanced endpoint on the selected bus."
msgstr "[in] 所选总线上的稳定增强端点。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "False for malformed or foreign identities."
msgstr "身份格式错误或归属不符时返回 false。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "Attach a borrowed hint to actual validated IRQ publishers."
msgstr "将借用的提示接收端附加到实际验证过的 IRQ 发布者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid ""
"Task-only. Rejection leaves the previous binding intact. A hint is never "
"completion. Detach alone does not join a publisher that has already captured"
" the sink. Stop and join publishers and waiters before destroying "
"notification data."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文。拒绝时保留原有绑定。提示不代表完成。仅 detach 不能等待已捕获接收器的发布者退出。销毁通知数据前，须停止并等待发布者和等待者退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "[in] Stable selected controller capability."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的所选控制器能力描述。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid ""
"[in] Immutable sink kept live through publisher join, NULL to detach under "
"the provider's lifecycle contract."
msgstr "[in] 保持有效直到发布者退出的不可变接收器；按 provider 生命周期契约传入 NULL 可解除绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "[in] Actual unshifted kernel threshold."
msgstr "[in] 实际的未移位内核阈值。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT, UNSUPPORTED or provider failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT、UNSUPPORTED 或 provider 失败。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid "Selected-only provider capability without changing IO faces."
msgstr "仅选定实例具有的提供者能力，不修改 IO 接口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:250
msgid ""
"Stable immutable storage outlives executor and publishers. contains proves "
"actual controller identity; a display name or a caller-assembled pair of "
"pointers is not such proof. attach_wake validates actual IRQ sources before "
"borrowing the sink. A missing hook permits explicit periodic service."
msgstr ""
"稳定的不可变存储须比执行器和发布者存活更久。contains 证明实际控制器身份；显示名称或调用方拼装的一对指针不能证明归属。attach_wake "
"在借用接收器前验证实际 IRQ 源。缺少钩子时，可显式周期性执行 service。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:256
msgid "spi_dma_transaction.h"
msgstr "spi_dma_transaction.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "Optional finite whole-CS segmented SPI DMA request contract."
msgstr "可选的有限、完整 CS 区间分段 SPI DMA 请求合同。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "Prepare unborrowed storage after validating every span."
msgstr "验证每个范围后准备尚未借用的存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid ""
"Descriptors and payload never overlap request storage. RX cannot overwrite "
"any TX or descriptor. Repeated RX alias is allowed only for the exact same "
"explicit FIXED discard cell. Provider-specific domains are checked at "
"admission."
msgstr ""
"描述符和载荷不得与请求存储重叠。RX 不得覆盖任何 TX 或描述符。仅当多次 RX 指向同一个显式 FIXED 丢弃单元时，才允许重复别名。准入时检查 "
"provider 特有的内存域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[in] Immutable caller-owned array, at most MAX_SEGMENTS."
msgstr "[in] 调用方拥有的不可变数组，最多 MAX_SEGMENTS 项。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[in] Positive segment count; every words count is positive."
msgstr "[in] 正数段数；每段的 words 均为正数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[in] Common hardware width of 8 or 16 bits."
msgstr "[in] 全部段共用的 8 位或 16 位硬件位宽。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[in] Absolute monotonic deadline for the complete chain."
msgstr "[in] 整条链的绝对单调时限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/STATE; no borrow on failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/STATE；失败时不建立借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "Validate immutable fields without admission or memory modification."
msgstr "验证不可变字段，不执行准入或修改内存。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "Admit one finite chain on a task-only single executor."
msgstr "在仅限任务的单一执行者上准入一个有限链。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid ""
"All domains and segments are validated before admission. One CS interval "
"spans the chain; SCK gaps between segments are permitted. DMA TC alone never"
" establishes wire idle."
msgstr "准入前验证全部内存域和段。整条链共用一个 CS 有效区间；允许段间出现 SCK 间隔。仅有 DMA TC 不能证明线路空闲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[in] Stable enhanced DMA endpoint and provider state."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的增强 DMA 端点及 provider 状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[inout] READY descriptor, retained only on SUCCESS."
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符；仅在 SUCCESS 时保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, possibly already SETTLED. Rejection retains no "
"references and creates no hardware effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，也可能已经 SETTLED。拒绝时不保留引用，也不产生硬件副作用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "Cancel an exact live request while retaining all its loans."
msgstr "取消对应活动请求，同时保留全部借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[in] Same single executor used by submit and service."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit 和 service 共用的同一个单执行者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[inout] Exact current request or acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的当前请求，或已通过 acquire 语义观测为 SETTLED 的请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid ""
"SUCCESS starts/observes cancellation; INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT rejects without "
"revoking any existing loan."
msgstr "SUCCESS 启动或观测取消；INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT 拒绝操作，但不撤销任何已有借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "Advance a bounded phase boundary, completion or drain."
msgstr "推进一个有界阶段边界、完成或排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid ""
"No wait, allocation, payload copy, hidden task or OS lock. Failed "
"drain/release retains QUARANTINED storage. SETTLED follows final hardware "
"detach and CS release and is the provider's final access to caller request "
"and descriptors."
msgstr ""
"不等待、不分配、不复制载荷，也无隐藏任务或 OS 锁。排空或释放失败时保留 QUARANTINED 存储。最终硬件引用撤离且 CS 释放后才发布 "
"SETTLED；这是 provider 对调用方请求和描述符的最后一次访问。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[in] Task-only enhanced controller; continue during stop."
msgstr "[in] 仅限任务上下文的增强控制器；停止过程中仍须继续调用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "Close admission and stop after complete source withdrawal."
msgstr "关闭准入，并在源完整撤离后停止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid ""
"Repeated successful stop never touches hardware again; another owner may "
"already have acquired the controller."
msgstr "成功停止后重复 stop 不再访问硬件；其他所有者可能已取得该控制器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "[in] Stable single-executor state, producers quiesced."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的单执行者状态；生产者已静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid ""
"SUCCESS proves stop; BUSY needs further service and retains all outstanding "
"storage, including quarantined requests."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明已停止；BUSY 表示仍须执行 service，并保留全部未完成存储，包括隔离中的请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "Explicit DMA words with caller-owned dummy/discard cells."
msgstr "显式 DMA 字，使用调用者拥有的填充值／丢弃单元。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid ""
"Both addresses are mandatory. A FIXED direction borrows one word; an "
"incrementing direction borrows words elements. Width is common to all "
"segments. DMA never uses the polling segment's implicit NULL/dummy "
"representation or scratch."
msgstr ""
"两个地址都必须提供。FIXED 方向借用一个字；地址递增方向借用 words 个元素。全部段位宽相同。DMA 不使用轮询段的隐式 NULL/dummy "
"表示，也不使用隐藏暂存区。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid "Caller-owned request retaining every segment through drain."
msgstr "调用者拥有的请求；每个分段持续借用至排空完成。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:258
msgid ""
"Initialize base before prepare. ACCEPTED borrows this object, its descriptor"
" array, all TX/RX spans and fixed cells until acquire-observed SETTLED. "
"Intermediate segment completion, cancellation and timeout never release any "
"of these loans. Completion counts words of successfully settled segments; "
"partial effects in a failed segment remain unquantified."
msgstr ""
"prepare 前先初始化 base。ACCEPTED 借用本对象、描述符数组、全部 TX/RX 范围和固定单元，直到通过 acquire 语义观测到 "
"SETTLED。中间段完成、取消和超时都不释放这些借用。完成计数以成功结算的段中的字数为单位；失败段的部分副作用不作量化。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:264
msgid "spi_transaction.h"
msgstr "spi_transaction.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "Optional multi-segment whole-CS 8/16-bit polling SPI."
msgstr "可选的多分段、完整 CS 区间 8／16 位轮询 SPI。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "Bounded descriptor count; no hidden concatenation buffer exists."
msgstr "描述符数量有界；不存在隐藏的拼接缓冲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "Validate every descriptor and span without hardware effects."
msgstr "验证每个描述符与范围，不产生硬件效果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid ""
"No memory is borrowed, copied, allocated or modified. NULL data pointers are"
" legal dummy/discard operations. This does not validate provider-specific "
"controller, rate or limits."
msgstr ""
"不借用、复制、分配或修改内存。NULL 数据指针可表示合法的填充发送或接收丢弃操作。本检查不验证 provider 特有的控制器、速率或限制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "[in] Aligned immutable array, retained by the caller."
msgstr "[in] 已对齐的不可变数组，由调用方保留。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "[in] Positive descriptor count, at most MAX_SEGMENTS."
msgstr "[in] 正数描述符数量，最多 MAX_SEGMENTS 个。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "[in] Exactly 8 or 16; fixed for the whole CS interval."
msgstr "[in] 只能为 8 或 16；整个 CS 有效区间保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed/overlapping/overflowing spans, or UNSUPPORTED"
" for excess descriptor count or word width."
msgstr "SUCCESS；范围格式错误、重叠或溢出时为 INVALID；描述符数量或字宽超限时为 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "Execute all segments under exactly one asserted CS interval."
msgstr "在同一个 CS 有效区间内执行全部分段。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid ""
"Task-only single executor; polling is CPU-active. Return releases "
"descriptor/payload borrows after wire drain or provider reset and CS "
"release. Deadline cannot preempt an in-flight word. Errors never replay "
"prior segments. No allocation, OS lock, hidden scratch, width changes or CS "
"toggles occur between phases. This is synchronous: existing finite DMA "
"request and cancellation contracts are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文的单执行者；轮询持续占用 CPU。线路排空或 provider 复位，并释放 CS "
"后，函数返回并释放描述符及载荷借用。时限不能抢占正在传输的一个字。错误不重放先前的段。阶段之间不分配、不取得 OS "
"锁、不使用隐藏暂存区，也不改变位宽或切换 CS。这是同步操作：已有的有限 DMA 请求和取消契约保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "[in] Optional enhanced face with stable private state."
msgstr "[in] 可选增强接口，具有稳定的私有状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "[in] Caller-owned descriptors and their data spans."
msgstr "[in] 调用方拥有的描述符及其数据范围。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "[in] Number of phases, all validated before hardware use."
msgstr "[in] 阶段数量；所有阶段均须在硬件使用前验证。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "[in] Common hardware frame width, 8 or 16 bits."
msgstr "[in] 共用的硬件帧位宽，为 8 位或 16 位。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "[in] Absolute monotonic deadline for all phases."
msgstr "[in] 全部阶段共用的绝对单调时限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid ""
"[out] Complete received words, never bytes; separate writable size_t "
"storage, reset before provider execution."
msgstr "[out] 完整接收的字数，单位不是字节；独立可写的 size_t 存储，在执行 provider 前清零。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/IO."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/TIMEOUT/IO。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "One phase within a single CS interval."
msgstr "单个 CS 区间内的一个阶段。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid ""
"Words have the transaction's common width of 8 or 16 bits. NULL TX repeats "
"dummy; NULL RX discards. Both may be NULL for clock-only words. Non-NULL "
"spans contain words elements; 16-bit spans are uint16_t-aligned. Descriptor "
"and TX storage stay immutable until return. RX never overlaps descriptors, "
"TX storage, other RX spans or the completion output. Ordinary byte-span SPI "
"remains a separate unchanged interface."
msgstr ""
"字使用事务共用的 8 位或 16 位位宽。NULL TX 重复发送 dummy；NULL RX 丢弃接收。二者均可为 NULL，仅产生时钟。非 NULL"
" 范围包含 words 个元素；16 位范围须按 uint16_t 对齐。描述符和 TX 存储在返回前保持不可变。RX 不得与描述符、TX 存储、其他 "
"RX 范围或完成计数输出重叠。普通字节范围 SPI 仍为独立且未改变的接口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "Shared immutable methods; absent transfer reports UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "共享不可变方法；缺少传输方法时报告 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:266
msgid "Optional face sharing the selected provider's existing bus state."
msgstr "可选接口，与选定提供者的现有总线状态共享。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:272
msgid "stream.h"
msgstr "stream.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Bounded caller-owned blocks with explicit producer/consumer loans."
msgstr "调用者拥有的有界块与显式生产者／消费者借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Initialize an unborrowed stream and exact supplied block array."
msgstr "初始化未借用的 stream 与准确供给的块数组。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Task-only cold assembly. This helper does not validate DMA domains; the "
"hardware provider must validate every block."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的冷装配。本辅助函数不验证 DMA 内存域；硬件 provider 必须验证每个块。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[out] Fresh storage, not visible to any producer/consumer."
msgstr "[out] 全新存储，尚未向任何生产者或消费者公开。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Buffers distinct from all control and slot metadata."
msgstr "[inout] 与全部控制及槽元数据分离的缓冲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Positive exact block count, not a maximum pool size."
msgstr "[in] 正数精确块数，不是缓冲池最大数量。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Success or INVALID; never allocates or retains bad inputs."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；不分配，也不保留无效输入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Reserve the next free block for one serialized producer."
msgstr "为一个串行生产者预留下一个空闲块。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Bounded task/IRQ metadata operation; payload writes occur outside the short "
"interrupt mask, within the returned loan."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界元数据操作；载荷写入在短暂中断屏蔽区之外、返回的借用范围内执行。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Live initialized stream with one producer."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的活动流，只有一个生产者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[out] Producer loan valid until publish or proved abort."
msgstr "[out] 生产者借用，在 publish 或经证明的 abort 前有效。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Success, OVERFLOW without overwrite, STATE while stopping or EXHAUSTED when "
"the monotonic loan identity cannot advance."
msgstr "成功；OVERFLOW 不覆盖数据；停止时返回 STATE；单调借用身份无法递增时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Query the next physical slot without creating a loan or loss."
msgstr "查询下一个物理槽，不产生借用或丢失。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded hint. A producer still calls reserve before accessing "
"payload; another context must not race admission."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界提示。生产者仍须先调用 reserve 才能访问载荷；其他上下文不得与准入并发竞争。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Live initialized stream with one serialized producer."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的活动流，只有一个串行化生产者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "True only when admission is open and the next slot is free."
msgstr "仅在准入开放且下一个槽空闲时返回 true。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Latch explicitly observed dropped producer boundaries."
msgstr "锁存明确观察到的生产者丢弃边界。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded. Saturates at UINT32_MAX; the next published block carries "
"LOSS independently of its useful payload length."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界操作。在 UINT32_MAX 饱和；下一个发布块携带 LOSS，与其有效载荷长度无关。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Live stream controlled by the serialized producer."
msgstr "[inout] 由串行化生产者控制的活动流。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Positive lost block/boundary count, never guessed bytes."
msgstr "[in] 丢失块或边界的正数数量，不能猜测字节数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Publish a complete block after all hardware writes detached."
msgstr "全部硬件写引用撤离后，发布完整块。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded. A DMA half/full flag is insufficient if the engine can "
"still write the published block. Consumer-visible block bytes stay immutable"
" until the consumer releases them."
msgstr ""
"任务/IRQ 中的有界操作。如果引擎仍能写入所发布的块，DMA 半完成/全完成标志就不足以证明可发布。消费者可见的块字节在消费者释放前保持不可变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Same serialized producer as reserve."
msgstr "[inout] 与 reserve 相同的串行化生产者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Current producer loan, not retained after publication."
msgstr "[in] 当前生产者借用；发布后不再保留该令牌引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Positive produced bytes within the reserved capacity."
msgstr "[in] 预留容量范围内的正数已生产字节数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] IDLE/TRIGGER boundaries observed by the provider."
msgstr "[in] provider 实际观测到的 IDLE/TRIGGER 边界。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; failure retains producer ownership."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；失败时保留生产者所有权。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Acquire the next ready block for one serialized consumer."
msgstr "一个串行消费者取得下一个就绪块。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded metadata; consumer processing happens outside the mask. "
"Release may occur out of order without overwrite."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界元数据操作；消费者在屏蔽区外处理载荷。可乱序释放，且不会覆盖仍被持有的数据。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Live stream; consumer may drain during stop."
msgstr "[inout] 活动流；停止过程中消费者仍可排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[out] Immutable consumer loan with exact incarnation token."
msgstr "[out] 带精确代次令牌的不可变消费者借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Success, EMPTY or INVALID; empty creates no loan."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY 或 INVALID；空流不建立借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Release only the matching consumer incarnation after final use."
msgstr "最终使用之后，仅释放匹配的消费者实例世代。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Task/IRQ bounded; release is the consumer's final block access."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界操作；release 是消费者对该块的最后一次访问。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Same consumer owner; no remaining observers of block."
msgstr "[inout] 同一消费者所有者；不再有该块的剩余观测者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Exact acquired token, never a reconstructed pointer."
msgstr "[in] 精确的已获取令牌，不能重新拼装指针代替。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Success, STATE for stale/double release or INVALID."
msgstr "成功；过期或重复释放返回 STATE；也可能返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Abort a producer loan only after memory write sources detach."
msgstr "仅内存写入源撤离之后中止生产者借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Cancellation/deadline alone never establishes quiescence."
msgstr "仅取消或达到时限不能证明已静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Same producer owner as reserve."
msgstr "[inout] 与 reserve 相同的生产者所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Current exact loan."
msgstr "[in] 当前的精确借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] True only after provider proves DMA/IRQ stopped."
msgstr "[in] 仅在 provider 证明 DMA/IRQ 已停止后才为 true。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Success, BUSY without proven drain, STATE for a stale token."
msgstr "成功；排空未获证明时为 BUSY；令牌过期时为 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Close producer admission while retaining every outstanding loan."
msgstr "关闭生产者准入，保留每一个未结清借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ constant metadata work independent of block count. This operation "
"does not stop hardware or revoke loans."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的常量元数据工作量，与块数无关。本操作不停止硬件，也不撤销借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Live control kept alive until final successful stop."
msgstr "[inout] 活动控制对象，须保持有效直到最后一次 stop 成功。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Success only when all blocks are free, BUSY until producers detach and "
"consumers drain/release, INVALID for bad control."
msgstr "仅在全部块空闲时成功；生产者引用撤离且消费者排空并释放之前返回 BUSY；控制对象无效时返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Bind a posted producer to a quiescent initialized stream."
msgstr "将预提交生产者绑定到静止、已初始化的 stream。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"Task-only cold binding. Caller owns exclusive producer rights and retains "
"control until all pending fills and IRQs drain."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的冷绑定。调用方拥有排他生产者权限，并保留控制对象直到全部待填充操作及 IRQ 排空。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[out] Separate caller control, not aliased with buffers"
msgstr "[out] 独立的调用方控制对象，不得与缓冲建立别名"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Admission open, no outstanding producer/consumer loans"
msgstr "[inout] 准入已开放，且无未归还的生产者或消费者借用"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY or STATE; rejected output is untouched"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY 或 STATE；拒绝时输出不变"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Query the next preposted slot without a loan or guessed loss."
msgstr "查询下一个预提交槽，不产生借用或猜测丢失。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Bounded task/IRQ hint; still reserve before writing payload."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界提示；写入载荷前仍须 reserve。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Same exclusive serialized producer"
msgstr "[in] 同一排他且串行化的生产者"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "True when the next reservation can succeed"
msgstr "下次预留可以成功时返回 true"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Reserve a future fill without making earlier blocks ready."
msgstr "预留未来填充，不提前使更早的块就绪。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"O(1) task/IRQ. Failure leaves output and loss counters intact; only "
"explicitly observed boundaries justify note_loss."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中为 O(1)。失败时输出和丢失计数不变；仅显式观测到边界后才可调用 note_loss。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Live posted producer"
msgstr "[inout] 活动的预提交生产者"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[out] Exact pending loan until FIFO publish or LIFO abort"
msgstr "[out] 精确的待完成借用，在 FIFO 发布或 LIFO 中止前有效"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "SUCCESS, OVERFLOW, STATE, EXHAUSTED or INVALID"
msgstr "SUCCESS、OVERFLOW、STATE、EXHAUSTED 或 INVALID"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Publish only the oldest pending detached producer loan."
msgstr "仅发布最早 pending 且已撤离引用的生产者借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "O(1) task/IRQ. Consumer acquire/release use the original stream."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中为 O(1)。消费者通过原有流执行 acquire/release。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Same exclusive producer as reserve"
msgstr "[inout] 与 reserve 相同的排他生产者"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Exact oldest token, absent from every hardware target"
msgstr "[in] 精确的最旧令牌，已从全部硬件目标中撤离"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Positive valid bytes at most the block capacity"
msgstr "[in] 正数有效字节数，最多为块容量"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Observed IDLE/TRIGGER/ERROR boundary facts"
msgstr "[in] 实际观测到的 IDLE/TRIGGER/ERROR 边界事实"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; rejection retains the loan"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时保留借用"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Cancel the newest pending fill after proof of memory drain."
msgstr "证明内存排空后，取消最新 pending 填充。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"O(1) task/IRQ. Does not advance consumer or published cursor; no FREE hole "
"appears ahead of future publication. Stopping closes admission but still "
"permits proved tail rollback."
msgstr ""
"任务/IRQ 中为 O(1)。不推进消费者或已发布游标，不会在后续发布位置前产生 FREE 空洞。停止会关闭准入，但仍允许经证明的尾部回滚。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[inout] Same producer; rollback is strictly LIFO"
msgstr "[inout] 同一生产者；回滚严格遵循 LIFO"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Exact newest pending token"
msgstr "[in] 精确的最新待完成令牌"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "[in] Source detached, no remaining writes"
msgstr "[in] 源已撤离，不再有剩余写入"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, STATE or INVALID; failure retains the loan"
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、STATE 或 INVALID；失败时保留借用"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Caller-owned block metadata; initialize data and capacity only."
msgstr "调用者拥有的块元数据；仅初始化 data 与 capacity。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Storage remains live through producer and consumer quiescence."
msgstr "存储须保持有效，直到生产者和消费者均已静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Caller-owned stream control, initialized before publication."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 stream 控制，必须先初始化再发布。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"outstanding counts nonfree blocks, including filling, ready and borrowed "
"states. Only stream operations mutate it."
msgstr "outstanding 统计非空闲块，包括填充中、就绪和已借用状态。仅流操作可修改该计数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Mutable producer loan; hardware must stop before abort or publish."
msgstr "可变生产者借用；中止或发布前必须停止硬件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Optional caller-owned preposted producer; no default cost."
msgstr "调用者显式选择的预提交生产者，不产生默认成本。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid ""
"One serialized producer owns this control and the stream. Do not mix "
"ordinary reserve/publish/abort with a live posted producer. Two hardware "
"targets remain FILLING until detached. Publication is FIFO; rollback is LIFO"
" to avoid consumer holes."
msgstr ""
"一个串行化生产者拥有本控制对象及流。预提交生产者活动期间，不得混用普通 reserve/publish/abort。两个硬件目标在引用撤离前保持 "
"FILLING。发布遵循 FIFO，回滚遵循 LIFO，以免在消费者路径中留下空洞。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:274
msgid "Immutable consumer loan, valid until matching release succeeds."
msgstr "不可变消费者借用，直到匹配释放成功之前均有效。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:280
msgid "stream_budget.h"
msgstr "stream_budget.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "Optional constant-work snapshot and checked cold sizing."
msgstr "可选恒定工作量快照与经过检查的冷态容量计算。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "Snapshot maintained metadata under one short IRQ guard."
msgstr "在一个短 IRQ 临界区内快照维护的元数据。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ fixed work, no slot scan or payload access. Caller keeps all "
"storage alive; no observer reference is retained. next_free is the ordinary "
"stream cursor, not the private preposted cursor. Output is distinct from "
"every payload."
msgstr ""
"任务/IRQ 中的固定工作量，不扫描槽，也不访问载荷。调用方须保持全部存储有效；不保留观测者引用。next_free "
"是普通流游标，不是私有预提交游标。输出与全部载荷分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "[in] Live initialized storage, no concurrent destruction."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的活动存储，不得并发销毁。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "[out] Distinct output, unchanged on rejected metadata/alias."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；元数据或别名检查拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE for inconsistent control facts."
msgstr "SUCCESS；控制事实不一致时返回 INVALID 或 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "Checked cold calculation, no stream mutation or allocation."
msgstr "经过检查的冷态计算，不修改 stream 或分配存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid ""
"required = targets + spares + ceil(rate*release_delay / "
"(block_units*1000000)); payload is required*block*unit_bytes. Finite math is"
" conservative under the declared FIFO frontier release bound; out-of-order "
"release may still block the next cursor. Latency requires target_delay_us < "
"floor(units_per_block*1000000/units_per_second). This creates no "
"backpressure or hardware qualification."
msgstr ""
"required = targets + spares + ceil(rate*release_delay / "
"(block_units*1000000))；载荷大小为 required*block*unit_bytes。在所声明的 FIFO "
"队首释放延迟界限下，此有限算术计算是保守的；乱序释放仍可能阻塞下一个游标。延迟要求 target_delay_us < "
"floor(units_per_block*1000000/units_per_second)。本计算不建立背压，也不构成硬件资格证明。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "[in] Explicit rate, longest release delay and pipeline."
msgstr "[in] 显式速率、最长释放延迟和流水线配置。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "[out] Distinct output, unchanged on error or overflow."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；错误或溢出时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED for arithmetic overflow."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID；算术溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "O(1) aggregate facts; free total does not imply cursor is free."
msgstr "O(1) 汇总事实；总空闲容量不证明游标位置空闲。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "Explicit engineering assumptions, no inferred hardware rate."
msgstr "显式工程假设，不推断硬件速率。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid ""
"release_delay includes queue/consumer delay until release of each published "
"FIFO frontier. units convert to bytes using unit_bytes. targets/spares are "
"actual selected hardware loans. All quantities are positive except "
"delay/targets/spares."
msgstr ""
"release_delay 包含每个已发布 FIFO 队首块直到释放为止的排队和消费者延迟。通过 unit_bytes "
"将单位转换为字节。targets/spares 是实际选择的硬件借用。除 delay/targets/spares 外，全部量均为正数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:282
msgid "Conservative declared-assumption budget; never physical evidence."
msgstr "依据声明假设得到的保守预算，绝不作为物理证据。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:288
msgid "stream_profile.h"
msgstr "stream_profile.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid "Optional readonly continuous-stream cold admission profiles."
msgstr "可选只读的连续流冷准入配置。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid "Validate an actual pool before the bound UART may borrow it."
msgstr "绑定的 UART 借用缓冲池之前验证实际缓冲池。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid ""
"Caller joins all pool users before this cold pool check. Failure before "
"provider dispatch creates no borrow, epoch change or hardware effect. Rate, "
"FIFO-frontier hold and IRQ latency remain declared assumptions, never "
"measurements. This creates no external UART flow control or losslessness. "
"Underlying unprofiled APIs retain their explicit contracts."
msgstr ""
"调用方须在此次冷缓冲池检查前等待全部池用户退出。在 provider 派发前失败，不会建立借用、改变 epoch 或产生硬件副作用。速率、FIFO "
"队首持有时间及 IRQ 延迟始终是声明的假设，不是量测。本操作不建立外部 UART 流控，也不保证无丢失。底层未使用 profile 的 API "
"保留其显式契约。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid "[in] Stable readonly reviewed binding and assumptions."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、只读且已经审核的绑定与假设。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid ""
"[inout] Initialized unborrowed pool with exact declared count and equal "
"declared byte capacities, kept live through the original provider's stop and"
" all consumer releases."
msgstr ""
"[inout] 已初始化且尚未借出的缓冲池，块数及各块字节容量与声明精确一致；须保持有效，直到原 provider 停止且全部消费者释放借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid ""
"INVALID for mismatched geometry/alias, STATE for stopping metadata, BUSY for"
" existing loans, CONTEXT outside an unmasked task, EXHAUSTED for "
"overflow/insufficient budget, UNSUPPORTED for target latency; otherwise "
"provider result."
msgstr ""
"几何或别名不匹配时为 INVALID；停止中的元数据返回 STATE；已有借用时为 BUSY；不在中断未屏蔽任务上下文中时为 "
"CONTEXT；溢出或预算不足时为 EXHAUSTED；目标延迟不满足要求时为 UNSUPPORTED；其余情况返回 provider 结果。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid "Validate pool and whole-scan rate before ADC admission."
msgstr "ADC 准入之前验证缓冲池与完整扫描速率。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid ""
"ADC stopping its trigger creates a sampling gap. No budget makes that pause "
"preserve wall-clock samples or prove the future consumer/IRQ bounds. No "
"observer/queue is created."
msgstr ""
"ADC 停止触发会产生采样缺口。任何预算都不能使这一暂停保留按实际时间连续发生的采样，也不能证明未来消费者或 IRQ 的界限。不会创建观测者或队列。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid "[in] Stable readonly binding to the selected ADC face."
msgstr "[in] 到所选 ADC 接口的稳定只读绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed exact pool, as for UART."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未借出的精确缓冲池，要求同 UART。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid ""
"[in] Positive nominal complete scans per second, no greater than the "
"declared production-rate upper bound."
msgstr "[in] 每秒完整扫描的正数标称次数，不大于所声明的生产速率上界。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid ""
"Cold-check errors as for UART, or the original info/start result. Provider "
"scan, timer, DMA/cache and alias checks still apply; no rejected operation "
"retains new references."
msgstr ""
"冷检查错误同 UART，否则返回原 info/start 结果。provider 的扫描、定时器、DMA/cache "
"及别名检查仍然适用；任何被拒绝的操作都不保留新引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid "Selected UART face and immutable byte-stream assumptions."
msgstr "选定的 UART 接口与不可变的字节流假设。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid ""
"Reviewed assembly binds the actual continuous provider. Two hardware targets"
" and one replacement are required. A profile never allocates or owns the "
"caller's pool. The normal byte face and provider state retain their layouts."
" Cold admission rechecks payload disjointness in O(n^2); no additional check"
" enters the IRQ or steady I/O path."
msgstr ""
"已审核的装配绑定实际连续 provider。要求两个硬件目标及一个替补块。profile 不分配也不拥有调用方的缓冲池。普通字节接口及 provider"
" 状态布局保持不变。冷准入以 O(n^2) 重新检查载荷互不重叠；IRQ 或稳定 I/O 路径不增加额外检查。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid "Selected ADC face and complete-scan stream assumptions."
msgstr "选定的 ADC 接口与完整扫描流假设。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:290
msgid ""
"One unit is a complete selected scan, stored as one uint16_t per channel. "
"Resolution bits never replace storage width. Geometry and rates are reviewed"
" assembly inputs; they establish neither sample accuracy nor an aperture "
"time."
msgstr ""
"一个单位是一轮完整的所选扫描，每通道存储一个 "
"uint16_t。分辨率位数不能替代存储位宽。几何和速率是已审核的装配输入，不能据此证明采样准确度或孔径时刻。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:296
msgid "timer.h"
msgstr "timer.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "Fixed timer/channel PWM with one shared base configuration."
msgstr "固定定时器／通道 PWM，共享同一个基准配置。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "Atomically stage a reviewed fixed-base PWM duty."
msgstr "原子暂存已审查固定基准 PWM 的占空比。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid ""
"Shadow update becomes effective at next update event; do not infer immediate"
" electrical change from successful staging."
msgstr "影子更新在下一次更新事件生效；成功暂存不代表电气输出立即改变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "[inout] Fixed timer/channel with one serialized writer."
msgstr "[inout] 固定定时器/通道，只有一个串行化写入者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "[in] Positive maintained shared-base period."
msgstr "[in] 已维护共享时基的正数周期。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "[in] Zero through period_ticks, inclusive."
msgstr "[in] 从零到 period_ticks，包含两端。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/STATE/BUSY. Zero/100 percent are explicit constant "
"levels. Shared channels must use one PSC/ARR/base; changing another "
"channel's base is rejected by configuration."
msgstr ""
"成功或 INVALID/STATE/BUSY。零及 100% 对应显式恒定电平。共享通道必须使用同一 "
"PSC/ARR/时基；配置会拒绝改变其他通道的时基。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "Enable a previously configured fixed PWM output."
msgstr "启用此前已配置的固定 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "[inout] Execution owner after Board inactive level setup."
msgstr "[inout] Board 已设置无效电平后的执行所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "Stop PWM at its declared Board inactive electrical level."
msgstr "以声明的 Board 非活动电气电平停止 PWM。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "[inout] Quiesced execution owner; no concurrent set/start."
msgstr "[inout] 已静止的执行所有者；不得并发 set/start。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "Success or INVALID; no advanced break/capture promise."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；不承诺高级 break/capture 能力。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "Query staged PWM counts and selected timer clock."
msgstr "查询暂存 PWM 计数与选定定时器时钟。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "[in] Fixed initialized channel."
msgstr "[in] 固定且已初始化的通道。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "[out] Staged counts, clock and running state."
msgstr "[out] 已暂存的计数、时钟及运行状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:298
msgid "PWM counts refer to the fixed declared post-prescaler timer clock."
msgstr "PWM 计数对应固定声明的预分频后定时器时钟。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:304
msgid "timer_capture.h"
msgstr "timer_capture.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Optional raw timer edge capture with caller-owned events."
msgstr "可选原始定时器边沿捕获与调用者拥有的事件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Observable loss incidents, not an exact count of physical edges."
msgstr "可观察丢失事件，不是准确的物理边沿总数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Borrow an exact event ring and enable the fixed capture channel."
msgstr "借用准确事件环并启用固定捕获通道。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid ""
"Ring remains borrowed until successful stop. ISR access is confined to this "
"ring. Caller must not modify it or its provider while borrowed. Counter wrap"
" is modulo the reported width; observation time is not an absolute edge "
"timestamp or a clock accuracy qualification."
msgstr ""
"环一直被借用，直到 stop 成功。ISR 对事件存储的访问仅限于该环。借用期间调用方不得修改环或其 "
"provider。计数器按已报告位宽取模回卷；观测时间不是绝对边沿时间戳，也不构成时钟准确度资格证明。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "[in] One privileged task owner, serialized with stop/read."
msgstr "[in] 单一特权任务所有者，与 stop/read 串行执行。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "[inout] Aligned writable ring, capacity positive."
msgstr "[inout] 已对齐的可写环，容量为正数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "[in] Number of events; no hidden buffer or worker."
msgstr "[in] 事件数量；无隐藏缓冲或工作任务。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "SUCCESS transfers the ring borrow; rejection retains nothing."
msgstr "SUCCESS 转移环的借用；拒绝时不保留任何引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Disable and read back channel/IRQ sources before returning storage."
msgstr "归还存储之前禁用并读回通道／IRQ 源。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid ""
"Read drains events after capture stops. Failed detach never frees storage. "
"Board pins, timer clock and shared vector leases are released by cold "
"assembly only after successful stop and publisher quiescence."
msgstr ""
"捕获停止后，read 仍可排空事件。撤离失败绝不释放存储。仅在 stop 成功且发布者静止后，冷装配才释放 Board 引脚、定时器时钟及共享向量租约。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner, with generated IRQ owner retained."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者，并保留生成的 IRQ 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid ""
"SUCCESS is the final access to the ring; BUSY retains the borrow while "
"queued events or failed hardware detachment remain."
msgstr "SUCCESS 是对环的最后一次访问；仍有排队事件或硬件撤离失败时，BUSY 保留借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Copy the oldest event in a short saved-mask metadata section."
msgstr "在短且保存原屏蔽状态的元数据临界区内复制最早事件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "[in] Single privileged task consumer."
msgstr "[in] 单一特权任务消费者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "[out] Separate writable output, unchanged on EMPTY/rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写输出；EMPTY 或拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, STATE or INVALID; no block release is required."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、STATE 或 INVALID；无需另行释放块。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Query counter units and observable queue/loss facts."
msgstr "查询计数器单位与可观察队列／丢失事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid ""
"Hardware overcapture and ring saturation can coalesce edges. A loss incident"
" does not estimate edges, edge frequency or actual IRQ WCET."
msgstr "硬件过捕获和环饱和可能合并边沿。丢失事件不用于估算边沿数量、边沿频率或实际 IRQ WCET。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner; no concurrent lifecycle writer."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者；不得并发执行生命周期写操作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "[out] Separate writable snapshot."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写快照。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Hardware modulo counter and the separate IRQ observation time."
msgstr "硬件模计数器与独立的 IRQ 观察时间。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Fixed counter units and current software retention state."
msgstr "固定计数器单位与当前软件保留状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Shared immutable methods; no per-call acquisition or allocation."
msgstr "共享不可变方法；不逐次取得资源或分配。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:306
msgid "Immutable identity; state and methods outlive calls and IRQs."
msgstr "不可变身份；状态和方法必须在所有调用与 IRQ 完全退出前保持有效。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:312
msgid "uart.h"
msgstr "uart.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "IRQ TX requests and independently budgeted byte/event reception."
msgstr "IRQ TX 请求与分别预算的字节／事件接收。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Prepare an unborrowed IRQ TX descriptor without copying data."
msgstr "准备未借用 IRQ TX 描述符，不复制数据。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] Fresh initialized or consumed SETTLED request."
msgstr "[inout] 新初始化的请求，或已经消费的 SETTLED 请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[in] Nonempty payload retained unchanged through SETTLED."
msgstr "[in] 非空载荷，保持不变直到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[in] Positive byte count."
msgstr "[in] 正数字节数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline in nx_time_now_us clock domain."
msgstr "[in] nx_time_now_us 时钟域中的绝对时限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "NX_SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; failure retains no buffer."
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；失败时不保留缓冲引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Submit one direct request to a single-executor UART."
msgstr "向单执行者 UART 提交一个直接请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"Task-only, bounded admission. TX completion waits for true TC (wire idle). "
"IRQ only moves bytes/publishes hardware facts; the owner calls service to "
"observe deadlines and settle. The first observed terminal fact latches its "
"result. Later service, deadline or cancellation does not overwrite an "
"already observed TC. IRQ/service latency bounds remain provider and product "
"qualification inputs."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文的有界准入。TX 完成须等待真正的 TC，即线路空闲。IRQ 仅搬运字节或发布硬件事实；所有者调用 service "
"以观测时限并结算请求。最先观测到的终态事实锁定其结果。后续 service、时限或取消不会覆盖已观测到的 TC。IRQ/service 延迟界限仍是 "
"provider 与产品资格验证的输入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] Initialized idle port owned by this execution context."
msgstr "[inout] 由当前执行上下文拥有、已初始化且空闲的端口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] READY descriptor; borrowed only on NX_SUCCESS."
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符；仅在 NX_SUCCESS 时借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"NX_SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including a later start failure. "
"BUSY/INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/TIMEOUT means REJECTED with zero borrow; an "
"already expired direct request is not admitted."
msgstr ""
"NX_SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，包括随后启动失败的情况。BUSY/INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/TIMEOUT 表示 "
"REJECTED，借用为零；直接提交时已经过期的请求不获准入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] Single-executor initialized port."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的单执行者端口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] QUEUED descriptor already borrowed by adapter."
msgstr "[inout] 已由适配器借用的 QUEUED 描述符。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"BUSY retains QUEUED; NX_SUCCESS transfers execution to port. Other start "
"errors must be settled by the adapter executor."
msgstr "BUSY 保留 QUEUED；NX_SUCCESS 将执行权转给端口。其他启动错误须由适配器执行者结算。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Request cancellation; acceptance does not mean settlement."
msgstr "请求取消；接受取消不表示请求结清。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] Same single execution owner as submit/service."
msgstr "[inout] 与 submit/service 相同的单一执行所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"[inout] Active live descriptor; cross-task callers use a stable adapter slot"
" and expected epoch instead of this pointer."
msgstr "[inout] 当前活动且有效的描述符；跨任务调用方应使用稳定的适配器槽及期望 epoch，不能使用此指针。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"NX_SUCCESS for pending/already settled cancellation; STATE for a different "
"request. Borrow continues until SETTLED."
msgstr "取消仍待完成或已结算时返回 NX_SUCCESS；请求不匹配时为 STATE。借用持续到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Observe time/hardware completion and drain one active request."
msgstr "观察时间／硬件完成并排空一个活动请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"Bounded, no wait/callback; call throughout stop/drain and at the declared "
"maximum service interval. Publication is final request access. Hardware "
"unable to drain retains QUARANTINED."
msgstr ""
"有界操作，无等待或回调；在 stop/drain 全程及所声明的最大 service 间隔内持续调用。发布完成是对请求的最后一次访问。硬件不能排空时保留"
" QUARANTINED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] Single task/loop execution owner."
msgstr "[inout] 单一任务/主循环执行所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Read buffered RX events from the selected event profile."
msgstr "从选定事件配置读取缓冲的 RX 事件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] Initialized event-profile port; one consumer."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的事件 profile 端口；只有一个消费者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[out] Caller-owned destination; not retained."
msgstr "[out] 调用方拥有的目标存储；不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[out] Events copied, including explicit loss/error flags."
msgstr "[out] 已复制的事件，包含显式丢失/错误标志。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"NX_SUCCESS, EMPTY or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED. IRQ produces only into configured "
"storage; overflow never silently overwrites."
msgstr "NX_SUCCESS、EMPTY 或 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。IRQ 只向已配置存储生产数据；溢出绝不静默覆盖。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Read buffered bytes from the selected byte profile."
msgstr "从选定字节配置读取缓冲字节。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] Initialized byte-profile port; one consumer."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的字节 profile 端口；只有一个消费者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[in] Destination capacity in bytes."
msgstr "[in] 目标容量，单位为字节。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"[out] Bytes copied; valid on OVERFLOW and on a provider IO failure after "
"copying bytes and attempting RX rearm."
msgstr "[out] 已复制的字节数；返回 OVERFLOW 时仍有效；提供者在复制字节并尝试重新启用 RX 后发生 IO 失败时也仍有效。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"NX_SUCCESS, EMPTY, OVERFLOW or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED. Byte profile reports "
"aggregate loss without invented timestamps. A provider can return IO if RX "
"source rearm fails after copying; count and copied bytes remain valid. "
"Admission closes and retained hardware requires verified stop."
msgstr ""
"NX_SUCCESS、EMPTY、OVERFLOW 或 "
"INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。字节模式报告累计丢失，不虚构时间戳。提供者若在复制后重新启用 RX 源失败，可以返回 IO；count "
"和已复制字节仍有效。准入关闭，仍保留责任的硬件必须经验证停止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Close admission and drain TX before releasing hardware."
msgstr "关闭准入，并在释放硬件之前排空 TX。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"RX/IRQ and external consumers must quiesce before storage reclamation. No "
"automatic task/notification destruction."
msgstr "回收存储前，RX/IRQ 和外部消费者必须静止。不自动销毁任务或通知对象。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[inout] Owner; producers must already have quiesced."
msgstr "[inout] 所有者；生产者必须已经静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "NX_SUCCESS when stopped; BUSY while service must continue."
msgstr "停止后返回 NX_SUCCESS；仍须继续 service 时返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Attach or detach one explicit IRQ wake target."
msgstr "附加或解除一个显式 IRQ 唤醒目标。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"Quiesce every previous publisher before reclaiming an old target. IRQ events"
" latch RX/completion facts before notifying. Detachment removes future "
"publications; notification storage still requires joining external waiters "
"and callbacks."
msgstr ""
"回收旧目标前，须等待全部先前发布者静止。IRQ 事件在通知前锁存 RX/完成事实。解除绑定阻止未来发布；通知存储仍须等待外部等待者和回调退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[in] Initialized provider, controlled by one task executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的 provider，由单一任务执行者控制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[in] Immutable live target or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的活动目标；NULL 表示解除绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"Success, CONTEXT outside task control, PERMISSION for unsafe actual IRQ "
"priority, or provider STATE/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr ""
"成功；不在任务控制上下文时返回 CONTEXT；实际 IRQ 优先级不安全时返回 PERMISSION；也可能返回 provider 的 "
"STATE/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Start the selected RX block mode using exact caller storage."
msgstr "使用调用者准确存储启动选定 RX 块模式。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"Provider boundaries and gaps are explicit capability facts. The provider "
"must never overwrite a borrowed consumer block."
msgstr "provider 的边界和缺口是显式能力事实。provider 绝不能覆盖被消费者借用的块。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[in] Block-capable provider, one task execution owner."
msgstr "[in] 支持块的 provider，只有一个任务执行所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"[inout] Initialized block stream retained until RX stops and all acquired "
"consumer blocks are released."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的块流；保留到 RX 停止且全部已获取的消费者块被释放。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/BUSY/UNSUPPORTED with zero failed admission loan; "
"selected hardware modes validate every DMA block domain."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/BUSY/UNSUPPORTED；失败准入的借用为零。所选硬件模式验证每个 DMA 块的内存域。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Stop RX block production without revoking consumer loans."
msgstr "停止 RX 块生产，不撤销消费者借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"Consumers separately drain READY blocks and release loans; successful RX "
"stop does not destroy stream or wake storage."
msgstr "消费者单独排空 READY 块并释放借用；RX stop 成功不会销毁流或 wake 存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "[in] Same executor as RX start; storage stays live on BUSY."
msgstr "[in] 与 RX start 相同的执行者；BUSY 时存储继续有效。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"Success proves memory sources detached; BUSY retains producer loan, "
"UNSUPPORTED for a byte/event-only provider."
msgstr "成功证明内存访问源已撤离；BUSY 保留生产者借用；仅支持字节/事件的 provider 返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Timestamp belongs to provider clock; precision is hardware-specific."
msgstr "时间戳属于提供者时钟；精度由硬件决定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid ""
"NO_BYTE marks status-only IRQ facts: byte is invalid. LOSS is an independent"
" NO_BYTE boundary marker, ordered after older buffered facts and before "
"later reception. Its timestamp is provider detection/report time, never a "
"reconstructed timestamp for missing bytes. Byte-profile reads report "
"aggregate loss and omit status-only facts."
msgstr ""
"NO_BYTE 标识仅含状态的 IRQ 事实：byte 无效。LOSS 是独立的 NO_BYTE "
"边界标记，排在更旧的已缓冲事实之后、后续接收之前。其时间戳是 provider 检测或报告的时间，绝不是为丢失字节重建的时间戳。字节 profile "
"读取报告累计丢失，并省略仅含状态的事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:314
msgid "Caller-owned TX descriptor; initialize base before first prepare."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 TX 描述符；第一次 prepare 之前必须初始化 base。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:320
msgid "uart_format.h"
msgstr "uart_format.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:322
msgid "Explicit payload, parity, stop and hardware-flow format."
msgstr "显式的载荷、校验、停止位与硬件流控格式。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:322
msgid "Validate the common USART-v1 subset without hardware access."
msgstr "验证公共 USART-v1 子集，不访问硬件。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:322
msgid "Pure, bounded, task/IRQ safe; Board admission remains separate."
msgstr "纯函数、有界，任务/IRQ 安全；Board 准入仍单独处理。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:322
msgid "[in] Explicit payload width, parity, stop and flow selection."
msgstr "[in] 显式载荷位宽、奇偶校验、停止位和流控选择。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:322
msgid ""
"Success for 7E/O, 8N/E/O or 9N with one/two stop bits; INVALID for unknown "
"values, UNSUPPORTED for a known incompatible combination."
msgstr "7E/O、8N/E/O 或 9N 配合一个或两个停止位时成功；未知值返回 INVALID，已知但不兼容的组合返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:322
msgid "Immutable wire format; data_bits excludes the parity bit."
msgstr "不可变的线上格式；data_bits 不含校验位。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:322
msgid "RTS/CTS needs independently reviewed Board routing and peer wiring."
msgstr "RTS/CTS 需要单独审核 Board 路由及对端接线。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:328
msgid "uart_rs485.h"
msgstr "uart_rs485.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "Optional single-owner RS485 direction and wire-tail adapter."
msgstr "可选单所有者 RS485 方向与线尾适配器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "Exact transport's side-effect-free TX admission validator."
msgstr "准确传输端口的无副作用 TX 准入验证器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid ""
"Reads clock/hardware facts but never writes GPIO/MMIO, admits, starts or "
"retains a reference. One executor owns adapter and transport; no external "
"direct TX is permitted."
msgstr "读取时钟/硬件事实，但不写 GPIO/MMIO，不准入、不启动，也不保留引用。一个执行者拥有适配器及传输接口；不允许外部直接 TX。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:0
msgid "Param context"
msgstr "参数 context"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "[in] The immutable transport face's exact context."
msgstr "[in] 不可变传输接口的精确 context。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:0
msgid "Param request"
msgstr "参数 request"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "[in] Live READY or QUEUED descriptor, never retained."
msgstr "[in] 活动的 READY 或 QUEUED 描述符；绝不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:0
msgid "Return"
msgstr "返回值"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "Same rejectable checks used by the transport submit/start."
msgstr "采用与传输接口 submit/start 相同的可拒绝检查。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "Bind exclusive transport and establish inactive DE."
msgstr "绑定独占传输端口并建立非活动 DE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid ""
"Task-only, no wait. No physical transceiver is inferred. Setup starts after "
"successful DE assertion; hold starts after acquire-observed true transport "
"settlement. Transfer deadline includes setup and wire completion; mandatory "
"drain/hold may extend the borrow beyond that deadline. Rejected TX leaves DE"
" and transport unchanged. Failed drain or DE withdrawal keeps QUARANTINED "
"outer storage and DE ownership until service retry."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文，不等待。不推定物理收发器存在。成功置有效 DE 后开始 setup；通过 acquire 语义观测到传输真正结算后才开始 "
"hold。传输时限包括 setup 和线路完成；必须执行的 drain/hold 可使借用持续到该时限之后。TX 被拒绝时 DE "
"和传输接口均不变。排空或 DE 撤离失败时，保留 QUARANTINED 外层存储及 DE 所有权，直到 service 重试。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero-initialized caller control."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方拥有的全新零初始化控制对象。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid ""
"[in] Immutable lifetime binding; one authorized DE bit, real board polarity,"
" setup/hold in nx_time_now_us domain."
msgstr "[in] 生命周期内不可变的绑定；一个获授权的 DE 位、实际板级极性，以及 nx_time_now_us 域中的 setup/hold。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "Success or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/GPIO failure, no TX loan."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/GPIO 失败；无 TX 借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "Immutable selected electrical/timing facts, no task or heap."
msgstr "不可变的选定电气／时序事实，不含任务或堆。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid ""
"Configuration, faces, ops and context identities cannot change while bound. "
"They are disjoint from mutable adapter, request and payload storage; exact "
"pin ownership is external."
msgstr "绑定期间，配置、接口、ops 及 context 身份不得改变。它们与可变适配器、请求及载荷存储分离；精确引脚所有权由外部负责。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid "Caller-owned opt-in adapter, zero-initialize before init."
msgstr "调用者显式选择的适配器，init 前零初始化。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:330
msgid ""
"Control is private after initialization. Immutable config, both faces, pin "
"ownership and all storage outlive successful stop plus external observers. "
"Default UART state is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"初始化后控制对象为私有。不可变配置、两个接口、引脚所有权及全部存储，须保持有效直到 stop 成功且外部观测者退出。默认 UART 状态不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:336
msgid "uart_word.h"
msgstr "uart_word.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Independent nine-bit face and caller-owned word requests."
msgstr "独立的九位接口与调用者拥有的字请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Prepare an unborrowed nine-bit payload, without admitting it."
msgstr "准备尚未借用的九位载荷，不执行准入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Task owner; payload values are checked before provider admission."
msgstr "任务所有者；载荷值在 provider 准入前检查。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED descriptor."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的 READY 或已消费的 SETTLED 描述符。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] Aligned immutable words, disjoint from the descriptor."
msgstr "[in] 已对齐的不可变字数组，与描述符分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] Positive word count, representable as a byte extent."
msgstr "[in] 正数字数，可表示为字节范围。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] Absolute nx_time_now_us monotonic transfer deadline."
msgstr "[in] nx_time_now_us 单调域中的绝对传输时限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; rejection retains no references/effects."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时不保留引用，也不产生副作用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Admit one READY request to the single unmasked task executor."
msgstr "将一个 READY 请求准入唯一、未屏蔽中断的任务执行者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Counts use words; completion requires actual wire TC."
msgstr "计数以字为单位；完成要求实际线路 TC。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] Live initialized face, private state and IRQ binding."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的活动接口、私有状态及 IRQ 绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[inout] Caller-owned descriptor, borrowed on success."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方拥有的描述符；成功时借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Success means ACCEPTED; rejection has no borrow/hardware effects."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED；拒绝时不借用，也不产生硬件副作用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Transfer an adapter's QUEUED borrow without readmission."
msgstr "接管适配器的 QUEUED 借用，不再次准入。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] Live single-owner face."
msgstr "[in] 活动的单所有者接口。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[inout] Existing adapter borrow."
msgstr "[inout] 已有适配器借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Success transfers execution; BUSY leaves QUEUED and its borrow."
msgstr "成功转移执行权；BUSY 保留 QUEUED 及其借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Request cancellation without revoking request/payload ownership."
msgstr "请求取消，不撤销请求／载荷的所有权。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Continue service through drain; failed drain stays QUARANTINED."
msgstr "排空期间继续 service；排空失败时保留 QUARANTINED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] Same unmasked task executor as submit/service."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit/service 相同的中断未屏蔽任务执行者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[inout] Live request; cross-task control uses a stable slot."
msgstr "[inout] 活动请求；跨任务控制使用稳定的槽。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Success for this request, STATE for a different live request."
msgstr "当前请求返回成功；其他活动请求返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Perform bounded owner-driven deadline, drain and settlement work."
msgstr "由所有者执行有界的截止时间、排空与结清工作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid ""
"IRQ only publishes facts; SETTLED is final provider access. No wait, hidden "
"worker or callback; obey the declared maximum service gap."
msgstr ""
"IRQ 仅发布事实；SETTLED 是 provider 的最后一次访问。无等待、隐藏工作任务或回调；须遵守所声明的最大 service 间隔。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] Single unmasked task owner, kept alive through stop."
msgstr "[in] 单一中断未屏蔽任务所有者，保持有效直到 stop 完成。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Copy words without retaining destination storage."
msgstr "复制字，不持续借用目标存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Loss does not invent a hardware timestamp or missing word count."
msgstr "丢失不会虚构硬件时间戳，也不会虚构缺失字数。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] Initialized face, one consumer under the task executor."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的接口，由任务执行者控制且只有一个消费者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[out] Aligned destination, disjoint from provider/RX storage."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐的目标，与 provider/RX 存储分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] Positive destination capacity in words."
msgstr "[in] 正数目标容量，单位为字。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[out] Number copied, including on OVERFLOW."
msgstr "[out] 已复制数量；OVERFLOW 时也有效。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Success, EMPTY, OVERFLOW, INVALID, CONTEXT or STATE."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY、OVERFLOW、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Close admission and stop after active TX and IRQ sources drain."
msgstr "关闭准入，并在活动 TX 与 IRQ 源排空后停止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Caller joins any in-flight IRQ before reclaiming provider storage."
msgstr "回收 provider 存储前，调用方须等待全部正在执行的 IRQ 退出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "[in] One task owner; external producers/observers quiesced."
msgstr "[in] 单一任务所有者；外部生产者和观测者已静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Success after hardware detach; BUSY while service must continue."
msgstr "硬件引用撤离后成功；仍须继续 service 时返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Each uint16_t contains 0..511; count excludes bytes and parity."
msgstr "每个 uint16_t 包含 0..511；按字计数，不以字节计且不包含校验位。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Request and unchanged payload are borrowed until acquire SETTLED."
msgstr "请求及保持不变的载荷持续被借用，直到以 acquire 语义观测到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Independent immutable face; default byte face/state do not grow."
msgstr "独立不可变接口；默认字节接口／状态不增加。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:338
msgid "Static identity; lookup does not allocate, discover or initialize."
msgstr "静态身份；查找不分配、不发现设备，也不初始化。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:344
msgid "usb_device.h"
msgstr "usb_device.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Full-speed device packets and caller-owned endpoint loans."
msgstr "全速设备数据包与调用者拥有的端点借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Prepare one IN packet without reading or borrowing its bytes."
msgstr "准备一个 IN 数据包，不读取或借用其字节。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed request."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未借出的请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Immutable packet bytes, NULL only for zero length."
msgstr "[in] 不可变报文字节；仅在长度为零时允许 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Packet length, no automatic terminating ZLP."
msgstr "[in] 报文长度；不自动追加终止 ZLP。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] DATA or control STATUS; STATUS must be zero length."
msgstr "[in] DATA 或控制 STATUS；STATUS 长度必须为零。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Absolute independent monotonic clock deadline."
msgstr "[in] 独立单调时钟中的绝对时限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; rejection retains no references."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Prepare an OUT packet capacity without modifying its storage."
msgstr "准备 OUT 数据包容量，不修改其存储。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[out] Borrowed until SETTLED only after accepted submission."
msgstr "[out] 仅在提交被接受后借用，持续到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] At most endpoint MPS; short packets complete normally."
msgstr "[in] 最多为端点 MPS；短包正常完成。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] DATA or zero-capacity control STATUS."
msgstr "[in] DATA 或容量为零的控制 STATUS。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; rejection creates no borrow."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时不建立借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Admit one packet, never a hidden queue or complete USB transaction."
msgstr "仅准入一个数据包，不隐式建立队列或执行完整 USB 事务。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid ""
"One privileged task executor, IRQ masks clear. IN FIFO writes do not prove "
"host ACK. OUT overrun drains all packet words without overflow."
msgstr "单一特权任务执行者，IRQ 屏蔽须解除。写入 IN FIFO 不能证明主机已 ACK。OUT 过长时仍排空全部报文字，不使目标缓冲溢出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Stable endpoint face and private state."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的端点接口及私有状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[inout] READY packet, buffers alive until acquire SETTLED."
msgstr "[inout] READY 报文；缓冲须保持有效，直到以 acquire 语义观测到 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Success means ACCEPTED; fourth-party buffers are not copied early."
msgstr "成功表示 ACCEPTED；第四方缓冲不会被提前复制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Request endpoint disable/drain without revoking a buffer loan."
msgstr "请求端点禁用／排空，不撤销缓冲区借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid ""
"Control OUT0 has no hardware disable command: cancellation may require full "
"device stop to settle. Missing proof becomes QUARANTINED. Reset/SETUP "
"invalidates epochs but releases only after actual source drain."
msgstr ""
"控制 OUT0 没有硬件禁用命令：取消可能需要完整停止设备才能结算。缺少证明时进入 QUARANTINED。Reset/SETUP 使 epoch "
"失效，但只有实际源排空后才释放借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Same serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行化特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[inout] Live request accepted by this exact endpoint."
msgstr "[inout] 由此精确端点接受的活动请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Success requests drain; failures retain all prior accepted loans."
msgstr "成功表示请求排空；失败时保留全部先前接受的借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Set/clear STALL only after the endpoint has no live transfer."
msgstr "仅端点无存活传输时设置／清除 STALL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Serialized owner, started and IRQ masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的串行化所有者，IRQ 屏蔽须解除。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Success after readback, BUSY retains a pending request."
msgstr "回读验证后成功；BUSY 保留待完成请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Task-only bounded progress; deadline never depends on USB SOF."
msgstr "仅 Task 有界推进；截止时间绝不依赖 USB SOF。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged owner with incoming IRQ masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权所有者；进入时 IRQ 屏蔽须解除。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Success requests progress; no clock/endpoint loan is released early."
msgstr "成功表示请求推进；不提前释放时钟或端点借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Consume bounded value events; output is never retained."
msgstr "消费有界值事件，绝不保留输出。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Invalid/STATE rejection leaves both outputs unchanged."
msgstr "Invalid/STATE 拒绝时，两个输出均保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Single task consumer and stable controller."
msgstr "[in] 单一任务消费者及稳定控制器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[out] Caller records disjoint from provider and live loans."
msgstr "[out] 调用方记录，与 provider 及活动借用分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Positive output count."
msgstr "[in] 正数输出数量。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[out] Disjoint count output; EMPTY means zero."
msgstr "[out] 独立的计数输出；EMPTY 表示零。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Success, EMPTY or rejection; authoritative latest SETUP is in state."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY 或拒绝；state 中的最新 SETUP 才是权威事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Task-only authoritative snapshot, independent of event-ring space."
msgstr "仅 Task 的权威快照，与事件环可用空间无关。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged owner with IRQ masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权所有者，IRQ 屏蔽须解除。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[out] Disjoint caller snapshot, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 与其他存储分离的调用方快照；不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Success copies state; alias/context rejection leaves output unchanged."
msgstr "成功时复制状态；别名或上下文检查拒绝时输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Stage SET_ADDRESS for the matching zero-data standard SETUP."
msgstr "为匹配的零数据标准 SETUP 暂存 SET_ADDRESS。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged controller owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权控制器所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Current SETUP identity."
msgstr "[in] 当前 SETUP 身份。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] 0..127, matching SETUP wValue."
msgstr "[in] 0..127，与 SETUP wValue 匹配。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Success stages only; address applies after real status-IN XFRC."
msgstr "成功仅暂存地址；实际 status-IN XFRC 后地址才生效。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Attach/detach a borrowed task/IRQ-compatible wake hint."
msgstr "附加／解除被借用且兼容 Task/IRQ 的唤醒提示。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Started serialized owner with IRQ masks clear."
msgstr "[in] 已启动的串行化所有者，IRQ 屏蔽须解除。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Immutable target, or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 不可变目标；NULL 表示解除绑定。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "[in] Additional numerical IRQ priority floor."
msgstr "[in] 附加的 IRQ 优先级数值下限。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid ""
"Success after actual priority policy checks, BUSY while publisher remains "
"live; rejection retains no new sink."
msgstr "实际优先级策略检查通过后成功；发布者仍活动时返回 BUSY；拒绝时不保留新接收器。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Disconnect, disable, drain, detach IRQs, then release clock consumer."
msgstr "断开连接、禁用、排空、撤离 IRQ，再释放时钟消费者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid ""
"PIO OUT0 may remain enabled: successful global stop proves disconnect, OUT "
"NAK, no DMA, empty RX FIFO, IRQ withdrawal and publisher join before final "
"SETTLED. No forced reset revokes an unproved accepted borrow."
msgstr ""
"PIO OUT0 可以继续启用：全局 stop 成功意味着在最终 SETTLED 前已证明断开连接、OUT NAK、无 DMA、RX FIFO "
"为空、IRQ 引用撤离且发布者退出。强制复位不能撤销尚未证明安全释放的已接受借用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid ""
"Success ends provider access to endpoint/ring/wake storage; BUSY retains all"
" storage and 48MHz ownership until actual progress."
msgstr "成功结束 provider 对端点/环/wake 存储的访问；BUSY 保留全部存储及 48MHz 所有权，直到实际推进。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Shared readonly packet methods; context is a selected endpoint."
msgstr "共享只读数据包方法；上下文为选定端点。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:346
msgid "Controller identity remains separate from endpoint identities."
msgstr "控制器身份与端点身份保持分离。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:352
msgid "wake.h"
msgstr "wake.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "Explicit borrowed IRQ wake target and syscall-ceiling check."
msgstr "显式借用 IRQ 唤醒目标与系统调用阈值检查。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "Explicit kernel interrupt-mask policy, independent of any RTOS."
msgstr "显式内核中断屏蔽策略，独立于任何 RTOS。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "Validate actual IRQ facts against an explicit kernel policy."
msgstr "依据显式内核策略验证实际 IRQ 事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid ""
"Cold check without attachment or callback effects. No kernel target is "
"accepted by NONE. PRIMASK permits every valid configurable IRQ with its "
"fixed zero priority group. Kernel-calling BASEPRI targets require the "
"maintained preemption grouping and a numerical priority at least the "
"ceiling. Nonkernel hints do not impose kernel grouping. Binding does not "
"authorize future CPU-context violations."
msgstr ""
"无绑定或回调副作用的冷检查。NONE 不接受任何会调用内核的目标。PRIMASK 在固定为零的优先级分组下允许全部有效可配置 IRQ。会调用内核的 "
"BASEPRI 目标要求已维护的抢占分组，且优先级数值不小于阈值。非内核提示不强制内核分组。绑定不授权后续违反 CPU 上下文要求的操作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "[in] Optional immutable target; NULL disables notification."
msgstr "[in] 可选不可变目标；NULL 禁用通知。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "[in] Immutable validated CPU and kernel configuration."
msgstr "[in] 已验证的不可变 CPU 和内核配置。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "[in] External IRQ number, unshifted priority and group."
msgstr "[in] 外部 IRQ 编号、未移位的优先级及分组。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid ""
"Success, INVALID for malformed facts/target, PERMISSION for a kernel-calling"
" target in an unsafe interrupt domain."
msgstr "成功；事实或目标格式错误时返回 INVALID；会调用内核的目标处于不安全中断域时返回 PERMISSION。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "Deliver one bounded hint after authoritative state is latched."
msgstr "权威状态锁存后发送一个有界提示。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ as allowed by the target, no hidden task or retry. A failed wake "
"does not revoke state or request ownership."
msgstr "按目标允许的任务/IRQ 上下文执行，无隐藏任务或重试。wake 失败不撤销状态，也不撤销请求所有权。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "[in] Previously validated live target or NULL."
msgstr "[in] 先前已验证的活动目标或 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "Callback result, success for NULL, INVALID for a bad target."
msgstr "回调结果；NULL 返回成功；无效目标返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "Optional immutable wake target borrowed by an IRQ provider."
msgstr "IRQ 提供者借用的可选不可变唤醒目标。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid ""
"notify runs in publisher context and must be bounded and legal in that IRQ. "
"Storage and context outlive all publishers. Stop and join publishers before "
"destroying the sink. A wake is only a hint; latched RX/request predicates "
"stay authoritative."
msgstr ""
"notify 在发布者上下文中运行，必须有界且在该 IRQ 中合法。存储及 context "
"须比全部发布者存活更久。销毁接收器前，须停止并等待发布者退出。wake 仅为提示；已锁存的 RX/请求谓词仍为权威依据。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "Immutable CPU and kernel facts for cold wake binding."
msgstr "用于冷态唤醒绑定的不可变 CPU 与内核事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid ""
"NONE and PRIMASK require a zero syscall ceiling. BASEPRI requires a nonzero "
"unshifted ceiling. Configuration owns these facts; a wake target cannot "
"weaken them."
msgstr ""
"NONE 和 PRIMASK 要求 syscall 阈值为零。BASEPRI 要求非零且未移位的阈值。配置拥有这些事实；wake 目标不能放宽它们。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:354
msgid "Actual publisher facts read before attaching any borrowed sink."
msgstr "附加任何被借用的接收端之前读取实际发布者事实。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:360
msgid "watchdog.h"
msgstr "watchdog.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "Irreversible IWDG effects and neutral hardware reset causes."
msgstr "不可逆 IWDG 效果与中立硬件复位原因。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid ""
"Enable IWDG and report its effect and known timing bounds; activation is "
"irreversible."
msgstr "启用 IWDG，并报告其生效状态及已知的时间范围；激活不可逆。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid ""
"Success establishes nominal hardware programming, not a guaranteed deadline."
" Both timeout bounds remain zero when oscillator limits are unknown. A "
"product requiring bounded timing must admit the oscillator profile before "
"activation. Enable runs in a privileged task and is serialized with feed, "
"state and platform stop. Install IRQ feeding only after this call returns; "
"activation does not support a concurrent reload during shadow-register "
"programming."
msgstr ""
"成功证明标称硬件编程已完成，不保证时限。振荡器界限未知时，两个超时界限均保持零。需要有界时序的产品必须在激活前准入振荡器配置。Enable "
"在特权任务中执行，并与 feed、state 和 platform stop 串行化。仅在本调用返回后才可安装 IRQ "
"喂狗；激活不支持在影子寄存器编程期间并发重载。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "[inout] Fixed provider; product owns feed/recovery policy."
msgstr "[inout] 固定 provider；产品拥有喂狗和恢复策略。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "[in] Requested nominal timeout in maintained range."
msgstr "[in] 所请求的标称超时，须处于已维护范围内。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid ""
"[in] Requested CPU-managed debug-freeze setting; external debugger "
"configuration is outside this request."
msgstr "[in] 请求由 CPU 管理的调试冻结设置；外部调试器配置不属于此请求。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid ""
"[out] Actual timeout bounds and remaining effect, including enabled=true "
"when later setup reports failure after enabling."
msgstr "[out] 实际超时界限及剩余副作用；若启用后后续配置失败，也包括 enabled=true。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED/IO; never claims enabled hardware was "
"disabled during rollback. Existing enable is identified. A provider without "
"CPU debug-control access rejects true with UNSUPPORTED before activation; it"
" neither queries nor changes external debugger control."
msgstr ""
"成功，或返回 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED/IO；绝不声称回滚禁用了已启用的硬件。已有启用状态会被识别。无法由 CPU "
"访问调试控制的提供者在激活前以 UNSUPPORTED 拒绝 true；它既不查询，也不改变外部调试器控制。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "Feed an enabled IWDG without changing product health policy."
msgstr "喂已启用 IWDG，不改变产品健康策略。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "[inout] Fixed enabled provider with one serialized feed owner."
msgstr "[inout] 固定且已启用的 provider，只有一个串行化喂狗所有者。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE; bounded task/IRQ, no allocation."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE；任务/IRQ 中有界，不分配。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "Query current watchdog effect and timeout uncertainty."
msgstr "查询当前看门狗效果与超时不确定性。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "[in] Fixed provider."
msgstr "[in] 固定 provider。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "[out] Current hardware/remembered initialization state."
msgstr "[out] 当前硬件状态或已记忆的初始化状态。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID; UNSUPPORTED retains observed hardware effects with both "
"timeout bounds zero when those bounds cannot be established. Never infer a "
"disabled watchdog from a failed query or unknown timeout."
msgstr ""
"成功或 INVALID；不能确定超时界限时，UNSUPPORTED "
"保留已观测硬件副作用，并将两个超时界限保持为零。绝不能因查询失败或超时未知而推断看门狗已禁用。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "Read latched boot reset causes captured before clearing flags."
msgstr "读取清除标志前捕获的锁存启动复位原因。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "No implicit acknowledgement, reboot or product classification."
msgstr "不隐式确认、不重启，也不作产品分类。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "Bitmask of NX_RESET_*; multiple causes may be reported."
msgstr "NX_RESET_* 位掩码；可同时报告多个原因。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid "Hardware-selected timeout bounds, including declared LSI uncertainty."
msgstr "硬件选定的超时边界，包含声明的 LSI 不确定性。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:362
msgid ""
"A zero minimum and maximum mean the timeout bounds are unknown, for example "
"while hardware shadow updates remain pending or no oscillator limits have "
"been reviewed. The enabled and irreversible facts remain valid. debug_freeze"
" reports the provider-supported firmware configuration. Providers with CPU-"
"readable debug control observe its setting. A provider without CPU debug-"
"control access supports false only; that value does not observe or describe "
"an external debugger's setting."
msgstr ""
"最小值和最大值均为零表示超时边界未知，例如硬件影子寄存器更新尚未完成，或振荡器限制尚未复核。enabled 和 irreversible "
"事实仍然有效。debug_freeze 报告提供者支持的固件配置。能够由 CPU 读取调试控制的提供者会观察该设置。不具备 CPU "
"调试控制访问能力的提供者仅支持 false；该值既未观察，也不描述外部调试器的设置。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:192
msgid "pin_state.h"
msgstr "pin_state.h"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:194
msgid "Explicit static default and sleep pad states."
msgstr "显式静态默认态与睡眠态引脚配置。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:194
msgid "Only explicitly authored GPIO states; no implicit power policy."
msgstr "仅支持显式编写的 GPIO 状态；不隐含电源策略。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:194
msgid "Select one explicitly supported GPIO state without waiting."
msgstr "选择一个明确支持的 GPIO 状态，无需等待。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:194
msgid ""
"Serialized same-CPU privileged Thread with incoming masks clear. No ISR/NMI,"
" competing pad/RCC owner, AF switching, clock transition, wake or retention "
"policy. Partial failure retains the lease; retry an explicit supported "
"target or let the owner perform checked cleanup. This does not prove "
"physical transients, external bias or PCB safety."
msgstr ""
"在同一 CPU 的特权 Thread 上下文中串行调用，进入时中断屏蔽位须已清除。不得从 ISR/NMI 调用，不得有其他 pad/RCC "
"所有者竞争；不支持 AF "
"切换、时钟转换、唤醒或保持策略。部分失败仍保留租约；可重试一个明确支持的目标，或由所有者执行受检查的清理。这不证明物理瞬态、外部偏置或 PCB 安全。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:194
msgid "[in] Exclusive static pad/gate lease, with all writers quiescent."
msgstr "[in] 静态独占 pad/gate 租约，所有写者均已静止。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:194
msgid "[in] Default or sleep; neither name implies electrical safety."
msgstr "[in] 默认态或睡眠态；两种名称均不代表电气安全。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:194
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after actual target readback, or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/ "
"CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/IO while preserving provider ownership."
msgstr ""
"实际读回目标状态后返回 SUCCESS；或在保留 provider 所有权的同时返回 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/ "
"CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/IO。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:194
msgid "One statically owned provider; no discovery or per-register dispatch."
msgstr "一个静态拥有的 provider；不执行发现，也不按寄存器分派。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/reference/api/io.md:194
msgid "Immutable face; provider storage and plans outlive every use."
msgstr "不可变公共接口对象；provider 存储与计划的生命周期须覆盖每次使用。"


msgid ""
"A timing bound can straddle a budget without proving either side."
msgstr ""
"时序界限可能跨越预算，无法证明满足预算或超出预算。"

msgid ""
"Compare a complete timing-error interval with a budget."
msgstr ""
"将完整时序误差区间与预算比较。"

msgid ""
"Pure O(1) Task/IRQ work with no clock access or retention. WITHIN "
"requires upper <= maximum; EXCEEDED requires lower > maximum. An "
"overlapping or unknown error interval gives UNKNOWN. SUCCESS alone does "
"not mean within budget. The existing timestamp-owner/provenance contract"
" applies: this does not extend raw DWT, validate epoch continuity, "
"synchronize sampling, establish IRQ arrival or prove WCET."
msgstr ""
"纯 O(1) Task／IRQ 操作，不访问时钟、不保留引用。WITHIN 要求 upper <= maximum；EXCEEDED 要求 "
"lower > maximum。当 lower <= maximum < upper，或误差界未知时，结果为 UNKNOWN。SUCCESS "
"本身不表示满足预算。既有时间戳 owner／来源合同仍适用：本函数不扩展原始 DWT、不验证 epoch 连续性、不同步采样、不建立 IRQ "
"到达时刻，也不证明 WCET。"

msgid ""
"[in] Stable aligned extended timestamp, causally paired."
msgstr ""
"[in] 稳定且对齐的扩展时间戳，须与另一事实构成因果配对。"

msgid ""
"[in] Stable aligned fact in the same domain/epoch/rate."
msgstr ""
"[in] 同一 domain／epoch／rate 内稳定且对齐的事实。"

msgid ""
"[in] Inclusive maximum, in the stated tick units."
msgstr ""
"[in] 包含边界的最大值，单位为声明的 tick。"

msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/STATE as elapsed, or EXHAUSTED when the "
"uncertainty sum or upper bound cannot fit."
msgstr ""
"与 elapsed 相同的 SUCCESS、INVALID／UNSUPPORTED／STATE；不确定度之和或上界不可表示时返回 "
"EXHAUSTED。"

msgid ""
"Inclusive interval and budget comparison in the stated tick domain."
msgstr ""
"在声明的 tick 域内比较包含边界的区间与预算。"

msgid ""
"lower/upper are usable only when delta.uncertainty_known is true. "
"Otherwise both are zero and verdict is UNKNOWN, never an exact zero."
msgstr ""
"仅当 delta.uncertainty_known 为 true 时 lower／upper 才可使用。否则两者均为零，verdict 为 "
"UNKNOWN，绝不表示精确的零。"


msgid ""
"usb_profile.h"
msgstr ""
"usb_profile.h"

msgid ""
"Selected-only immutable USB facts."
msgstr ""
"仅针对选定实例的不可变 USB 事实。"

msgid ""
"Selection facts are not observed physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"选定事实不构成经实际观测建立的物理资格。"

msgid ""
"Validate exact selected FS facts without observing the controller."
msgstr ""
"校验精确的选定 FS 事实，不观测 controller。"

msgid ""
"[in] Stable readable immutable facts, faces and endpoint array."
msgstr ""
"[in] 稳定、可读且不可变的事实、face 及 endpoint 数组。"

msgid ""
"Success or INVALID, including misaligned public metadata; no allocation,"
" MMIO, discovery or lifecycle effect."
msgstr ""
"成功或 INVALID，公共元数据未对齐也会拒绝；不分配内存，不访问 MMIO，不发现设备，也不影响生命周期。"

msgid ""
"Find a direction in a previously validated immutable profile."
msgstr ""
"在先前已校验的不可变 profile 中查找一个方向。"

msgid ""
"Task/ISR read-only bounded lookup; all input lifetimes remain external."
msgstr ""
"在 Task／ISR 中执行只读有界查找；所有输入的生命周期仍由外部管理。"

msgid ""
"[in] Stable validated selected facts and endpoint array."
msgstr ""
"[in] 稳定、已校验的选定事实及 endpoint 数组。"

msgid ""
"[in] Endpoint number, independent of direction."
msgstr ""
"[in] 与方向独立的 endpoint 编号。"

msgid ""
"[in] IN direction when true; OUT when false."
msgstr ""
"[in] true 表示 IN 方向；false 表示 OUT 方向。"

msgid ""
"Selected stable member or NULL, including misaligned profile/array "
"metadata. No new endpoint can be discovered."
msgstr ""
"返回选定的稳定成员或 NULL；profile／array 元数据未对齐时也返回 NULL。不能发现新 endpoint。"

msgid ""
"Reject one published SETUP epoch by a checked EP0 IN STALL."
msgstr ""
"通过经检查的 EP0 IN STALL 拒绝一个已发布的 SETUP epoch。"

msgid ""
"Same privileged unmasked single task executor. The provider checks its "
"published epoch and performs STALL in one local IRQ critical section, "
"preserving the incoming mask. This excludes an already "
"software-published replacement SETUP; it does not promise atomicity with"
" physical bus packets not yet collected by the IRQ. No cancellation, "
"global stop, allocation, class policy or address commit is implicit."
msgstr ""
"使用同一个特权单 Task 执行者，进入时中断未屏蔽。provider 在同一局部 IRQ 临界区中检查其已发布的 epoch 并执行 "
"STALL，保留进入时的 mask。该保护排除已由软件发布的替代 SETUP；不保证与尚未被 IRQ "
"采集的物理总线包之间的原子性。不隐含取消、全局停止、内存分配、class 策略或地址提交。"

msgid ""
"[in] Stable selected decision face, same controller owner."
msgstr ""
"[in] 稳定的选定 decision face，使用同一个 controller owner。"

msgid ""
"[in] Nonzero software-published SETUP identity to reject."
msgstr ""
"[in] 要拒绝的非零、已由软件发布的 SETUP 身份。"

msgid ""
"Success after guarded STALL readback; STATE for a superseded "
"epoch/closing source, BUSY while either EP0 packet is live, INVALID for "
"malformed metadata, CONTEXT for an invalid executor, IO for failed STALL"
" readback, or UNSUPPORTED without the optional operation. Rejection "
"retains no loan."
msgstr ""
"guard 检查及 STALL 读回成功后返回成功；epoch 已被替代或源正在 closing 时返回 STATE，任一 EP0 packet"
" 仍活动时返回 BUSY，元数据不合法时返回 INVALID，执行者不合法时返回 CONTEXT，STALL 读回失败时返回 "
"IO，未提供可选操作时返回 UNSUPPORTED。拒绝不保留借用。"

msgid ""
"Optional epoch-bound EP0 rejection, separate from generic ops."
msgstr ""
"可选的 epoch 绑定 EP0 拒绝接口，与 generic ops 独立。"

msgid "[in] Current SETUP epoch for EP0, zero for nonzero endpoints."
msgstr "[in] EP0 使用当前 SETUP epoch；非零端点使用零。"

msgid "[in] Desired STALL; clearing bulk/interrupt resets DATA0."
msgstr "[in] 期望的 STALL；清除 bulk/interrupt STALL 时同时复位 DATA0。"

msgid "Task/ISR bounded and read-only. Facts identify selected software support; they never imply PCB routing, VBUS wiring or physical qualification. Public metadata, endpoint arrays, faces and operations tables require their natural C alignment and nonwrapping extents. Numeric rejection is not a probe of arbitrary addresses or opaque private contexts. EP0 selects control/64; nonzero bulk selects 8/16/32/64-byte MPS. Interrupt selects nonzero IN with 1..64-byte MPS. Host polling interval belongs to the external descriptor, not this profile."
msgstr "在 Task／ISR 中有界且只读。事实标识选定的软件支持；绝不表示 PCB 布线、VBUS 接线或物理资格。公共元数据、endpoint 数组、face 及 operations table 须按其 C 类型自然对齐，存储范围不能回绕。数值检查中的拒绝不能用于探测任意地址或不透明的私有 context。 EP0 选择 control/64；非零 bulk 选择 8/16/32/64-byte MPS。interrupt 选择非零 IN，MPS 为 1..64-byte。host 轮询间隔属于外部 descriptor，不属于此 profile。"
